','2025-04-08T12:29:35.751Z','Asked to check few other stay option | Sent accordingly','Priyanka (Sales)'),(4993,'10453','2025-04-08T12:30:24.093Z','Call busy','Priyanka (Sales)'),(4994,'10959','2025-04-08T12:30:38.296Z','[03-04-2025 17:54] +91 95826 18202: Good evening Puspak. Sorry, I have been in back to back calls all day (still am), and could not talk to you. I had a question around the weather in Thailand now. I read it may rain there during the time window I am looking at. So maybe not be the best of the times ? May plan again in November when it’s drier and cooler ? What do you suggest?\n[03-04-2025 19:32] Puspak Das: - Typically monsoon starts from mid-may but yes there maybe some early showers (online weather forecast is showing so).\n- 1st week of May is also a good time to travel but yes it may rain (no can predict whether it\'ll rain or not on that particular day)\n- Yes you can plan in November but rates will slightly be on higher side because the peak season starts from Oct onwards and if you travel now rates will also be slightly cheaper.\n[03-04-2025 21:00] +91 95826 18202: What we will do is we will book early to avoid peak season price hike. Maybe we book around October a month in advance. What do you say? If there is a chance of losing a day due to rain, that is. 25% of the trip lost.\n[07-04-2025 16:23] Puspak Das: Good evening Hemant. \nSo sorry for replying so late.\n[07-04-2025 16:23] Puspak Das: Yes, you can do so.\n[07-04-2025 16:43] +91 95826 18202: No worries, brother. Let’s do a Singapore - Thailand once the weather of better.\n[07-04-2025 16:43] +91 95826 18202: It will be a significant investment for me, so need to maximise the experiences we make\n[07-04-2025 16:47] Puspak Das: Okay, sure.','Puspak Das (Sales)'),(4995,'11056','2025-04-08T12:34:02.725Z','I have Shared the Proposal','Rohit Nargund (Sales)'),(4996,'11051','2025-04-08T12:34:50.963Z','Didn\'t answer the call','Rohit Nargund (Sales)'),(4997,'10998','2025-04-08T12:36:22.090Z