ubai ( City max )\n19th - Abu Dhabi City Tour from Bur Dubai \n20th - Global Village\n21st - Interhotel Transfer to Gevora +  Burj khalifa Evening Slot \n22nd - Dubai City Tour + Desert Safari \n23rd - MOF \n24th - Dhow Cruise \n25th - Drop to Airport DXB \n\n3 people - CDE\n\n18th - Arrival - SHJ to Abu Dhabi (Tryp by Wyndam ) + Emirates Zoo\n19th - Yas Island - 2 Tickets + Transfer\n20th - Interhotel Transfer from Abu Dhabi to Bur Dubai- City max + Global Village\n21st - Interhotel Transfer to Gevora +  Burj Khalifa Evening Slot \n22nd - Dubai City Tour + Desert Safari \n23rd - MOF \n24th - Dhow Cruise \n25th - Drop to Airport DXB \n\n2 people - FG\n\n18th - Arrival - AUH to Abu Dhabi (Tryp by Wyndam ) + Emirates Zoo\n19th - Yas Island - 2 Tickets + Transfer\n20th - Interhotel Transfer from Abu Dhabi to Bur Dubai - city Max  + Global Village\n21st - Interhotel Transfer to Gevora \n22nd - Leisure\n23rd - Leisure\n24th - Dhow Cruise \n25th - Drop to Airport DXB \n\n\nOn 19th - CDE and FG group will go together in same car from Abu Dhabi ((Tryp by Wyndam ) ) to Yas Island for 2 park s and AB group will come from Bur Dubai for Abu Dhabi City Tour Only\nOn 20th - CDE and FG group will do interhotel transfer in same car to City Max (to where AB is staying)\nOn 21st - AB, CDE, FG all from Citymax will get transferred to Gevora \nOn 22nd - Dubai City Tour and Desert Safari will be done by AB and CDE in same car from Gevora\nOn 23rd - MOF will be done by AB and CDE group in same car from Gevora \nOn 24th - Dhow Marina Cruise will be done by AB, CDE and FG group in same car from Gevora\nOn 25th - AB, CDE and FG group all will be transferred to DXB in same car from Gevora','Puspak Das (Sales)'),(18741,'12530','2025-08-21T10:48:18.452Z','Quote sent','Puspak Das (Sales)'),(18742,'12416','2025-08-21T11:55:28.946Z','Called 3 times, no answer. WhatsApp message sent.','Priyanka (Sales)'),(18743,'12442','2025-08-21T11:55:39.168Z','Called 3 times, no answer. WhatsApp message sent.',