s @Flyer\n\n\n\nNote:- SGD 18 Per Person Per Meal only Meal voucher witout transfer ,   Transfer also needed\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks & Regards\n\nAtul Verma\n\n\n\nFrom: Atul Verma (Mr)\nSent: Thursday, June 12, 2025 1:02 PM\nTo: Chaithanya A S <chaithanya.as@funstay.in<mailto:chaithanya.as@funstay.in>>; Ops <ops@funstay.in<mailto:ops@funstay.in>>\nCc: ops1 tdmc <ops1@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops1@travel-dmc.com>>; Sanoj Yadav (Mr) <ops4@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops4@travel-dmc.com>>\nSubject: RE: TDMCAV2871 RE: 11591 | Ravi | Singapore | TDMC | Land Package only\n\n\n\nDear Team,\n\n\n\nBelow are the list of Restaurant\n\n\n\n  *   Balaji Bhawan (Pure Veg.)\n  *   Shivam (Pure Veg.)\n  *   Kalam\n  *   Spice & Grill\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks & Regards\n\nAtul Verma\n\nFrom: Chaithanya A S <chaithanya.as@funstay.in<mailto:chaithanya.as@funstay.in>>\nSent: Thursday, June 12, 2025 12:57 PM\nTo: Atul Verma (Mr) <ops7@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops7@travel-dmc.com>>\nCc: Ops <ops@funstay.in<mailto:ops@funstay.in>>; ops1 tdmc <ops1@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops1@travel-dmc.com>>; Sanoj Yadav (Mr) <ops4@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops4@travel-dmc.com>>\nSubject: Re: TDMCAV2871 RE: 11591 | Ravi | Singapore | TDMC | Land Package only\n\n\n\nDear Atul,\n\n\n\nPlease mention the restuarents along with the set of food provided. The client Does not want Salt and pepper, and particulary wants the name of restuarant and services provided by the restuarant. Please provide the list of restuarants according to the itinerary.\n\n\n\nThank You\n\n\n\nOn Fri, 6 Jun 2025 at 17:28, Atul Verma (Mr) <ops7@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops7@travel-dmc.com>> wrote:\n\nDear team,\n\n\n\n\n\nMeal Cost :-  SGD 18 Per Meal Per Person\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks & Regards\n\nAtul Verma\n\n\n\nFrom: Chaithanya A S <chaithanya.as@funstay.in<mailto:chaithanya.as@funstay.in>>\nSent: Friday, June 6, 2025 5:25 PM\nTo: Atul Verma (Mr) <ops7@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops7@travel-dmc.com>>\nCc: Ops <ops@funstay.in<mailto:ops@funstay.in>>; ops1 tdmc <ops1@travel