oms: 5 Rooms on Double Occupancy\n\nNo of Adults: 10 Adults\n\nOperator: Cosmos Tours \n\nTrip Details:\nhttps://www.cosmosvacations.in/tour/spain-portugal-morocco/6830/?season=2026\n(PDF Attached)\n\n \n\nPackage Cost for the Cosmos Tour per person (considering group of 10 Adults\n) : \n\nUSD 2530  ( Rs 2,20,000/- as per current ROE , however actual INR amount may\nvary at the time of payment as per prevailing ROE)\n\n \n\nAdd On: Trip Insurance: USD 99\n\nTCS on Package: 5% of USD 2530 or USD 126.50 \n\n \n\nFor confirmation of tour, please process and advance of USD 250 + USD 99 =\nUSD 349 or Rs 31,000/-  \n\n( Last date for this is 2nd Sept, however its better to complete it 5 days\nbefore to avoid any last-minute surprises)\n\n \n\nBalance to be paid on or before: 11th Jan 2026 : USD 2530 +USD 99 + USD\n126.50 - USD 349 = USD 2406.50 ( actual INR value will be as per prevailing\nROE on the date of payment)\n\n \n\nAdditional Services not included in above Cosmos Package:\n\n1.	Arrival Transfer on 14th March (Estimate in attached additional info\ndocument)\n2.	Departure Transfer on 29th March (Estimate in attached additional\ninfo document)\n3.	Visa - Schengen & Morocco (Estimate in attached additional info\ndocument)\n4.	Insurance  (Estimate in attached additional info document)\n5.	International Flights (Suggestions in attached additional info\ndocument)\n6.	And add on package post 29th March ( 3N Barcelona Package attached)\n7.	Option Add on Tours during Cosmos Itinerary ( we can also give 3rd\nparty optional tours)\n\nFor eg, Flamenco Show in Seville, there are many theatres - top two being\nTablao Famenco (https://tablaoflamencolassetas.com/) & Teatro Flamenco\n(https://teatroflamencosevilla.com/en)\n\nTickets starts from Euro 22( just for the show)  with  ~Euro 60 for\nTapas+Wine Tasting+ Dessert add on. I would suggest to just see the show at\nTablao and later have tapas and drinks on own.\n\n8.	Any train/bus for travel after Cosmos Itinerary ( Estimate in 3N\nBarcelona Package document)\n\n \n\nTo proceed with confirmation, awe would need passports ( front & back) of\nall guests and PAN cards for guests under whose name TCS is to be filed.\n\n \n\nAwaiting your confirmation, please feel free to revert in case of any\nqueries.\n\n \n\nRegards,\n\nMahim Mehta\n\n+917259222570','2025-08-19 11:47:59',NULL,NULL,NULL,'admin','2025-08-19 11:47:58'),(52,'11576','booking@funstay.in','12110 l Spain, Portugal & Morocco - Cosmos Tour l 14th -29th March 2025 l 10 Adults','Dear Sir,\n\n \n\nGreetings from Funstay and thank you for your interest in Funstay\'s holiday\nservices.\n\n \n\nWith reference to our various discussions regarding your planned trip to\nSpain Portugal & Morocco with Cosmos Tours, I am happy to share our proposal\nand details for the same as shared below,\n\n \n\nTravel Details\n\nStart Date: 14th March 2025\n\nEnd Date: 29th March 2025\n\nCountries Covered: Spain, Portugal & Morocco\n\nNo of Rooms: 5 Rooms on Double Occupancy\n\nNo of Adults: 10 Adults\n\nOperator: Cosmos Tours \n\nTrip Details:\nhttps://www.cosmosvacations.in/tour/spain-portugal-morocco/6830/?season=2026\n(PDF Attached)\n\n \n\nPackage Cost for the Cosmos Tour per person (considering group of 10 Adults\n) : \n\nUSD 2530  ( Rs 2,20,000/- as per current ROE , however actual INR amount may\nvary at the time of payment as per prevailing ROE)\n\n \n\nAdd On: Trip Insurance: USD 99\n\nTCS on Package: 5% of USD 2530 or USD 126.50 \n\n \n\nFor confirmation of tour, please process and advance of USD 250 + USD 99 =\nUSD 349 or Rs 31,000/-  \n\n( Last date for this is 2nd Sept, however its better to complete it 5 days\nbefore to avoid any last-minute surprises)\n\n \n\nBalance to be paid on or before: 11th Jan 2026 : USD 2530 +USD 99 + USD\n126.50 - USD 349 = USD 2406.50 ( actual INR value will be as per prevailing\nROE on the date of payment)\n\n \n\nAdditional Services not included in above Cosmos Package:\n\n1.	Arrival Transfer on 14th March (Estimate in attached additional info\ndocument)\n2.	Departure Transfer on 29th March (Estimate in attached additional\ninfo document)\n3.	Visa - Schengen & Morocco (Estimate in attached additional info\ndocument)\n4.	Insurance  (Estimate in attached additional info document)\n5.	International Flights (Suggestions in attached additional info\ndocument)\n6.	And add on package post 29th March ( 3N Barcelona Package attached)\n7.	Option Add on Tours during Cosmos Itinerary ( we can also give 3rd\nparty optional tours)\n\nFor eg, Flamenco Show in Seville, there are many theatres - top two being\nTablao Famenco (https://tablaoflamencolassetas.com/) & Teatro Flamenco\n(https://teatroflamencosevilla.com/en)\n\nTickets starts from Euro 22( just for the show)  with  ~Euro 60 for\nTapas+Wine Tasting+ Dessert add on. I would suggest to just see the show at\nTablao and later have tapas and drinks on own.\n\n8.	Any train/bus for travel after Cosmos Itinerary ( Estimate in 3N\nBarcelona Package document)\n\n \n\nTo proceed with confirmation, awe would need passports ( front & back) of\nall guests and PAN cards for guests under whose name TCS is to be filed.\n\n \n\nAwaiting your confirmation, please feel free to revert in case of any\nqueries.\n\n \n\nRegards,\n\nMahim Mehta\n\n+917259222570','2025-08-19 11:47:59',NULL,NULL,'37',NULL,'2025-08-19 11:47:58'),(53,'11576','booking@funstay.in','12110 l Spain, Portugal & Morocco - Cosmos Tour l 14th -29th March 2025 l 10 Adults','Dear Sir,\n\n \n\nGreetings from Funstay and thank you for your interest in Funstay\'s holiday\nservices.\n\n \n\nWith reference to our various discussions regarding your planned trip to\nSpain Portugal & Morocco with Cosmos Tours, I am happy to share our proposal\nand details for the same as shared below,\n\n \n\nTravel Details\n\nStart Date: 14th March 2025\n\nEnd Date: 29th March 2025\n\nCountries Covered: Spain, Portugal & Morocco\n\nNo of Rooms: 5 Rooms on Double Occupancy\n\nNo of Adults: 10 Adults\n\nOperator