 awe would need passports ( front & back) of\nall guests and PAN cards for guests under whose name TCS is to be filed.\n\n \n\nAwaiting your confirmation, please feel free to revert in case of any\nqueries.\n\n \n\nRegards,\n\nMahim Mehta\n\n+917259222570','2025-08-19 11:47:59',NULL,'32',NULL,NULL,'2025-08-19 11:47:58'),(54,'11519','priyanka.p@funstay.in','Re: Next Steps: Funstay & Mondee Collaboration','Hi Team\n\nThank you for the kind note. To move things forward, could you please share\nthe package details with us so we can review them and proceed with listing\non our portal? We’re excited to explore a closer collaboration and build\nsomething impactful together.\n\nLooking forward to your response and continuing the conversation.\n\nThanks & Regards\nPriyanka\n\n\n\n\n\nOn Tue, 19 Aug 2025 at 17:52, <mahim.mehta@funstay.in> wrote:\n\n> Looping\n>\n> @ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in <ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in>\n>\n> @Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n>\n> @marketing@funstay.in <marketing@funstay.in>\n>\n>\n>\n> *From:* Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com>\n> *Sent:* 19 August 2025 17:17\n> *To:* mahim.mehta@funstay.in\n> *Cc:* Michelle Iyer <michelle.iyer@mondee.com>; Nikhil Raghavan <\n> nikhil@mondee.com>; Neerzari Marthak <nmarthak@mondee.com>\n> *Subject:* Next Steps: Funstay & Mondee Collaboration\n>\n>\n>\n> Hi Mahim,\n>\n> It was a real pleasure connecting with you. We truly enjoyed walking you\n> through Mondee and the Aarna app, and discussing how Funstay and Mondee can\n> come together. We see a lot of synergy in what you’re building and are\n> excited about the potential of creating something impactful together.\n>\n> Here are the immediate next steps:\n> 1. If you could please review the draft contract (attached) and let us\n> know your feedback.\n> 2. Align on the commercials that work best for both sides.\n> 3. Share some content and products with us, we’d love to put them live on\n> the app and test how Funstay’s offerings can come to life for users.\n>\n> Here are the Aarna app links for easy reference:\n> 📱 iOS – Download here <https://apps.apple.com/in/app/aarna/id6744247518>\n>\n> 🤖 Android – Download here\n> <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.aarnaprod.android&pcampaignid=web_share>\n>\n> As part of Mondee, Inc., a global leader in travel technology, we bring:\n>\n>    - 50M daily searches across platforms\n>    - 125M annual transactions totaling $2.5B in gross sales\n>    - A vast distribution network of leisure travel advisors, gig workers,\n>    airlines, hotels, corporates, and more\n>    - Global presence across India, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Greece, and\n>    Thailand\n>\n>\n> Aarna, Mondee’s B2C brand, caters to:\n>\n>    - Travelers seeking personalized, all-in-one packages for new\n>    destinations\n>    - Locals exploring enriching experiences, from short getaways to\n>    weekend adventures\n>\n>\n> Why *Funstay *& *Aarna *are a Perfect Fit:\n>\n>    - Increased Visibility: Showcase Funstay’s curated travel packages and\n>    deals to a global audience actively searching for unique and affordable\n>    getaways.\n>    - Seamless Integration: Present your offerings with detailed\n>    descriptions, visuals, and pricing for real-time discovery and instant\n>    booking.\n>    - Boosted Bookings: Our AI-powered recommendations and creator\n>    ecosystem connect your packages with the right audience at the right time.\n>\n>\n> We can’t wait to see Funstay’s offerings come alive on Aarna and to start\n> shaping a meaningful partnership. Looking forward to your feedback and\n> moving ahead together.\n>\n>\n>\n> --\n>\n> Best Regards,\n>\n> *Shadaab Qureshi*\n>\n> Manager - Marketing\n>\n>\n>\n> Follow us:\n>\n> <https://bit.ly/44nQJGB> <https://bit.ly/3XyotPw> <https://bit.ly/4424N93>\n> <https://bit.ly/44FV9Jh> <https://bit.ly/3PFFDc5>\n>','2025-08-28 09:12:57',NULL,NULL,NULL,'admin','2025-08-28 09:12:56'),(55,'11519','priyanka.p@funstay.in','Re: Next Steps: Funstay & Monde