\n>\n> This is with regards to our discussion regarding making the car booking\n> arrangements for our team.\n>\n>\n>\n> The itinerary is as follows:\n>\n> *7th Sep -* Pick me up from my home at 2pm (Rich Bouquet Building, 19\n> Hutchins Rd, 2nd Cross, Cooke Town) and then we will goto Pickup the\n> guests from T2 airport (6 bags 28inch Standard size)\n>\n> Take them to hotel for checkin to the hotel Lemon Tree Ulsoor\n>\n> Then some sightseeing in Bengaluru followed by dinner\n>\n>\n>\n> *8th Sep -* Pickup me from my home at 9am and then pickup guests with\n> bags from hotel Lemon Tree Ulsoor (there will be 6 bags 28inch Standard\n> size)\n>\n> Goto Bommasundra Industrial Area (Address: Innvolution Healthcare, Plot\n> No. 143A, Bommasandra Industrial Area, Bengaluru)\n>\n> Leave for T2 airport by 3pm.\n>\n>\n>\n> Based on our discussion, we can book the following:\n>\n>    1. 7th Sep – One Sedan and One Toyota Crysta (without bucket seat)\n>    2. 8th Sep – Need to book 9 seater Toyota Commuter – Please note we\n>    will have around 6 standard size 28inch bags. So trust that it will all fit\n>    in this Toyota Commuter. Please confirm.\n>\n>\n>\n> Please let me know the final charges and you can go ahead with the booking.\n>\n>\n>\n> Thanks and regards,\n>\n>\n>\n> *Rtn. Aria Ohri*\n>\n> *Regional Business Director (South Asia & Southeast Asia)*\n>\n> *MicroPort NeuroScientific Corporation*\n>\n> 1661 Zhangdong Road, Zhangjiang High-tech Park, Pudong New District,\n> Shanghai, PRC\n>\n> Mobile: +91 9833097171\n>\n> Email: Aria.Ohri@microport.com\n>\n> Website: https://microportneuro.com/\n>\n>\n>','2025-09-01 10:16:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,'admin','2025-09-01 10:16:52'),(70,'11576','booking@funstay.in','Re: Car Bookings for MicroPort Shanghai Team (7th & 8th Sep)','Hello Aria,\n\nThanks for the details. Booking is confirmed.\n\nDriver details will be shared 1 day before EOD.\n\nRegards,\nNitin Agrawal\n\n\n\nOn Mon, 1 Sept 2025 at 15:35, Ohri,Aria <Aria.Ohri@microport.