ase find the attached sheet for your reference. If there are any changes\nto be made or if anything doesn’t align with your expectations, please feel\nfree to let me know.\n\nLooking forward to your feedback.\n\nBest regards,\n\nPriyanka\n\n8296659581\n\n\nOn Mon, 22 Sept 2025 at 13:52, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\nwrote:\n\n> Hi Shadaab,\n>\n> Thank you for sending this over. I’ll use it as a reference moving forward.\n>\n> I appreciate your support. I’ll continue sharing the product details as\n> soon as possible.\n>\n> I’ll reach out if I have any questions.\n>\n> Thanks & Regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n> On Wed, 3 Sept 2025 at 17:44, Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com> wrote:\n>\n>> Hi Priyanka,\n>>\n>>\n>> I’ve taken the product details you provided and mapped them into our\n>> Excel format please find the file attached. This can serve as a reference\n>> for you going forward.\n>>\n>> If you have any doubts about this structure, we can always get on a quick\n>> call and discuss. Or, you can continue sharing the product details in the\n>> format you’re comfortable with, and we’ll handle mapping them to our format\n>> and uploading them to our app.\n>>\n>> Looking forward to your thoughts.\n>>\n>> Best regards,\n>> Shadaab\n>>\n>> On Sat, Aug 30, 2025 at 1:13 PM Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n>> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>>\n>>> Hi Shadaab\n>>>\n>>> Please find the attached file containing the itinerary format we\n>>> typically provide to our clients.\n>>>\n>>> Kindly review it and help map it to the Excel format you shared. Once\n>>> finalized, we can use the same structure to populate the rest of the tours\n>>> accordingly\n>>>\n>>> Looking forward to your feedback.\n>>>\n>>> Thanks and regards\n>>>\n>>> Priyanka\n>>>\n>>> On Fri, 29 Aug 2025 at 17:43, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n>>> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>>>\n>>>> Hi Shadaab\n>>>>\n>>>> I have shared a rough format outlining how we list our products in our\n>>>> system. Kindly review the file and curate the columns as needed to align\n>>>> with our current requirements. Your input and assistance in refining this\n>>>> format would be greatly appreciated.\n>>>>\n>>>> Please let me know if you have any questions or need further\n>>>> clarification.\n>>>>\n>>>> Please find the attached file for reference.\n>>>>\n>>>> Thanks and regards\n>>>>\n>>>> Priyanka\n>>>>\n>>>> On Fri, 29 Aug 2025 at 12:09, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n>>>> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>>>>\n>>>>> Hi Shadaab\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Thank you for your email and for sharing the Excel format.\n>>>>>\n>>>>> We’ll review the provided template and begin filling in the required\n>>>>> details shortly. If we find any fields that need clarification or\n>>>>> additional information to be added, we’ll either update the sheet\n>>>>> accordingly or provide the data in a separate format as suggested.\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Appreciate the flexibility and support from your tech team. We’ll aim\n>>>>> to send the completed details soon.\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Thanks & Regards\n>>>>> Priyanka\n>>>>>\n>>>>> On Thu, 28 Aug 2025 at 21:27, Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com>\n>>>>> wrote:\n>>>>>\n>>>>>> Hi Priyanka,\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Thanks for your email. Our tech team has shared an excel format\n>>>>>> (attached) with the fields we require to process and upload Funstay\n>>>>>> products into our system.\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Please feel free to fill in the details as convenient for you. If you\n>>>>>> find any fields missing, irrelevant, or difficult to follow, you can:\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>>    -\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>>    Add additional columns as needed, or\n>>>>>>    -\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>>    Share the information in your own format.\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Our tech team will take care of standardizing and mapping the data\n>>>>>> for upload.\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> For the media (images/videos), you may share them via Google Drive or\n>>>>>> any other method that is convenient for you.\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Looking forward to receiving the details.\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Best regards,\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Shadaab\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> On Thu, Aug 28, 2025 at 4:22 PM Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n>>>>>> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>>> Hi Team,\n>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>> Please disregard the previous email. Could you let us know in which\n>>>>>>> format we should share the packages?\n>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>> Thanks & Regards\n>>>>>>> Priyanka\n>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>> On Thu, 28 Aug 2025 at 14:41, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n>>>>>>> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>> Hi Team\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>> Thank you for the kind note. To move things forward, could you\n>>>>>>>> please share the package details with us so we can review them and proceed\n>>>>>>>> with listing on our portal? We’re excited to explore a closer collaboration\n>>>>>>>> and build something impactful together.\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>> Looking forward to your response and continuing the conversation.\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>> Thanks & Regards\n>>>>>>>> Priyanka\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>> On Tue, 19 Aug 2025 at 17:52, <mahim.mehta@funstay.in> wrote:\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Looping\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> @ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in <ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> @Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> @marketing@funstay.in <marketing@funstay.in>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> *From:* Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com>\n>>>>>>>>> *Sent:* 19 August 2025 17:17\n>>>>>>>>> *To:* mahim.mehta@funstay.in\n>>>>>>>>> *Cc:* Michelle Iyer <michelle.iyer@mondee.com>; Nikhil Raghavan <\n>>>>>>>>> nikhil@mondee.com>; Neerzari Marthak <nmarthak@mondee.com>\n>>>>>>>>> *Subject:* Next Steps: Funstay & Mondee Collaboration\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Hi Mahim,\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> It was a real pleasure connecting with you. We truly enjoyed\n>>>>>>>>> walking you through Mondee and the Aarna app, and discussing how Funstay\n>>>>>>>>> and Mondee can come together. We see a lot of synergy in what you’re\n>>>>>>>>> building and are excited about the potential of creating something\n>>>>>>>>> impactful together.\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Here are the immediate next steps:\n>>>>>>>>> 1. If you could please review the draft contract (attached) and\n>>>>>>>>> let us know your feedback.\n>>>>>>>>> 2. Align on the commercials that work best for both sides.\n>>>>>>>>> 3. Share some content and products with us, we’d love to put them\n>>>>>>>>> live on the app and test how Funstay’s offerings can come to life for users.\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Here are the Aarna app links for easy reference:\n>>>>>>>>> 📱 iOS – Download here\n>>>>>>>>> <https://apps.apple.com/in/app/aarna/id6744247518>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> 🤖 Android – Download here\n>>>>>>>>> <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.aarnaprod.android&pcampaignid=web_share>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> As part of Mondee, Inc., a global leader in travel technology, we\n>>>>>>>>> bring:\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>    - 50M daily searches across platforms\n>>>>>>>>>    - 125M annual transactions totaling $2.5B in gross sales\n>>>>>>>>>    - A vast distribution network of leisure travel advisors, gig\n>>>>>>>>>    workers, airlines, hotels, corporates, and more\n>>>>>>>>>    - Global presence across India, Canada, Mexico, Brazil,\n>>>>>>>>>    Greece, and Thailand\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Aarna, Mondee’s B2C brand, caters to:\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>    - Travelers seeking personalized, all-in-one packages for new\n>>>>>>>>>    destinations\n>>>>>>>>>    - Locals exploring enriching experiences, from short getaways\n>>>>>>>>>    to weekend adventures\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Why *Funstay *& *Aarna *are a Perfect Fit:\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>    - Increased Visibility: Showcase Funstay’s curated travel\n>>>>>>>>>    packages and deals to a global audience actively searching for unique and\n>>>>>>>>>    affordable getaways.\n>>>>>>>>>    - Seamless Integration: Present your offerings with detailed\n>>>>>>>>>    descriptions, visuals, and pricing for real-time discovery and instant\n>>>>>>>>>    booking.\n>>>>>>>>>    - Boosted Bookings: Our AI-powered recommendations and creator\n>>>>>>>>>    ecosystem connect your packages with the right audience at the right time.\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> We can’t wait to see Funstay’s offerings come alive on Aarna and\n>>>>>>>>> to start shaping a meaningful partnership. Looking forward to your feedback\n>>>>>>>>> and moving ahead together.\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> --\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Best Regards,\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> *Shadaab Qureshi*\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Manager - Marketing\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> Follow us:\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>> <https://bit.ly/44nQJGB> <https://bit.ly/3XyotPw>\n>>>>>>>>> <https://bit.ly/4424N93> <https://bit.ly/44FV9Jh>\n>>>>>>>>> <https://bit.ly/3PFFDc5>\n>>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>>>\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> --\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Best Regards,\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> *Shadaab Qureshi*\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Manager - Marketing\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> [image:\n>>>>>> https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/X2FEU051AgbBreGz6xWS17tV5uYFGJiAzX1JgazAwVF1zDuGbSMS8fIyovy3pGlN81mqKpEQ2uDCRsj4mufjbdjAe3V1UJgdvhqncKTNNV6Wu5igFQZGE_I56ikf2rHDKl-kuK5avNJY7K1SMjTl60U]\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Follow us:\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> [image:\n>>>>>> https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/SJj3to7Aydn8v1zUsIJ05UUmeBpT2VcFPYfu99X2yYoYnTOaEc65i33u3PTsYMN2iv3EzuVpgkZW78W5RS4mSggsGR3ZBOSbKRMACnugqTrC9UcSn0y7Y_FTTMvZpS3n6J-OH_RWss7GO_kWD6XtYDc]\n>>>>>> <https://bit.ly/44nQJGB>[image:\n>>>>>> https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2GSig7RQAVnrkekHn2UQBzaMhNY6QDPdb_6Bl5YuEPHzEQlnNGUUQlzc6pBqEYgAR56Sh_JGLm17yF2T4cqrU-vsr3W-YEB0uefrHz2lfo3BsXDNRp_YCpTiRN_-91YTEVqxxek3bCv82Upulo72jbg]\n>>>>>> <https://bit.ly/3XyotPw>[image:\n>>>>>> https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/6pabAZWUo8OfxqAHIePSf42BTAellZysJg-89erqc_DdCRCbIIATsvnyMDYEkYvZ_F5NDCKflYomf1rncPgK-_dMXqFDHtNrz4J3wdvXQGCgLUWRX793yrgXkvl4UgvZKMe8XG0hl3XtxamgFLRAdmA]\n>>>>>> <https://bit.ly/4424N93>[image:\n>>>>>> https://lh3.googleuserconte