ce they are live. For now, we’ll keep them\n> inactive until you confirm.\n>\n> To create Funstay business profile on the app, we’ll need the following\n> details and documents:\n>\n> *Bank Details*\n>\n>    1. *Beneficiary Name*\n>    2. *Bank Name*\n>    3. *Branch Name*\n>    4. *Account Number*\n>    5. *IFSC Code*\n>    6. *Cancelled Cheque (JPG/PNG)*\n>\n>\n> *Business Details*\n>\n>    1. *Copy of GST Certificate (if applicable)*\n>    2. *Copy of PAN Certificate*\n>    3. *PAN Number*\n>    4. *Business Name*\n>    5. *Business Address*\n>    6. *Business Industry*\n>    7. *Registration Number / CIN / TIN / EIN / License ID*\n>    8. *Company Logo (JPG/PNG)*\n>    9. *Business Email*\n>    10. *Phone Number*\n>\n>\n> Once we have these, we’ll be able to set up your profile and proceed with\n> uploading your experiences.\n> Looking forward to your response.\n>\n> Best regards,\n> Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> On Wed, Sep 24, 2025 at 1:00 PM Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> Please find the attached sheet for your reference. If there are any\n> changes to be made or if anything doesn’t align with your expectations,\n> please feel free to let me know.\n>\n> Looking forward to your feedback.\n>\n> Best regards,\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n> 8296659581\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n> On Mon, 22 Sept 2025 at 13:52, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Shadaab,\n>\n>\n>\n> Thank you for sending this over. I’ll use it as a reference moving forward.\n>\n> I appreciate your support. I’ll continue sharing the product details as\n> soon as possible.\n>\n> I’ll reach out if I have any questions.\n>\n> Thanks & Regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n> On Wed, 3 Sept 2025 at 17:44, Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Priyanka,\n>\n> I’ve taken the product details you provided and mapped them into our Excel\n> format please find the file attached. This can serve as a reference for you\n> going forward.\n>\n> If you have any doubts about this structure, we can always get on a quick\n> call and discuss. Or, you can continue sharing the product details in the\n> format you’re comfortable with, and we’ll handle mapping them to our format\n> and uploading them to our app.\n>\n> Looking forward to your thoughts.\n>\n> Best regards,\n> Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> On Sat, Aug 30, 2025 at 1:13 PM Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> Please find the attached file containing the itinerary format we typically\n> provide to our clients.\n>\n>\n>\n> Kindly review it and help map it to the Excel format you shared. Once\n> finalized, we can use the same structure to populate the rest of the tours\n> accordingly\n>\n> Looking forward to your feedback.\n>\n> Thanks and regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n> On Fri, 29 Aug 2025 at 17:43, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> I have shared a rough format outlining how we list our products in our\n> system. Kindly review the file and curate the columns as needed to align\n> with our current requirements. Your input and assistance in refining this\n> format would be greatly appreciated.\n>\n> Please let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification.\n>\n> Please find the attached file for reference.\n>\n> Thanks and regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n> On Fri, 29 Aug 2025 at 12:09, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> Thank you for your email and for sharing the Excel format.\n>\n>\n>\n> We’ll review the provided template and begin filling in the required\n> details shortly. If we find any fields that need clarification or\n> additional information to be added, we’ll either update the sheet\n> accordingly or provide the data in a separate format as suggested.\n>\n>\n>\n> Appreciate the flexibility and support from your tech team. We’ll aim to\n> send the completed details soon.\n>\n>\n>\n> Thanks & Regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n> On Thu, 28 Aug 2025 at 21:27, Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Priyanka,\n>\n> Thanks for your email. Our tech team has shared an excel format (attached)\n> with the fields we require to process and upload Funstay products into our\n> system.\n>\n> Please feel free to fill in the details as convenient for you. If you find\n> any fields missing, irrelevant, or difficult to follow, you can:\n>\n>    - Add additional columns as needed, or\n>    - Share the information in your own format.\n>\n> Our tech team will take care of standardizing and mapping the data for\n> upload.\n>\n> For the media (images/videos), you may share them via Google Drive or any\n> other method that is convenient for you.\n>\n> Looking forward to receiving the details.\n>\n>\n>\n> Best regards,\n>\n> Shadaab\n>\n>\n>\n> On Thu, Aug 28, 2025 at 4:22 PM Priyanka Ponnamma AP <\n> priyanka.p@funstay.in> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Team,\n>\n>\n>\n> Please disregard the previous email. Could you let us know in which format\n> we should share the packages?\n>\n>\n>\n> Thanks & Regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n> On Thu, 28 Aug 2025 at 14:41, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n> wrote:\n>\n> Hi Team\n>\n>\n>\n> Thank you for the kind note. To move things forward, could you please\n> share the package details with us so we can review them and proceed with\n> listing on our portal? We’re excited to explore a closer collaboration and\n> build something impactful together.\n>\n>\n>\n> Looking forward to your response and continuing the conversation.\n>\n>\n>\n> Thanks & Regards\n>\n> Priyanka\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n> On Tue, 19 Aug 2025 at 17:52, <mahim.mehta@funstay.in> wrote:\n>\n> Looping\n>\n> @ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in <ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in>\n>\n> @Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n>\n> @marketing@funstay.in <marketing@funstay.in>\n>\n>\n>\n> *From:* Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com>\n> *Sent:* 19 August 2025 17:17