nated from outside of the organization. Do not click on links or open attachments unless you recognize content is safe. Please report suspicious emails here<mailto:it@turningpointdxb.com>\n\nHi Team,\n\n\n\nPlease confirm the package with the two Abu Dhabi transfers and share the final cost\nNote: Customer will be directly paid in Dubai\n\n\n\nRegards,\n\nJai chandra\n\nAssociate- Sales & Operations\n\nPh: +91- 8296248084\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn Thu, 25 Sept 2025 at 19:17, Sarah <southres@turningpointdxb.com<mailto:southres@turningpointdxb.com>> wrote:\n\nDear Sir,\n\n\n\nThank you for considering Turning Point Tourism for your below query. Based on your requirements, we have outlined the following proposal for your kind consideration and approval.\n\n\n\nOur understanding of your need based on your request is that you require tour package details inclusive of below services:\n\n\n\nArrival Date\n\n 29th Sep\n\nDeparture Date\n\n03rd Oct\n\nTotal Nights\n\n02\n\nNationality\n\nIndian\n\nNo. of Adults\n\n05\n\nNo. of Child (Age)\n\n03(11,4,6 Years)\n\nValidity\n\nThe below quote is valid for next 24 Hours, and subject to change at the time of actual booking and final confirmation, we do not guarantee on the same.\n\n\n\n\n\nGround Handling Services\n\nAdult\n\nChild(11Years)\n\nChild(6,4Years)\n\nPer Person (USD)\n\n          79\n\n          79\n\n          59\n\n\n\nGround Handing Tours & Services includes:\n\n\n\n  *   Arrival Dubai Airport (Terminal-1,2,3) transfers (upgraded to Private)\n  *   Burj Khalifa 124th and 125th Floor (Prime Time) with Entrance Tickets (Child between 3 to 8 Yrs. Old will be charged Child rate and above 8 Yrs. old shall be charged adult rate)\n  *   Inter Hotel Transfer from Dubai Hotels to Abu Dhabi Hotels\n  *   All other Sightseeing and Tours and Transfers on Private basis\n  *   5% VAT Inclusive in the above cost\n\n\n\nOPTIONAL COST:\n\nDeparture Transfer from Abu Dhabi Hotels to Abu Dhabi Airport @USD 10/- PER PAX [4 PAX]\n\n\n\n\n\nBest Regards,\n\n[cid:image034.png@01DC3DEE.3D2B4930]\n\n[cid:image032.png@01DC3DEE.3D2B4930][cid:image033.png@01DC3DEE.3D2B4930][Line]\n\n   Sarah Sabuwala\n   Reservation Executive – South India\n\n     M: +916292023790 | T: +971 42958903\n     Al Garhoud Business Center, Office No. 119,\n\n     Near GGICO Metro Station (Al Garhoud)\n\n     P O Box 55107, Dubai\n\n[Instagram icon]<https://instagram.com/turning_point_tourism>[Facebook icon]<https://www.facebook.com/turningpointdxb>[LinkedIn icon]<https://www.linkedin.com/company/turning-point-tourism-llc/>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Jai Chandra <jai.chandra@funstay.in<mailto:jai.chandra@funstay.in>>\nSent: 25 September 2025 16:29\nTo: Ramakrishna <ramakrishna@turningpointdxb.com<mailto:ramakrishna@turningpointdxb.com>>; Surya Kameswara <southsales6@turningpointdxb.com<mailto:southsales6@turningpointdxb.com>>; Sarah <southres@turningpointdxb.com<mailto:southres@turningpointdxb.com>>\nCc: ops@funtay.in<mailto:ops@funtay.in>\nSubject: 12600 l 2N3D Dazzling Dubai l Devkinandan Kabra l 5 Adults 3 Children l 29 Sept - 1 Oct 2025\n\n\n\nCaution: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click on links or open attachments unless you recognize content is safe. Please report suspicious emails here<mailto:it@turningpointdxb.com>\n\nDear Team,\n\n\n\nGreetings from Funstay!\n\nHope this email finds you well.\n\n\n\nWe request you to send a quote for the following requirements\n\n\n\nTRAVEL DETAILS\n\nArrival Date: 29th-Sep-2025\n\nDeparture Date: 03 Oct 2025\n\nNo of Nights: 2N3D\n\nNo of Guests: 5 Adults, 3 Children\n\nNo of Rooms: 3 Rooms\n\nMeal Plan: Breakfast Included\n\n\n\nTOUR ITINERARY\n\n\n\nDay 1(29-Sep-25): Airport pick up for (5 Adults, 3 Children), Hilton Dubai the walk\n\n(17:30 Burj Khalifa, 124th-125th) Prime Time. (PVT)\n\n\n\nDay 2(30-Sep-25): leisure\n\n\n\nDay 3(01-Oct-25): Transfer to Abu Dhabi Hilton Yas Island, Abu Dhabi\n\n\n\nDay 4(02-Oct-25): Leisure\n\n\n\nDay 5(03-Oct-25): Airport Drop Off Abu Dhabi for 4 Pax\n\n\n\nDay 6(04-Oct-25): Airport Drop Off Abu Dhabi 4 Pax\n\n\n\nTRANSFERS\n\nAirport Pick up & Drop Off on Private\n\nRemaining all other transfers on Private Basis\n\n\n\nNote: Please share the optional per-person cost for Yas Island, one day, one park for Adult & Child\n\n\n\nRegards,\n\nJai chandra\n\nAssociate- Sales & Operations\n\nPh: +91- 8296248084','2025-10-15 11:10:35',NULL,'32',NULL,NULL,'2025-10-15 11:10:36'),(97,'11576','booking@funstay.in','Booking ID 12977 l Century Real Estate Holdings Private Limited l Sri Lanka 7th -9th Nov 2025 l 37 Adults','Dear Jay,\n\n \n\nGreetings from Funstay and thank you for your interest in Funstay\'s travel\nservices.\n\n \n\nWith reference to our discussions, we are pleased to confirm ground services\nas below for your upcoming trip to Sri Lanka.\n\n \n\nTRAVEL DETAILS\n\nNo of Adults: 37 \n\nArrival Date: 7th Nov 2025, 6E 1167 arriving at 11:30 Hrs at Colombo Airport\n\nDeparture Date: 9th Nov 2025, 6E 1184 departing at 20:55 Hrs from Colombo\nAirport\n\n \n\nItinerary:\n\n7th Nov 2025: Arrival at Colombo and transfer to hotel (The Fortress Galle\n-self booked) in Galle. Rest of the evening is at leisure.\n\n8th Nov 2025: Day at Leisure\n\n9th Nov 2025: Transfer from Galle Hotel ( Coach reporting time 08:00 Hrs) to\nLotus Tower Colombo with enroute photo stops are Galle Sea Face &\nIndependence Square. Lotus Tower observation deck visit, followed by buffet\nlunch at Blue Orbit Restaurant at Lotus Tower. Post Lunch, visit Gangarama\ntemple  and colombo museum ( photo stop if time permits) and drop to\nairport.\n\n \n\nInclusions:\n\n45-Seater coach for transfers and city tour\n\nEnglish speaking driver + assistant\n\nNational guide - English speaking  ( only for Colombo city ) \n\nEntrance Tickets - Lotus Tower , Gangarama Temple \n\nBuffet Lunch at Blue Orbit Restaurant at Lotus Tower\n\n2 water bottle per person each day,\n\nToll charges\n\nArrival / Departure assistance\n\nGovernment taxes\n\n \n\nExclusions\n\nAirfare\n\nSri Lanka ETA Assistance \n\nAccommodation\n\nAny meals and beverages except those mentioned in inclusions above\n\nAnything else not specifically mentioned above\n\n \n\nPACKAGE COST( for 37 Adults) : Rs 2,72,000 + 5% GST + 2.5% Convenience Fees\nfor Credit Card Payment\n\nInvoice for the same is attached herein with the mail. You can pay using the\nlink : https://rzp.io/rzp/RqENPYlT\n\n \n\nHope the above is in order and as per our discussions. Please feel free to\nrevert in case of any queries or doubts.\n\n \n\nRegards,\n\nMahim Mehta\n\n+917259222570','2025-10-29 12:09:04',NULL,NULL,NULL,'admin','2025-10-29 12:09:03'),(98,'11576','booking@funstay.in','Booking ID 12977 l Century Real Estate Holdings Private Limited l Sri Lanka 7th -9th Nov 2025 l 37 Adults','Dear Jay,\n\n \n\nGreetings from Funstay and thank you for your interest in Funstay\'s travel\nservices.\n\n \n\nWith reference to our discussions, we are pleased to confirm ground services\nas below for your upcoming trip to Sri Lanka.\n\n \n\nTRAVEL DETAILS\n\nNo of Adults: 37 \n\nArrival Date: 7th Nov 2025, 6E 1167 arriving at 11:30 Hrs at Colombo Airport\n\nDeparture Date: 9th Nov 2025, 6E 1184 departing at 20:55 Hrs from Colombo\nAirport\n\n \n\nItinerary:\n\n7th Nov 2025: Arrival at Colombo and transfer to hotel (The Fortress Galle\n-self booked) in Galle. Rest of the evening is at leisure.\n\n8th Nov 2025: Day at Leisure\n\n9th Nov 2025: Transfer from Galle Hotel ( Coach reporting time 08:00 Hrs) to\nLotus Tower Colombo with enroute photo stops are Galle Sea Face &\nIndependence Square. Lotus Tower observation deck visit, followed by buffet\nlunch at Blue Orbit Restaurant at Lotus Tower. Post Lunch, visit Gangarama\ntemple  and colombo museum ( photo stop if time permits) and drop to\nairport.\n\n \n\nInclusions:\n\n45-Seater coach for transfers and city tour\n\nEnglish speaking driver + assistant\n\nNational guide - English speaking  ( only for Colombo city ) \n\nEntra