und-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sky Helix @ Rs 1000/- per Adults &amp; Rs 1000/- per Child</em></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4D Adventureland- 2 Rides @ Rs 1800/- per Adults &amp; Rs 1600/- per Child</em></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4D Adventureland – 4 in 1 @ Rs 2800/- per Adults &amp; Rs 2200/- per Child</em></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">With Universal Studios Tour</span></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Express Pass @ Rs 5500/- per Adult &amp; Rs 5500/- per Child</em></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SIC to Private Upgrade @ Rs 2000/- per vehicle per way</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 17,200/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXehomIN84FBD6h8VeHkY9ZQhuf9cNUr7-m2RpGz_Qk6hULB_5a18sSTAYC0wJ3w9NF4k0xdhpBSteNw6uY3L22n9GcxUYuhmQrA9MHNTtC73Vq0ShmH-HFCDMQCxaTsAEW02F9hFYfu0SAzIUZnOlc?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" height=\"188\" width=\"601\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any travel insurance (recommended but not mandatory)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT SINGAPORE, PICK UP TRANSFER, GARDENS BY THE BAY&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Singapore- The Lion City!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On your arrival at Singapore, meet and greet at airport and get dropped to your hotel.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-in (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">check -in time is 3PM, early check in is subject to availability and at sole discretion of hotel</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">) and have lunch (at your own cost) and rest for a while.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd5M-l11nNU4G-bPj4AB2qGBh7d5_m1s8I3mMBMg4UgmoqOhd24a9YbxvHyEykB5cPGZRRZYsE5sBmaUs1qthRcnpxokmXQFwT3cBdl_pq-6KH49mue2DWUJmXkcgWm1mg3DVaDVBGdg3TGK4P28tM?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" height=\"332.28594661339383\" width=\"715\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in evening around 4PM, proceed to Gardens By the Bay, Singapore’s iconic botanical garden featuring the Flower Dome, Supergroove Tree, Garden Rhapsody (7:45 Show) and often regarded as the number one attraction of Singapore.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Optional Add On: Cloud Forest, OCBC Skywalk, Floral Fantasy (</em><em style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">refer to optional supplement)</em></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and time at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: SINGAPORE CITY TOUR, HALF DAY SENTOSA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, start with a Half Day City tour showcasing the history and culture of Singapore. This tour will bring guests to various attractions that depict the city’s multiracial orientations. While our city-tour gives you an up-close view of attractions like Merlion Park, China Town as well as the Singapore Flyer </span><em style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(optional add on at additional cost, refer to optional supplement)</em><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">allows you to soak up the incomparable sights over the skyline of the city-state during your 30-minute flight aboard Asia’s biggest observation wheel. Drop back to hotel and some time for lunch (at own cost) and rest.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd8Mhs2iTPr3h1mxyzXSBXFZjZAr7NVSjthN8vVlzqsmSQmIml4vwpbAAlMIlVEKdIC1oG82-jPtEZW-T9jjkSt_4S5PRdyo9xmLm2B3A7iIvmwu7o5Q_aTOakz9U8IcEEoy51U7vqLGfEw2i_hxQ?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" height=\"375.744262674143\" width=\"705\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the afternoon at 2PM, proceed to experience wonderful Sentosa Islands starting with a cable ride from Mount Faber Park to Sentosa </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">and appreciate the marvellous beauty surrounding the region. Upon reaching Sentosa, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">explore the many fun filled attractions at Sentosa (check inclusions for attractions included in the package, any additional attraction tickets can be purchased on spot at additional charge) and spend some time at leisure at one of its beaches. Later in the evening drop back to hotel and rest of night at leisure.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfO-SZTBaoqWEMXzcplcDLtj_U_Cr_bBu0t9wY210a9muh2zFiYwyQ9QEJLrjmj4MuDkXOXs_OKSxKgUvIh2mEz9rn-SL-mLufyz3hPBDfox1u7HNpfaWEhKbAkh3024hf1rLfHkYzM1qrbqZ8GYg?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" alt=\"A picture containing resort\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"234\" width=\"709\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: UNIVERSAL STUDIOS SINGAPORE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After Breakfast, proceed for a day of fun and frolic at The Universal Studios Singapore – enjoy the many adventurous rides and attractions spread across 6 different themes.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Do not miss to try Transformers 3-D ride, thrilling roller coaster among other </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Adrenaline-pumping rides, interactive shows and a wide variety of exciting attractions based on the blockbuster movies and television series you know and love so well awaits you at the first and only Universal Studios theme park in Asia.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the evening around 7 PM, return to the hotel and overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdvAtRQTHseXMyKr4BTh7P_i-tm69Ondxul9mAZn2sTDwv9xIApy81t8UG2dWMs84gWhSyD6ywJNjN_lploPqBjFgQT7unPGvklXFxPoojVyPIyTIumOSppFMCCdd_03GKNSYWb5HbWo2XeL8-X5WM?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" height=\"330.2159957614066\" width=\"709\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: SINGAPORE ZOO &amp; RIVER WONDERS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, today after breakfast proceed to Singapore Zoo around 11Am. Packed into 28 hectares of Singapore Zoo are over 3500 resident animals that freely roam in spacious enclosures, representing their natural habitat. With a tram ride inclusive of commentary, you can explore its five diverse zones: Australian Outback, Frozen Tandura, Fragile Forest, Reptile Garden, and Wild Africa, and meet over 300 distinct and rare species of animals including polar bear, African wild dog, kangaroo, Komodo dragon, Aldabra Giant Tortoise and highly venomous oriental whipsnake. After the trip time for lunch (at own cost).</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeQWCACqOF-443pxOFLDPauhcdL2Fe077wFpGTSwMiCwMNRHzpfTtJcdM4mk7a9ssJ9_rgm31bK7966uqdMaAgY7vCFyKCd7irLmLr1J057CjgSKL6aP0sDD1-pkcUqC3FMYEd76ZHVnbPL8arNcHw?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" alt=\"A group of monkeys sitting on a tree branch\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with medium confidence\" height=\"358.53269537480065\" width=\"717\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later around 4PM, proceed for the date with the Singapore Wildlife reserves starting with the River Wonders for a unique exploration of flora and fauna, themed around the popular freshwater rivers in the world. Boasting the exclusivity of being the only wildlife park in Asia based on the river system, a visit to River Park which comes under the Wildlife Reserves Singapore would absolutely live up to your expectations. From giant otter and giant stingray to alligator gar, Chinese salamander, and Mekong catfish, it gives you access to the habitats of iconic rivers, such as Amazon, River Nile, Mississippi, Yangtze River, Mekong River, and Tundra. You can also enjoy Amazon River Quest Boat Ride as part of this tour.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdLiJbBR-TAE8QQjm8wz5F3T6Y0wsCPM_zxiOixj5Z0Cf4_3G6L_4pTj6uGZS_JihQ-QH_8BRVZHBQOM9tAHWuDwz7XU-t6hF4ZoFQYtgHLvEU4TCK_-5ygtlQ88qbd0WgWpYBGUUtiSR93a3rBh6I?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" alt=\"A group of people in a boat\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with medium confidence\" height=\"471.4460822830563\" width=\"703\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceed to airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA INFORMATION</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Indian nationals require Visa for visiting Singapore. Documents needed for Visa processing are,</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Original Passport with validity for 6 months from the intended date of arrival in Singapore.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2 Recently clicked photographs with the specification 35x45mm, white background, 80% face coverage, matt finished. (Notes: - Kindly don’t wear a white colour shirt)</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa application form (14A) should be filled out thoroughly and signatures should be done with the same ink.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A Personal Covering letter (Intended/Confirmed Travel Date, Number of passengers travelling together along with the Applicant’s Name as per Passport &amp; Passport Number, Duration of Stay, Main Applicant’s Email Id and Contact Number, Details of last visits to Singapore – If Any).</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Original Ticket Itinerary</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Confirm hotel voucher.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If employed, proof such as Salary Slips for the last 3 months, Employee Identity Card.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If Self-employed, proof such as Covering letter on the Business Letter, Company Registration Copy, and Company ITR for last 2 years, Visiting Card (Name &amp; Contact number mentioned on it).</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Updated bank statement for last 3 months.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If the applicant is a minor traveling with the parents, the signature of both the parent is required on the application form. If the applicant is a minor traveling with a single parent, a NOC letter from another parent is required with the signature and the relationship proof attached.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p><ol><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">We process Visa applications 15 days before travel date.</em><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;</span></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Original Passports, Photographs, Filled Up Form along with other required documents are to be handed over in person or via courier to our Visa Partners offices either in Bengaluru, Delhi, Mumbai, or Chennai depending on place of Passport issuance. Please note that we do not provide home pick up service.&nbsp;</em></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Typically, Visa processing takes 2-5 working days post submission of all documents. However, this is just an indicative timeline and actual time may vary.</em></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Granting of Visa is solely at the discretion of Singapore High Commission/Consulate and application of Visa doesn’t guarantee grant of Visa.</em></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable, 3.5% for Amex &amp; International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner Sankash</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfpgOqVIKDtM63FVqFE3EmJodeYVy1cKni3VGuN6rlJvAPuKqFm9uI9aQRGVTZtcG4gZBDp08vvgtcOAogcT56jqyPkxQsliFyf1XhRIVaE1a3a6LU5fcKtasRT61UkQ_UbcKNhLPNYKKrjIfxxA-E?key=8Qkf8eDHLDhtuujwJ7U9tg\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"87\" width=\"91\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 2,500 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 15 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Standard Check in Time is 3PM and Check out time is 12 PM. Early check in &amp; late check out would be subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The itinerary is tentative, the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in trip, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with local Govt guidelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-05-31 07:28:47','sent','<fa865633-ab01-1977-a091-f1134c0f198a@funstay.in>','11546',1,'jai.chandra@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(12,NULL,'priyanka.p@funstay.in','Test','<p>Hi Preethi,</p><p><br></p><p>Please find the Singapore Package Details attached.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-05-31 11:42:16','sent','<10c31961-f9bc-2b7b-7be5-61ab4e4636af@funstay.in>','11519',1,'priyanka.p@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(13,NULL,'puspak.das@funstay.in','Test','<p>Test</p>',NULL,'2025-06-04 09:00:34','sent','<91c4db40-3cbb-14a3-bcad-5332cf1da850@funstay.in>','11576',1,'puspak.das@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(14,NULL,'booking@funstay.in','Test','<p>Test</p>',NULL,'2025-06-04 09:00:37','sent','<b161eb3b-22d9-90f3-19b1-300f233e3250@funstay.in>','11576',1,'puspak.das@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(15,NULL,'vijayan@live.in','11570 l Amazing Abu Dhabi l Vijayan l 2 Adults 1 Child l 22 Sep - 25 Sep','<p>Please see the attached document below.</p>',NULL,'2025-06-04 09:42:38','sent','<92a96a97-df75-204b-9102-85e1b854ab8a@funstay.in>','11570',1,'jai.chandra@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(16,NULL,'vijayan@live.in','New Message','<p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-06-04 09:42:48','sent','<6ebec74c-df30-2bc9-5fc8-40a4b86ba58f@funstay.in>','11570',1,'jai.chandra@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(17,NULL,'manitejavadnala@gmail.com','Hello','<p>hhhh</p>',NULL,'2025-06-05 04:06:48','sent','<7d