egment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews on&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Vietnam as below,</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 21-10-2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 03-11-2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 13N14D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guests: 02 Adults 2 Children (5yrs, 8yrs)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST (FOR ALL TRAVELLERS): INR 3,10,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL, ROOMS &amp; MEAL PLAN (4 STAR)</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1N Halong Bay: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Amanda Cruise/ Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2N Hanoi: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hanoi Marvellous Hotel &amp; Spa, Family Suite with City View/ Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2N Sapa: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sapa Highland Resort &amp; Spa, Deluxe Triple Room/ Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3N Danang: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sala Danang Beach Hotel, Family Suite with Panoramic View/ Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2N Hochiminh City: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cicilia Saigon, Family Room/ Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3N Phu Quoc: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vinholidays Fiesta Phu Quoc, Family Room/ Similar</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All Tours &amp; Transfers on Sharing Basis</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Single entry tourist visa (E-Visa)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Halong Bay Overnight Cruise</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hanoi City Tour</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ninh Bing Day Tour</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Fansipan &amp; Cat Cat Village</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Coconut Village Tour with Basket Boat Ride</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hoi An Ancient Town Tour&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SonTra &amp; Marble Mountains tour&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bana Hills - One Day Ticket</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hochiminh City Tour&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cuchi Tunnel Tour</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Grand World Phu Quoc (Use Shuttle Service)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vinpearl Safari + Zoo Tram (Use Shuttle Service)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sunset Town (Kiss of the Sea Show + Kiss Bridge Ticket)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vinwonders (VinWonders) - (Use Shuttle Service)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4 Island tour by speedboat with lunch at shared transfers</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs.65,000 /- per person, however it will be</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">booked on the actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcDj7P_18M73ot8PJELzs0c7u8-o0r7lQGJ7sNbgucxFqTNamgFPQB8YU9ij8QeYPkcLjEpPkWvYVu2OZ6KZhGPxi3oaFoCeTJzCsQsW-3jB9rFhSPK7xemcT9GP9lnXow_5_WnL0alSuUvhD20j0o?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"43\" width=\"245\"> <img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdMZk6BGeI-2LJ-M1r_wXz6EeRoP9URu-aXS3XK7Fx3TEy8CwEiHHPwKWmh-6Acu9uCwA_8aP8s3UjuBE7C0XGqFfuhWStupeWA5hwjBYWxUmWxSqSBuIWVAedsiG8wHLGfTJ9O0uT95yBWbro8zQ?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"50\" width=\"248\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe0Qv3tQYR1uD_Os2l1FB76_XZi1HTdPXhQwIeF1XZlvghnLR-WU6HgT8cisT2CAWU890JpDirqDfW4d1M2nxsi-TtZ7XfwmWvPjZDLnWQNjAdnKHiZZDY9rWnCEgNeHDBg2Ah-xhorsjWFtVGaRPc?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"40\" width=\"234\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc5HofxjSJBB_eBOTpwoYK8zVv6oVl4_-2lhIc791Q8QfhGEAYY7hMvW2ugWvMwlj2rTvZblI2XIyCeR8nQcGGjYVV2JSEewsntoKq7pPy2aF5G-HEVuWrsoN2BRLjosWkOcC4tJBYBjshgbOS1oeU?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"44\" width=\"263\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfnucgAFU8zIixFQfARKNi30vOXOMXbAnOjmEG-344Aty7fqOQnHzmfvGU_Ey8fd7YYgUJaiyMtz0GuytUOBZZ3Utwuut4lHyHXmOAE84FGYe1rAUhQLVSiaq_IJ4Ar2kCTyhXiDbj37g_D4BZg52c?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"41\" width=\"242\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Insurance&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5% GST</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL IN HANOI |&nbsp; HA LONG BAY OVERNIGHT CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Hanoi!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After arrival in Noi Bai International Airport proceed to immigration counter after completing you immigration proceed to collect your baggage from the luggage area &amp; proceed towards exit. Meet with your driver at the lobby after meeting the driver proceed to to Ha Long Bay. Upon arrival at Tuan Chua Pier at Ha Long, you will board your boat for a wonderful cruise on the emerald, green waters of Ha Long Bay among the 3,000 spectacular limestone islands with a fabulous international lunch served on board. Then it is your pleasure time for swimming and sunbathing. Overnight at the cruise.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfdwUK4FyXcqcSQlKGH4KY9BV2xoZYle0FzYVW64kJL3rVxtXbIgVqShZdPjs5lz7UxtuMvHAtC9YPuVoaf7Y2hkIty-uTsT_AQd7Pzjw42lslEkcFqZOLmSLBhzDnbEmhVg-PahURLZ1nsk8_pYA?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A group of boats in the water with Ha Long Bay in the background\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"391.8607261669082\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: HANOI CITY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After Breakfast, transfer to the Hanoi Hotel. Check-in, rest for some time and then start for the city tour. In the afternoon, proceed for Hanoi City Tour through the Old Quarter to enjoy the bustling local life, then cap off the day with a show at the water puppet theatre - a uniquely northern Vietnamese art form depicting scenes of rural life and episodes of national history. Overnight in your hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXesg3u3JMYxFmj7JYcBczG8p_jBpsoHqX3SNFBYFPzaIGCaZoM4AsP03g7jAlVjuKeywTeGPUSmDXiXf1FgqYVMamTbumhJKEF2LTW6zfpnuDchbZF4Hv_eEjyBVJno_9iMRuv_lqX7nFI_Yj_09w?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A street with people and bicycles and trees\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"400.8700497941721\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: NINH BINH DAY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast at hotel, enjoy a 2.5-hour drive to Ninh Binh province will bring you to Hoa Lu ancient capital. This was the first centralized feudal state in Vietnam at the end of the 10th century. The ravages of time have destroyed the ancient citadel but some vestiges including King Dinh and King Le worship temples still stand to this day among the rice paddies and are a worthwhile visit to get a glimpse of the ancient Vietnamese past.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdZstzz9hX0302dmTjYL-psWClILe2nL-NwuJrqhPw08GAT8ukibewJhcQmcYD7YGn_m4T1rRu-Wat5MQIKr-LuA8aXxSmHkycRdqPuUARxjGQJFYkX8TXMd1KqDdMc2ySOom0VwGTwAJ4YhID2CnQ?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"206\" width=\"605\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then enjoy the boat trip on the emerald water of Trang An Complex to discover the caves. Trang An Landscape Complex is a spectacular landscape of limestone karst peaks permeated with valleys, many of them partly submerged and surrounded by steep, almost vertical cliffs. Trang An is recognized as the World Cultural and Natural Heritage site.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfnxSu7DQt-U4fuiPhwgQtTGK8ETuYg6MsafTfVXmNVP_PkClgcarID8gYugb7Cq3oSQ-Y4vFFmzwB-oIBXjhn2ed2b6c0leYqIK2mVIn5KznbMtO-RvkhMHQ5qRz0BY89FsQvO6EqQOS_zLNzqCmU?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"Best Ninh Binh Tours &amp; Tickets - Book Now\" height=\"399.93523316062175\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the afternoon, visit Bai Dinh Pagoda – the largest pagoda complex in Vietnam! Get on an electric buggy to get deeper into the complex. Take a few steps to reach the main building and the tower overlooking the Red River Delta.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then, go to the famous Mua Cave and climb up the dragon mountain (about 500 steps) to enjoy one of the most amazing and famous view of Vietnam. With this Mua Cave Tour, you will have the chance to discover Tam Coc from the sky. Mua Cave and the dragon mountain are now the most popular attractions in Vietnam. If you would like to get a memorable souvenir of your trip in Vietnam, you should climb up the dragon mountain and take a nice shot at the top.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfoXeBZbXfdH35pZUiQKR_YhbPJWDWNUocQ09czfbQqJCBpNCAOLIUTZiephdBTamRWWwRcKF5oNoJvfO15fpUboCaV6Rbhcu8g-TFEuZ9nMNCwO0foF0xIX8Mg3oY7Fhkh3PboNXiPfxlxPiiczMA?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"Tam Coc Hoa Lu &amp; Mua Caves Full-Day Trip with Transfers\" height=\"376.0777838928637\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After that, drive back to Ha Noi and overnight at a hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: TRANSFER TO SAPA FROM HANOI</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast in the hotel. Start the day with early morning pick up (06:30 – 07:00AM) by limousine shuttle van (joined group van) and Transfer to Sapa (around 05 - hour drive). Upon arrival, check in at the hotel (early check in is subject to the availability of the service). Rest of the evening you are free to walk around this hill station which is home to Vietnam’s highest peak.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXefLXiqn5Lr3iJ9fCYq8m0YyeBq_G7M9YwY-FiqzGAOwrPz1Lu4xohWAU8UNKME13kWPeKtoz3ZvtICvvmGNhCUs1u-VsIfIqIT6chg8CiCPCcAw9IjEglzjTuX_q0kD4UPoBYx1Zv9CAgjlkM7yQ?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"348.9910512443875\" width=\"604\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: SAPA | VISIT FANSIPAN &amp; CAT CAT VILLAGE WITH LUNCH</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast,Transfer to city center take a train to the cable station to explore the Fansipan</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mountain - “the Roof of Indochina”, where you will be able to enjoy the breathtaking view of</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">the whole Sapa.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe5uuCkV1CqrDxEr6X3yWu--GmhIZTqRnAyUBXle1Sl3SNxcoSVtF8SU9KBKTb-kvXDo4eeF-nmVio0flHvU3VerNlaJw8yq2vQNwp4dBl91b3hCGre2RTkPlvN9BsNT-RfAZJRXydTLwUeA-DxF1w?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A statue on a hill\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"329.66807952986466\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Afternoon, transfer to visit Cat Cat village home to the H\'mong hill tribes minority peoples. As you walk to the villages nestled in the valley below Sapa, you will meet some of the local minority people on their way to and from Sapa. You have the opportunity to share cultural experiences with the families that live in the area. Back to the hotel. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: TRANSFER FROM SAPA TO HANOI | FLIGHT TO DANANG</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast in the hotel, check out and proceed to Hanoi airport for your flight back to Danang. After arrival at Danang, transfer to Danang Hotel, check in and rest of the day is at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7:&nbsp; DA NANG CITY TOUR | COCONUT VILLAGE TOUR | HOI AN ANCIENT TOWN TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">proceed for the Danang City Tour. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Marble Mountains are a cluster of five marble and limestone mountains which are named after the five elements. Stone steps carved into the mountain lead to a Buddhist Pagoda. You can also discover stunning caves and enjoy the beautiful view from the mountain top. Next, you will go to Am Phu Cave where there is a replica of “Heaven and Hell”, Marble Mountains are also home to Non Nuoc Stone Carving Village, which is a unique craft village. Situated at the foot of the Marble Mountains, this craft village has a proud history covering more than 200 years.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdnde1UK_lyuRdvTUpGO0xeQrVDIn-0LoCCpXaexoE3atu3CMd8ydWsC_qygP2o0q3Xq2a1Mjek2WT_8JvK8kXI8KvHjdkx-uIg0kq1cZbl5YjGoMatZez-U4Jsn1aLEYgdtwaoUh6dEu5RgIZB8uQ?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A bridge over water with a city in the background\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"206.64618821558224\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We will head north to visit the Son Tra Peninsula. It is 693-meter high above sea level and 10-kilometer from the center of Da Nang City to the North-East. Pay a visit to Son Tra Linh Ung Pagoda, considered one of the biggest pagodas in Da Nang City. The most striking feature of this vast pagoda is its huge Lady Buddha statue, which is one of the tallest in Vietnam and spectacularly dominates the skyline. You can contemplate the whole city, Son Tra peninsula as well as the Marble Mountains along with white sand-bank. The beautiful landscape creates a unique impression that you cannot find in other places.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then proceed for the Coconut Village Tour- Basket Boat ride, followed by Hoi An Ancient Town Tour.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Transfer to the dock. Take a wooden boat transferring to Cam Thanh water coconut village. Learn about the daily life of Vietnamese fishermen, their families and their community. Board on boat and commence cruising on the Cua Dai River.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe_q2FUFhJuRqMFtO1i1DInIoTZXnkmebXzPNxsz176-RTj3XJTgwrWGafmYI1D-DRoIvVckP8cPt8lPvgzNtWc2kiPeQcMz5TGsBvGcB4y_TS1gUscEvpT-mCrv9ilYd9-EGOQRXtqKs7HApMRc3U?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"401.553647567315\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then, visit Hoi An ancient town, declared a World Cultural Heritage Site by UNESCO in late 1999 at your own pace. You could walk around to visit the ancient structures comprising Japanese Covered Bridge, residential houses, ancient pagodas, etc. then visit colorful markets, shops selling silk lanterns, paintings and high-quality clothes, handicraft men at work and buy unique hand-made souvenirs. Take a boat trip along the Thu Bon river </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(at your own cost) </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">in the evening. Overnight at the hotel in Danang.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdiNTfPXoezyl_5UNrAGH1hMGjbF9zVqdlQDyoFvdNCV2Oz1uI6ZlgpvTaeNQd3K_paIbbgWXtkURipxOcNq3BIJybwgorJ1DD5dklWY0-sf9ixjldrs6XF4-824DU-jfgwlgHjBMMRr_4x7mmNbg4?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A boat with people on it in the water with floating lanterns\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"399.3636695058496\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 8: BA NA HILLS &amp; GOLDEN BRIDGE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast today, join a full-day tour of Ba Na Hills and Golden Bridge. Ascend the mountains of Ba Na Hills on one of the world\'s longest and highest cable car rides. Feel like you’re on a Parisian</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">holiday when you visit Le Jardin D\'amour and the famed French Village. Cross the 150m</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Golden Bridge, an iconic architectural marvel that provides a breathtaking view of the Sea.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete your day with a stop at Fantasy Park, dubbed as one of the most modern indoor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">game centers in Asia (entrance fee on your expense if any). Back to the hotel in Hanoi, evening free at leisure. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfGesEJJ7OHYsBPi74F4jT_zSLIg9Z5pZ905oQk69DYFAcJ8fb6Am75WRW_MhXc7QlApWE7abYnw4nwZFmfa_84LVqU4Et-RK8-4e2CgBd01350j0CcWhS186MiqBP5oF61-Aw4T4RvBiiCMyV2CKI?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A bridge with a hand shaped bridge and a road\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"326.83713376522064\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 9: HCMC ARRIVAL | HALF DAY CITY TOUR&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at the airport transfer to your hotel. Check-in and then after lunch proceed to the city tour.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfPg4Wodac9JdoqBFFzv74-Q_zoKoscg8zl_hIT2ob1h_fWZfSCItyJZ5tudMxll-wyYkf6fc5Hiv4MtjlL7QYxHm0kDxOfnvBdo1CeLza4IEKWDQO6xYmGj_GbYlqoPNzMOGDGPfR98UNr4l2IoXc?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"400.910410127843\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 10: CU CHI TUNNEL TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a half day tour of Cu Chi Tunnels. The tunnel complex was initially started in 1948 to protect the Viet Cong guerrillas from the French air and ground sweeps. The tunnels also served as communication routes, storage facilities for food and weapon caches as well as hospitals and living quarters for guerrilla fighters throughout the American war. A visit to the underground villages will provide a better understanding of the tunnels’ history, the hardship of life underground and the Vietnamese resilience during combat. Transfer back to Saigo.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXccjNJXu3pWQpzYOgx8c0oT25ughJbP4tSSNjJd3WKumELIvDc0gwt71JgsCnsWF-WZEF4pR4yZw0WyTxDpK1pT1vRfT_BuioE-FjT8EqWJPt64yWVXsKl6ZNyp6bgVzAcOpUM08EG6EB0SLzAzuOE?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"A group of people watching a person lifting a rock\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"339.4018149363595\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 11: ARRIVAL AT PHU QUOC | GRAND WORLD PHU QUOC</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at the airport and after clearing the immigrations and customs, meet and greet and embark on your comfortable car for transferring to your hotel. Check In and then proceed to Grand World Phu Quoc.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Grand World Phu Quoc</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Known as the \"Sleepless City,\" Grand World Phu Quoc is a vibrant entertainment and cultural complex that comes alive, especially at night. Visitors can enjoy a range of activities, including shopping, dining, and witnessing cultural shows that showcase Vietnam\'s rich heritage. The area is also home to the Teddy Bear Museum and \"The Quintessence of Vietnam\" area, offering unique cultural experiences.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfG5VlLwp0W4LkFB0FWxUvdDPOnu5Z9nWsUOMYIueFMgCXfbOZuJXfgoBzNpl7RtC2D1H91dSV4rQduyC81MbtaBK3Dq413vCyF3KZLawaq0x0WFdkqKdcOkmrLrNh53M_iKGU7x0fxM6_xY6TfLw?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"333.8288276939357\" width=\"602\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 12: VINPEARL SAFARI PHU QUOC | SUNSET TOWN WITH KISS BRIDGE &amp; KISS OF SEA SHOW</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, proceed to Vinpearl Safari Phu Quoc.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vinpearl Safari Phu Quoc</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vinpearl Safari is Vietnam\'s largest wildlife conservation park, home to over 150 animal species and more than 400 plant varieties. Visitors can explore the Safari Park via a guided bus tour, observing animals like Bengal tigers, lions, white rhinoceroses, and leopards roaming in a semi-wild environment. The park also offers engaging activities such as animal feeding and the Kidzoo program, where children can learn about animal care.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc0P-qTVR5c6EVAexIUntvGr8ROG8BiN75VATsHk7bumTisWiTYQoBTIv1Ka8E4QOK-Qzh6WTcrepwUAqS4kz8D005o2TwcUjjYUXkKYlbP8EcDg-XA2Daynt-qocjYWJhqzFbYmsOIguC3N7iJ5Q?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"315.75623618566465\" width=\"602\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the evening, proceed to Sunset Town to enjoy a unique outdoor performance program combining water music performance and multimedia art with unprecedented technology and scale in the world. Hear the story of Sunset Town - the new symbol of Pearl Island with a deep, natural storytelling. Immerse yourself in unlimited visual effects through 3 projection domes and extremely vivid light and water effects.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcVf7lDv8h_uLAd9OYkX_wCnWtAL1fAEdEyjxgmla_lwSv9xQdpFgCDc6L46J5ylLd_8emdAh8j6Rv3YIWUiqXvzAvs-o7fZyBVDe8LiSMzdoxImslQ6ieLiVYxpt5ky-rPU492G6IBugDBe2_KNw?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"316.43517617917496\" width=\"602\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 13: VINWONDERS PHU QUOC</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed to VinWonders Phu Quoc.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VinWonders Phu Quoc</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VinWonders is a vast theme park divided into multiple themed zones, each offering a variety of thrilling rides, water attractions, and live performances. It\'s designed to cater to all ages, providing a fun-filled day of entertainment and adventure.​</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe1ZbRzZ3EHxyDGVRIf_6r7Gs2zLg2b5QhNtRbmmSqrqLCGEYIWMiCLjjPfZDANgrp_ToxoYoE8N2esPbqYTUjt27E8sgYfrQsm2rYlN799oscLWVfTFB4wUU7H5U3T2WQnEFq-nFRjjmVllj-sK6Y?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"362.850867080082\" width=\"602\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 14: 4 ISLAND TOUR BY SPEEDBOAT WITH LUNCH&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, pick up from your hotel and proceed for a thrilling tour by speedboat around Phu Quoc’s finest island destinations! Arrive at An Thoi Harbor and speed along crystalline waters as you journey to the first stop of the day - Pineapple Island. Test out your fishing skills and try to catch a snapper, a kingfish, or even a large cobia! Travel next to Fingernail Island and bask in the exotic ambiance of a tropical paradise where you can enjoy sunbathing and swimming in warm, clear waters. Continue your dip in the ocean with an exciting snorkelling adventure on Dam Ngang Island.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXerM014kWc-CsTjb4rbEnAgn7mkrasI2xRISXO5xYfn-_lZn29pxfZp3NyEGPM5luusI5rA2xc9hkwLnGkM-NvFpgcI055xaT6i6EtFP0tHHXbYSErAsY2jbDbPBenmvZ2axKw8d2UyuBFil3eC-NE?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" height=\"400.98254344810397\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Discover new depths underwater where marine life thrives in vibrant colors. Dock next on May Rut Island and grab a delicious Thai lunch consisting of steamed shrimps, sautéed sweet and sour squid, fresh fruits, and more! Make the most out of your free time and explore the privately-owned island famous for its genuine Vietnamese island life experience. By 16:00, the tour ends with a ride back to the harbor followed by your safe return to the hotel. Overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 15: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast the day is at leisure. Later transfer to the airport for your flight back home.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Indian nationals can get e-Visa for Vietnam,&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital Photo (Not Scan, 4x6 cm)</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Clear Scan of Passport</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Address in India&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Phone No. &amp; Email id:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">a. We process Visa applications 15 days before the travel date.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">b. Typically, Visa processing takes 3-5 working days post-submission of all documents. However, this is just an indicative timeline and actual time may vary.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">c. Granting of Visa is solely at the discretion of Vietnam Immigration Authorities and application of Visa doesn’t guarantee grant of Visa.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost&nbsp;+ 5% TCS + 5% GST</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable, 3.5% for Amex &amp; International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner Sankash</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdkZqUTvl2jqPlcjVVok9cnNv30edHSe2Uj8kdKF78TVk9pOISgMR12UY9t5gisWdOWKbEKvtLFyZBiAQgjmU2UkjhJXpdxeeGA9AAf7xljkIB73vXt-zeDF0S7bUARem4ogcB5ICjqJ900WfiHWEM?key=T2IWtpKS6kL5fzulCP1qtA\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"79\" width=\"89\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 3000 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 15 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Standard Check in Time is 3PM and Check out time is 12 PM. Early check in &amp; late check out would be subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The itinerary is tentative, the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in trip, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with local Govt guidelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol>',NULL,'2025-07-02 07:22:07','sent','<f0555fcd-1a0c-d9d6-8fc9-e83fe1cd81dd@funstay.in>','11762',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(41,NULL,'puspak.das@funstay.in','Re: 11180 | Maria | Phuket | Ramada By Wyndham','Hi Sasiwan,\n\nLet me check with guest and get back.\n\nThank You!\n\n\nRegards,\n\nPuspak Das\n\nSenior Associate - Sales & Operations\n\nPh: 8296494654\n\nDISCLAIMER: This communication is confidential and may be legally privileged. If you are not the intended recipient; (i) please do not read or disclose to others, (ii) please notify the sender by reply mail, and (iii) please delete this communication from your system.\n\nFunstay Services Private Limited\n\n1192/1, 22nd Cross, 24th Main, HSR Layout Sector 2, Bengaluru - 560102\n\nPhone:   +918287039039, E-Mail: booking@funstay.in\n\nwww.funstay.in<http://www.funstay.in/>\n\n________________________________\nFrom: Sasiwan Warndee <ados.clusterphuket@deevanahotels.com>\nSent: Wednesday, July 2, 2025 7:54 AM\nTo: \'Chaithanya A S\' <chaithanya.as@funstay.in>\nCc: sweta.nanda@funstay.in <sweta.nanda@funstay.in>; puspak.das@funstay.in <puspak.das@funstay.in>\nSubject: RE: 11180 | Maria | Phuket | Ramada By Wyndham\n\n\nDear Khun Chaithanya,\n\nMay I follow up the menu? Please confirm within TODAY because It will be concerned with ingratiates order from chef. However, if later than all menus will be recommended by our chef.\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\nSasiwan Warndee Ms. | Cluster Assistant Director Of Sales\n\nDeevana Hotels and Resorts  | Patong Beach Phuket\n\n\n\nT +66 7630 2100 | M +66 8139 68130  [FB] <https://www.facebook