st in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Vietnam as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 17th July 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 22nd July 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 5N6D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1 Rooms&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4 STAR LAND PACKAGE COST: INR 1,05,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3N Hanoi: Hanoi Pearl Hotel, Romance Classic with Breakfast</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2N Danang: Sala Da Nang, Superior Double Room with City View with Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">5 STAR LAND PACKAGE COST: INR 1,30,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3N Hanoi: Apricot Hotel, Deluxe Sketch with Breakfast</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2N Danang: DLG Hotel Danang, Executive Suite - Ocean Front with Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per the selected option</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISAS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vietnam Single Entry e-Visa</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOURS &amp; TRANSFERS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All Airport Transfers on Private basis</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hanoi City Tour on Private Basis&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ninh Binh Day Tour on SIC Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Halong Bay Day Cruise on SIC basis</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Coconut Village Tour with Basket Boat Ride &amp; Hoi An Ancient Town Tour on SIC basis</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bana Hills on SIC Basis</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </strong><em style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is approx. Rs 40,000/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</em></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfgLGoOOu3LjYSICueWRkR9Z6hVtOL4qP_s09B1MV8CPyI7wuguXQhiaMbzVRLOfYiz6jypIg97l9HnXvxmbzoMhPjrP5xcSFa5ByYGaQTEcBLbO8od3oFJ0Ss13Fl-oqLcEpA_24fP4HJCF1qMbg?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" height=\"46\" width=\"286\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeIa8fu4eLDI0mMCqjjPEcYWzZWFX_hkRY1NF93ZW7NMchjRjfnE8HUV4bmZxt9r9wDYmwsHIoJGNBH16dNCVuEAEoyqynCHyYTiVwRYTssdibfBoP45t8ZG-zIaCtxQkh3wWuuxFI5jmDYdRzrPSo?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" height=\"50\" width=\"261\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfQsm7xs5ISBoelSYzWKGX7A1juj1kodl1jlHSJyrD2KMRQ27UVwMUOk1YF3AcNH1kD8KqaveRw2u6z2hh6oQRrVD2ymB7N4p5-gkwaEFiB5c8wNvGre8R2oeW7nBfu_i7s9wDEeSK-QyYeHhpcvGA?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" height=\"50\" width=\"262\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges, water sports or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT HANOI | HANOI CITY TOUR </strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at the airport and after clearing the immigration and customs, transfer to Ha Nai Hotel. Check-in. </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(check -in time is 3PM, early check-in is subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel) </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">and have lunch (at your own cost) and rest for a while.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the evening, proceed for 2 hr City tour of the Old Quarters, Hoan Kiem Lake, St Joseph Cathedral, Train Street. Drop back to the hotel.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfChtgL8v6cHYJpLTpWWpF5Dt0-1PLPZJN2-8WZEDW8zea8Utl2MJR_2GApsSBNqBGiqB8W7DIRnjkVjJkOa-ps3gB3fcC7ielBMLVU1GWK6WRgOcPz9AMe0oaukUtlcfKN45pzMO_8ivEJkLINgg?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" height=\"350.55285703293066\" width=\"349\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXftzksOdnBM0MP4cmSuuTNJX5a4q3cN-rSE6p8grMCNM4cXqJjB9dM1Rl-WL_qKty1Z-XfwhRlOSz8czb03NEHbeKbHvowG0xSghMTJgCSyV4sDk40q4nXuEB4QnGBqmxh6g0aRmjjp2dlAjE7BJtw?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" height=\"239\" width=\"349\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: HALONG BAY DAY CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, transfer to Halong bay. Upon arrival at Tuan Chua Pier at Ha Long, you will board your boat for a wonderful cruise on the emerald green waters of Ha Long Bay among the 3,000 spectacular limestone islands with a fabulous seafood lunch served on board. Then it is your pleasure time for swimming and sunbathing. And overnight on board.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXff789xHlU7o6piKciZe6zdAKlbXRLlfThzyt2qL5XNyb72p1f-l521u9c0y5OqKl2S5gLuc6c_JwTdC5K5b6jUwLboPgKbErJW51gv74CELakngef2CyVA7ix116QAl0Py4qnshzopF-ZpXlATbqQ?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"A group of boats in the water with Ha Long Bay in the background\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"472.1015360405049\" width=\"723\"></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">NINH BINH DAY TOUR – TRANG AN BOAT RIDE WITH LOCAL LUNCH</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast at the hotel, enjoy a 2.5-hour drive to Ninh Binh province will bring you to Hoa Lu ancient capital. This was the first centralized feudal state in Vietnam at the end of the 10th century. The ravages of time have destroyed the ancient citadel but some vestiges including King Dinh and King Le worship temples still stand to this day among the rice paddies and are a worthwhile visit to get a glimpse of the ancient Vietnamese past.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcsNEYSxcH6MtP2640xyWsZceu0FpMUpMoQTzf0Z4xWzgRZJcvvQVMc_YAi4YbVLgIWtypl9j2i1CnIe-7AXqCdiE1i_ZjZOo1hErccYz9ER2cOsZ8pheQEFJSD_jCiE_wKh322ku7G9V3pTkvQK5U?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"A stone bridge with a red banner\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"247\" width=\"723\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then enjoy the boat trip on the emerald water of Trang An Complex to discover the caves. Trang An Landscape Complex is a spectacular landscape of limestone karst peaks permeated with valleys, many of them partly submerged and surrounded by steep, almost vertical cliffs. Trang An is recognized as a World Cultural and Natural Heritage site.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcyYe0KGBkNhvvtKeOhyDvl5mwyQs43wE9bdWz1CK1bqSENIdzyp3FuPm1Ix9k92KlYgSd9psdA6R1kXHvcF8EibatE8EL3CnXA6zqf5oFS9-x4tZA63jm73j0nSCRLrs0-ypVwq--59PH0aUDiqw?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"A boat on a river with mountains and trees\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"236\" width=\"355\"> <img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcaTz7ubjGT-m3gogE1yEPQRYwVLUsSIrXrDagG4Jg6O1NYOBdrji1DcYSDwSQFoZdnd_AAwQ1ipGBXMrOWnZ1TlXveTCH5fVWhlabzlrbKkhxVxHR-nqeopSJxVrZeSsN7ikjTVX14JSVCFKDEeMc?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"A dragon statue on a mountain\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"235\" width=\"353\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then, go to the famous Mua Cave and climb up the dragon mountain (about 500 steps) to enjoy one of the most amazing and famous views of Vietnam. With this Mua Cave Tour, you will have the chance to discover Tam Coc from the sky. Mua Cave and the dragon mountain are now the most popular attractions in Vietnam. After that, drive back to Ha Noi and stayed overnight at a hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: TRANSFER TO DANANG | COCONUT VILLAGE TOUR | HOI AN ANCIENT TOWN TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, check out and transfer to the airport for the flight to Danang. Upon arrival at Danang, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">have lunch (at your own cost) and proceed to the hotel. Check-in and have lunch (on your own).</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Around 3PM proceed for the Coconut Village Tour- Basket Boat ride, followed by Hoi An Ancient Town Tour.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Transfer to the dock. Take a wooden boat transferring to Cam Thanh water coconut village. Learn about the daily life of Vietnamese fishermen, their families and their community. Board on boat and commence cruising on the Cua Dai River.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then, visit Hoi An ancient town, declared a World Cultural Heritage Site by UNESCO in late 1999 at your own pace. You could walk around to visit the ancient structures comprising Japanese Covered Bridge, residential houses, ancient pagodas, etc. then visit colorful markets, shops selling silk lanterns, paintings and high-quality clothes, handicraft men at work and buy unique hand-made souvenirs. Take a boat trip along the Thu Bon river (at your own cost) in the evening.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-in at the hotel and overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeLUJbKNg_hktFb4Gpu61KYUvJHl_7GzZ4pHMbFXsvyXN2zYMqLzNc1bhsYaag8YxhbVam_MQ3nVcPJOvko-6o7-zsYNqlvRCj_cHR1RoX_VsUZz-2VGQ2_Oku-tcHAVZ9I9ehh9oivYdTrY1tCePQ?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"A boat with people on it in the water with floating lanterns\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"478.975862519413\" width=\"719\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: BA NA HILLS &amp; GOLDEN BRIDGE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast today, join a full-day tour of Ba Na Hills and Golden Bridge. Ascend the mountains of Ba Na Hills on one of the world\'s longest and highest cable car rides. Feel like you’re on a Parisian holiday when you visit Le Jardin D\'amour and the famed French Village. Cross the 150m Golden Bridge, an iconic architectural marvel that provides a breathtaking view of the Sea. Complete your day with a stop at Fantasy Park, dubbed as one of the most modern indoor game centers in Asia (entrance fee on your expense if any). Back to the hotel in Danang, evening free at leisure. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXddztAgTgIFkP_8nTcvXYJffcRYknSWIj0-yl7u7atQO5fFrK1-PY5BpvoqfBTOwC_5Wb5EOg3i17TiwiKxadyHwye6QOfEy5_fxYm4B6-nkm3GqkgO-N_784vnS9U9OWGHv9TvcDNNmQuY81cm0w?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"A bridge with a hand shaped bridge and a road\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"389.16420905414856\" width=\"718\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DEPARTURE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, checkout and transfer to the airport for your flight back home.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Indian nationals can get e-Visa for Vietnam,&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital Photo (Not Scan, 4x6 cm)</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Clear Scan of Passport</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Address in India, Phone No &amp; Email id</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Flight:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% at the time of confirmation</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Land:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Payments can be made via an electronic transfer to the account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner Finzy,&nbsp;check your eligibility &amp; terms here:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://finzy.com/borrow?channel-partner-id=5c94cc885c0e50767c0f3dce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>EMI</strong></a></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd8VQ9jquafRuCFdQI4oRcoi6tCQKB97GDPkMqqE7H5SltsqlNWWxACh-AHnF7p04UhGWjcMiAjKqXN6BVBiF8uu7FUPR7F2Kmz_LCYrgXAQvcycOt5eM4vF_te69yYe7etmmNlAus7lJqKNVpTkQ?key=n9GxcRrbMxtINgIdD4DWxw\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"79\" width=\"82\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Flight:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy &amp; fare conditions</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Land Package:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If canceled on or before 31 days from the date of travel: 10% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If canceled on or before 21 days from the date of travel: 50% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If canceled on or within 21 days from the date of travel: 100% of package cost (non-refundable)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. All prices are quoted in INR based on current ROE. In case of a major change in ROE the rates may be revised.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2. The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. We reserve the right to use alternative accommodation, sightseeing tours and transfer of equal or higher standard.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. We are not responsible for any missed breakfast due to flight or tour timings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. No refunds either in part or full will be made for any unused services in the above package like ground transportation, meals, accommodation, sightseeing tours.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. We are not responsible for any excess baggage charges on tour.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. We reserve the right to change any information, route or attractions before or after your booking due to events beyond our control like bad weather, any natural calamity, any accident, and or any logistic issues.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Vouchers will be released 48 hours after we receive the full payments / 07 days prior to the departure.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10. Charges, if any, for any RT PCR test are to be paid directly.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">11. Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">12. In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-07-02 11:05:27','sent','<3a185d32-df8e-06b3-7f8a-c18b59dcaea1@funstay.in>','11857',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(44,NULL,'richa87talreja@gmail.com','Funstay I 5N Hong Kong-Macau l Ms Richa l 11865','<p>Dear Richa,</p><p><br></p><p>Greetings from Funstay!</p><p><br></p><p>As per your requirement, we are pleased to share the details of your Hong Kongtrip for your reference. Kindly go through the attachment</p><p><br></p><p>Please feel free to let us know if you\'d like any changes — we’d be happy to assist.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Regards,</p><p>Ruchi Sarangi</p><p>+918861947272</p><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: transparent;\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/vDUemoN9I_DCp26YLp5O30MimS33IR7llNyWgb8vZpDehOxwVVPrcuhcQ8h6gJT8sXbPU2B30zxBecfslV1V3gXHGU_rxT93LLUyLMzDq1Q28vB-kZC813dznyI-4wt5m3u-ETUE\" alt=\"A picture containing text, clipart, vector graphics\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"36\" width=\"36\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: transparent;\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/TSAT5zgkba3QH8eHp41hpMbM2pnbqI0f_lJgzSmF-EbMJUeJHX-HqMwDuUomZmXLnN03rYFtEyKXpJEMynglrZaj26FoE3xp7Q_NaXPn9zxkAL2EDbjL9VJHwniceI9TG-MlNfWz\" alt=\"Icon\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"35\" width=\"35\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: transparent;\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/F3afwerleSjNjERb3LzPdIlnWFEKdN7YV_G5GH3tDEAQ9yjtLyDJRvB8Cj5XLZyKFdgyL5kgpZydeHFcuOzBVxfCZRonWv2TX8D45n9b1lqwRZqTnBo2zGp-62e31sNy_P3CfuZF\" alt=\"Icon\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"34\" width=\"34\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: transparent;\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/PVjlhw5jzHovNYikM-6ST9BCDqZ6vwUIcw0gXvBryS_02-447LscWwdR4hDSKT2r8Ci__7Mw1lhcqjFHO29NlKNDma7CGvXH5jfehoj2ta_yEXkIFah9r18ztM8J2ndx40gPUwF-\" alt=\"Icon\r\n\r\nDes