       [https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc7cvvkO8TTpqncd5BbqWtyJVy6IG6ulr0LetBhj6yUcVjC1Io7fKuV9pN_-ebcxfHW7J5sktjujdFWPZPKU4OFiOVVaMATN5u5w8WCsA4641q4kun83jNmHQy1aEmv2pGZiU88ZQ?key=8gU8MVcP3dueUEd0n1h9UTIk]               [https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc5ZgAEC7zhqsuR4iTuVOCXh_orY_7zyrxOvRfHKm1NBA5egwoW849vBBbuKEY3ykGqL6QLZnfBDACRE4Xka9Gqngz2OTZJDMQgcXBB5ovSCVtku-MZtVx1syNVwBSVWgSgAQj_bg?key=8gU8MVcP3dueUEd0n1h9UTIk]                 [https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfO-X6u9Y1rYn4TJBMW2JY-0s6IMXpWgtFcTZWT1tQktYXO_DqMcP-2rocqRzjKtmY8IWBvt-LFlBVaSP-ARcQXP27U8keTQMaG0lh0nbQicZb9d_TinMkpRNlS-RqC6dUJoM3psw?key=8gU8MVcP3dueUEd0n1h9UTIk]\n\nDISCLAIMER: This communication is confidential and may be legally privileged. If you are not the intended recipient; (i) please do not read or disclose to others, (ii) please notify the sender by reply mail, and (iii) please delete this communication from your system.\n\nFunstay Services Private Limited\n\n1192/1, 22nd Cross, 24th Main, HSR Layout Sector 2, Bengaluru - 560102\n\nPhone:   +918287039039, E-Mail: booking@funstay.in<mailto:booking@funstay.in>\n\nwww.funstay.in<http://www.funstay.in/>',NULL,'2025-07-04 09:38:08','received','<SEZPR06MB6958124BA8C4590176A7657FFA42A@SEZPR06MB6958.apcprd06.prod.outlook.com>','11576',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(55,NULL,'Yashvanthcherry@gmail.com','11950 l 4N5D Dubai l Yashvanthini Ravichandran l 4 Pax l 15-19 July 2025','<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd-Hgtw0kurC9V6TJ-BQPIHyzChm4woXLB-fAMnObh7AHP2s6fK6q2xGMHo4tQjoZNX0GsJMiLtv-_gvLBT08TNfr81bBGKcs_O9SI0N8EKrEyb0Kyl8yYV-KhCORCBAGhn16FC8_loXkuXWAvyK9s?key=5h5iG-_LgOs9wnF_b9f8CA\" height=\"208\" width=\"797\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Yashvanthini,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Dubai as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 15.07.2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 19.07.2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 4N5D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 4 Adults&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 2&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST:&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PER ADULT: RS 45,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4*: City Seasons Towers Bur Dubai - Premium King with Breakfast&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Transfers using shared AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30-day single-entry tourist visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dhow Cruise Creek with shared transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Dubai City Tour with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor (Non-Prime Time tickets) with shared transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Desert Safari with Dinner with shared transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">General Admission to any 2 Theme Parks from Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Warner Bros. World Yas Island, SeaWorld Yas Island - with Free Shuttle Service</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTIONAL UPGRADES AND SUPPLEMENTS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upgrade Show Cruise Creek to Dhow Cruise Marina @ Rs 1,250/- per person</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upgrade Burj Khalifa 124th Floor Prime Time @ Rs 1,750/- per person</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 22,500 per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfvFf3N0jDBVMSbgiLi-yO7t-E2-lHoOA233qTrDRU7U3nnKsN0oD-IMMMp1VL6xvKpthn_PDdfmWld1dXMRnS03yCDiXW7C0HWg9S-354UxDad3ZAuYZRtVwL-jtAsrnl_yjvxAw9dSzDXjwue3g?key=5h5iG-_LgOs9wnF_b9f8CA\" height=\"77\" width=\"244\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tourism Dirham to be paid directly to hotel (AED 15-25 per day per room)</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT DUBAI, PICK UP TRANSFER, DHOW CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Dubai- The city of Gold!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Dubai, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check In and some time to rest.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 7PM, proceed for Dhow Cruise to experience something that is inexplicable and beyond your imagination with our 2-hour classy cruise. The Venetian styled canal will leave you and your loved ones impressed. This traditional dhow will offer you the best views of modern Dubai from the most unexpected angles. Witness the glorious architecture of Dubai that the world acknowledges while you feast on the international cuisines. An elegant and sophisticated setting will elevate your cruising experience and leave you with lovely memories to cherish for a lifetime. Entertainment will be arranged onboard, and you will be cruising while enjoying the savory dishes and drink. The stunning view, sumptuous meals and the live entertainment will give you a dazzling experience.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcshDlprzjh6qoEia2oFFNSHO3_SFYnSKH4-20r2gQH2xyH5QtbJApvka8TrL9v24B90gmhYCfecS9Cxgjl8JHyaGBjToO0UBQVJV4YA_V-bsafbkKTDbSJ1IRa6k9Aviilzm3vr8NoOzc9V8nFDTU?key=5h5iG-_LgOs9wnF_b9f8CA\" height=\"369.0544512420803\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: DUBAI CITY TOUR, DUBAI MALL, BURJ KHALIFA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a city tour of Dubai.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our 4-hour Dubai city tour would take you to the most prominent places in Dubai. You also get to see two different sides of Dubai, the historical one and the modern one. Beginning with the Dubai Museum, located in the Al Fahidi Fort (built in the 18th century), you get to see Dubai before it discovered oil and became the power city it is today. This is followed by a drive along the Dubai Creek, which is a historical area and still holds remnants of the past. You get to enjoy Arabic architecture with a visit to Jumeirah Mosque, which is the only mosque in Dubai open to non-Muslims. So, make the most of it. While the historical part of the city is quite interesting, your Dubai city tour would not be complete if you do not see its modern side.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The tour takes you Hotel Burj Al Arab (which is designed in the shape of a sail), the Palm Islands (largest artificial island in the world), Hotel Atlantis the Palm (the crowning glory of palm Jumeirah), Jumeirah Beach and Burj Khalifa (the tallest building in the world). The tour also includes a drive along the Shiekh Zayed Road so that you can take a look at the skyscrapers and magnificent buildings on both sides of the road.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 4PM proceed to the Dubai Mall.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After this, make your way to the 124th floor of Dubai\'s Burj Khalifa, the tallest of all the buildings in the world, standing tall and proud amongst the other skyscrapers of the city. One of the major landmarks of the city, the interiors of the Burj is as majestic as the steely exterior. During the tour, you are shown a multimedia presentation about the history of Dubai as well as the story of the construction of the building. Once you have gathered information about this tall structure, you are taken to the 124th floor observation deck on the fastest elevator. Here you get a chance to have a 360-degree panoramic view of the entire city of Dubai.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfcuGTNWWSWeyYZY2_2Zq6-eCh_7Z8aANgQCrJFdsgNOLyny9krNS64tJrNgTH0Hk9smfnW_SbJQwrEsAWYcVqwZlyZWYwlmnm0P3SlnDiWxdjxkX1DVG8dM67TenJk2xtn-v_5_58psJxsNQQK3Q?key=5h5iG-_LgOs9wnF_b9f8CA\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"447.48654752279253\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later, at around 7PM, see the spectacular Fountain Show at the Lake beside Dubai Mall. This is an open to public show so just look for a comfortable spot at the edge of the lake and enjoy the mesmerizing musical extravaganza. After this you have time at leisure for dinner at Dubai Mall (at your own expense) and return to the hotel by 9PM.Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: DUBAI DESERT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 2PM, proceed to enjoy Dubai Desert Safari. Our desert safari trip includes spending a few hours’ time in a Bedouin style tent, right in the middle of the desert. The tour begins with our vehicle picking you up from your hotel and driving you down to the outskirts of the desert. Once you arrive at the desert campsite, you can enjoy riding a camel, smoking a flavoured shisha, drinking the traditional Arabic coffee, enjoying the captivating belly dance and Tanura dance. Do not miss the chance to take some breath-taking pictures of the desert in your camera, especially during sunset. The colours of the setting sun on the sands would leave you mesmerized. Apart from this, you can try out the traditional costumes, get a henna tattoo and enjoy a delicious buffet dinner. After the dinner, you would be dropped back to your place of stay. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXePxVQ_m8E5xkBdIqPHh0l7yc8Z4ssK2_sr4y8Ei8OAHqRMv4DYt6io8vlFox-DcUJof3jEQyKq1AubV8aQCIXaYD_eZBwedrz3x6xxTDpZ_o2Z_9Oz-hyVB4exoePZZlOJX06C8pvbikxwK5s1Be0?key=5h5iG-_LgOs9wnF_b9f8CA\" alt=\"A picture containing dune\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"351.2316601863055\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: 1 DAY 2 PARKS IN YAS ISLAND</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after an early breakfast, proceed to Yas Island, Abu Dhabi using free shuttle service from City Seasons Towers Bur Dubai. Visit any 2 Theme Parks from </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Warner Bros. World Yas Island, SeaWorld Yas Island</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> in a day and then return back to your hotel in Dubai using shuttle service.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXecie_9xgnX-h7uWOM4vXLN_TeaVOhLqMyxzAJevFrvdUuNgLxYA-Q_PIt4eMs9-AlwOpmVvynuP-qvt1xhTzSdxAnmGh4mR8iJ5dRjYwLaWt4Y7sTL4n6CNT_B215HWkEIWCd5OleoDU5dcuLr14Y?key=5h5iG-_LgOs9wnF_b9f8CA\" height=\"334.81727657147115\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa is required for visiting Dubai. Documents needed for eVisa for Dubai</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital colour copy of your passport size photograph (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background. Avoid blurred and unclear photos.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PAN Card</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa on arrival is available for Indian nationals with valid US, UK or Schengen Visa.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy and selected fare rules.</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 7,000 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25% Cancellation charges if cancelled anytime after confirmation but at least 30 days before travel date</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">50% Cancellation charges if cancelled within 30 days but before 15 days of travel date&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Cancellation charges if cancelled on or within 15 days of travel date</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Advance</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 30 days from date of travel: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 15 days from date of travel: Balance 50% of package cost