03DA9yc12aD7t6td2YZVVjOQTy2NJGi4EGZWp1NCVeD2dLZ1Kj5z4glFsxddr4kzJrAfzEHXbGM8Un_9yeu-aFRMgSlFcYtDr5QTjDVcOcW6UACHq1mHByOolq4YQ?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" height=\"215\" width=\"793\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Mihir,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ locations across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also among the fastest-growing company in the experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews on&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Singapore as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 24-02-2026</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 01-03-2026</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 5N6D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST (FOR ALL TRAVELLERS): RS 1,25,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4* Hotel Boss, Superior Double Room with breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Airport Transfers on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Night Safari on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Gardens By The Bay on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">City Orientation Tour on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Sentosa Transfers on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Universal Studios Transfers on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Seat-in-Coach (SIC): Guests will share the vehicle with other tourists staying in different Hotels, so SIC Guests may have to wait for Vehicle up to 45 mins. SIC Transfers operates as per fix scheduled.&nbsp;</em></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PRIVATE(PVT): Guests do not have to share the vehicle with other tourists.</em></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">In both cases vehicle is not at disposal and only for transfers. Maximum Vehicle waiting time shall be 05 minutes for SIC and 10 minutes for Private</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Single Entry Tourist Visa</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Gardens By the Bay – Flower Dome + Cloud Forest Supertree&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Singapore City Tour on seat in coach basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Universal Studios Singapore One Day Ticket&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sentosa including 1-way Cable Car, Madam Tussaud’s 4 in 1, Wings of Time</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">River Wonders with Boat Ride</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Night Safari with Tram ride&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">SIC to Private Upgrade @ Rs 2000/- per vehicle per way</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 26,000/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfTb0MfqWBa2lLLk0nFx1q9VxKoeeBC3dcMSuni4Ai5rc29VUvGrNyo9vNl4rXCZWRAdrmReNLwkhBHGrmCeVnx4XIfggA-K37Tutl3a-A40otwYMMkqDqMQTV7s0Y7oaefDM_SGBswmhs_UQ74ab4?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" height=\"76\" width=\"250\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any travel insurance (recommended but not mandatory)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT SINGAPORE, PICK UP TRANSFER, GARDENS BY THE BAY&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Singapore- The Lion City!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On your arrival at Singapore, meet and greet at the airport and get dropped to your hotel.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-in (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">check -in time is 3PM, early check-in is subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">) and have lunch (at your own cost) and rest for a while.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the afternoon around 4:00PM, proceed to Gardens By the Bay, Singapore’s iconic botanical garden featuring the Flower Dome, Supergroove Tree, Garden Rhapsody (7:45 Show) and often regarded as the number one attraction of Singapore.&nbsp; Return to hotel and time at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note: While your return transfer to hotel after the tour is included, we advise to only take one way transfer for this tour and explore the Marina Area on your own after your visit to Gardens by the Bay. You can visit Shoppes by the Bay, Marina Bay Sands Casino or enjoy a spectacular light and water show in front of Shoppes by the Bay (</span><a href=\"https://www.marinabaysands.com/attractions/spectra.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">https://www.marinabaysands.com/attractions/spectra.html</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> ).&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfUWmV-W6xFMxAUo6aQmszkYXdGNk9k9kdUggJ28QzJyX_V0Y0RS3DFseGGPieperyyT7EdJWed1uXr3wUehAQ_WRsrePiA5vjzBf-gorXZ-9Mo2uS7Umvr6Z4_mgfcy5LajLAKfHD5KhXf-wEOag?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" height=\"332.01563471617663\" width=\"715\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: SINGAPORE CITY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, start with a Half Day City tour showcasing the history and culture of Singapore. This tour will bring guests to various attractions that depict the city’s multiracial orientations. While our city-tour gives you an up-close view of attractions like Merlion Park, Suntec City, Fountain of Wealth, Orchard Road, Little India, China Town as well as the Singapore Flyer allows you to soak up the incomparable sights over the skyline of the city-state during your 30-minute flight aboard Asia’s biggest observation wheel (additional cost). Drop back to the hotel and some time for lunch (at your own cost) and rest.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcKpWU6WCo5gngVYXKxi4fw-YCQDKah5VpNI5fV4oainUA-1MtK8svP-XxpvBhB7NGs4vP8WBtm-x6R9QD6u6loNycpYVfllKreB3v-wtBFW9XSEeXKviXD5lqU-5JJ6suimVEZYwRXN4SEC3XsDwA?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" height=\"375.7388326083501\" width=\"705\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: UNIVERSAL STUDIOS SINGAPORE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After Breakfast, proceed for a day of fun and frolic at The Universal Studios Singapore – enjoy the many adventurous rides and attractions spread across 6 different themes.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Do not miss to try Transformers 3-D ride, thrilling roller coaster among other </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Adrenaline-pumping rides, interactive shows and a wide variety of exciting attractions based on the blockbuster movies and television series you know and love so well awaits you at the first and only Universal Studios theme park in Asia.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the evening around 7PM, return to the hotel and overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfgBoFbbq_58fxOMpRMubqpSjBnYMg1dXj2FRTgT88fH2OmcRlooIZxLFs7_neKubkgDf2k4_zlcrOvFkLrmcSSQsh8vkg-4rYO_lFjXCLnidBw2btGgJ8kPuXKd1QGGfzbDJU_AUQ1W548UDys4ic?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" height=\"330.21192705766384\" width=\"709\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: SENTOSA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed to experience the wonderful Sentosa Islands starting with a cable ride from Mount Faber Park to Sentosa and appreciate the marvellous beauty surrounding the region. Upon reaching Sentosa, explore the many fun filled attractions at Sentosa (check inclusions for attractions included in the package, any additional attraction tickets can be purchased on spot at additional charge) and spend some time at leisure at one of its beaches. Later in the evening drop back to the hotel and rest at night at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfvFTPPfub6peP4NRWkfbEZijFRw0b6KJWzhe4NX7QnHDwpTpoMkkjr8nxdxrFIrk39TqNgHlHMWN3m1XowpOyDIYOdrgdYKqaY0ehe5QuiREi2D2dYyWtEqNeE_uCXY6IeXAnLGEe4-mALQIkDwQ8?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" alt=\"A picture containing resort\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"235\" width=\"709\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: RIVER WONDERS | NIGHT SAFARI&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later around 4PM, proceed for the date with the Singapore Wildlife reserves starting with the River Wonders for a unique exploration of flora and fauna, themed around the popular freshwater rivers in the world. Boasting the exclusivity of being the only wildlife park in Asia based on the river system, a visit to River Park which comes under the Wildlife Reserves Singapore would absolutely live up to your expectations. From giant otter and giant stingray to alligator gar, Chinese salamander, and Mekong catfish, it gives you access to the habitats of iconic rivers, such as Amazon, River Nile, Mississippi, Yangtze River, Mekong River, and Tundra. You can also enjoy Amazon River Quest Boat Ride as part of this tour.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcl8YlmpemqQGrHxizOjsFOulHf00BPXAids3tIT81pqmxTAehXuhBCo_ZLEjrSo9vS67C33K6QHiQZmrUEl6aGo6xFg3HXr9EsOtd115uhEXV9uOXwJLHFKA6kkKaotTi9-gOfOQ-1OpwxLDqujw?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" alt=\"A group of people in a boat\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with medium confidence\" height=\"471.28840276660765\" width=\"703\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then proceed for a visit to Night Safari. Night Safari is a remarkable attraction to see a wide array of nocturnal animals in their natural setting. It shelters 2500 plus animals in its 35 hectares of land, which interestingly represent the habitats of our planet’s seven amazing geographical zones, encompassing Indo-Malayan area, Asian Riverine Forest, Nepalese River Valley, Indian Subcontinent, Burmese Hillside, Himalayan Foothills, and Equatorial Africa. A visit to this night zoo also gives you the chance to watch Thumbuakar Performance and Creatures of the Night show. Drop back to the hotel and overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd7Od0K_Jrr00-9otUp_KkDS6xX2Bze0sLmmv9nIam9FqVfyQXcjPp2r2lzBVtDoRI1CsP0AtgUUJ1oJYeJl95KDgJjE_QSkPWKZssRBanXj64HGdgENCSz1RWtpCu7AP0yG1OlDnzv10WUCxT3Tuk?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" alt=\"A picture containing grass, outdoor, tree, mammal\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"339\" width=\"707\"></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA INFORMATION</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Indian nationals require a Visa for visiting Singapore. Documents needed for Visa processing are,</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Original Passport with validity for 6 months from the intended date of arrival in Singapore.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2 Recently clicked photographs with the specification 35x45mm, white background, 80% face coverage, matt finished. (Notes: - Kindly don’t wear a white colour shirt)</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa application form (14A) should be filled out thoroughly and signatures should be done with the same ink.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A Personal Covering letter (Intended/Confirmed Travel Date, Number of passengers travelling together along with the Applicant’s Name as per Passport &amp; Passport Number, Duration of Stay, Main Applicant’s Email Id and Contact Number, Details of last visits to Singapore – If Any).</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Original Ticket Itinerary</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Confirm hotel voucher.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If employed, proof such as Salary Slips for the last 3 months, Employee Identity Card.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If Self-employed, proof such as Covering letter on the Business Letter, Company Registration Copy, and Company ITR for last 2 years, Visiting Card (Name &amp; Contact number mentioned on it).</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Updated bank statement for last 3 months.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If the applicant is a minor traveling with the parents, the signature of both the parent is required on the application form. If the applicant is a minor traveling with a single parent, a NOC letter from another parent is required with the signature and the relationship proof attached.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p><ol><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">We process Visa applications 15 days before travel date.</em><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;</span></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Original Passports, Photographs, Filled Up Form along with other required documents are to be handed over in person or via courier to our Visa Partners offices either in Bengaluru, Delhi, Mumbai, or Chennai depending on place of Passport issuance. Please note that we do not provide home pick up service.&nbsp;</em></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Typically, Visa processing takes 2-5 working days post submission of all documents. However, this is just an indicative timeline and actual time may vary.</em></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Granting of Visa is solely at the discretion of Singapore High Commission/Consulate and application of Visa doesn’t guarantee grant of Visa.</em></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable, 3.5% for Amex &amp; International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner Sankash</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcChf6HbmSI4Yf3X3rqEGvd131yDj-VI5db1C1sBaPOwjAtUQTuvJXnRUG36NJTKia7N0pFTt-2qB6Ta8U9PZ_Bc5q3w9sJ6LAdcZbTQ7QUbUUAitWywyeFEnwh1Z5EyBwiz1ngBziKS2pD-_O-gg?key=603J1SrEmmz4AqLGTtSTmw\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"73\" width=\"76\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 3,000 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 15 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Standard Check in Time is 3PM and Check out time is 12 PM. Early check in &amp; late check out would be subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The itinerary is tentative, the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in trip, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with local Govt guidelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p>',NULL,'2025-07-05 07:28:48','sent','<5eaf2e93-a294-aa64-0564-fa06b7619d75@funstay.in>','11963',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in',NULL,NULL),(59,NULL,'mihirdholakia@gmail.com','11963 l 5N6D Dubai & Abu Dhabi l  Mihir Dholakia l 2 Pax l 24th Feb to 01st Mar 2026','<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfgSByc_AQd7nTyvgCyuVbA0nfcW9aK5EI4HWddBlXWRu9SB3LVFRVWEdh-0UKRhJe87TF9C9k6Bf9lT5IbilSC69rH8_81AMLcAQSs284MBe6u2AmzzJnUa4GKf-STR0qBFaVNNizxwV-o6D5HirQ?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" height=\"208\" width=\"797\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Mihir,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Dubai as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 24.02.2026</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 01.03.2026</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 5N6D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4 STAR LAND PACKAGE COST (ALL TRAVELLERS): INR 1,60,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IN DUBAI: GRAND EXCELSIOR HOTEL BUR DUBAI</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">, DELUXE ROOM WITH BREAKFAST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IN ABU DHABI: CITY SEASONS AL HAMRA, JUNIOR SUITE WITH BREAKFAST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: As per selected option</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle (not at disposal)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Transfers using shared AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai to Abu Dhabi using Private AC Vehicle (not at disposal)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30-day single-entry tourist visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dhow Cruise Creek</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Dubai City Tour with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor (Non-Prime Time tickets)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai Frame</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Desert Safari</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Full Day Abu Dhabi Tour with Grand Mosque</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">General Admission to any 2 Theme Parks from Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Warner Bros. World Yas</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Island, SeaWorld Yas Island</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTIONAL UPGRADES AND SUPPLEMENTS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upgrade Burj Khalifa 124th Floor Prime Time @ Rs 1,750/- per person</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 33,000 per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf09yI8NpreuH-Qko64QoAaLF9Qlxul6RQgg0aHQFwl1GYkh2n3R1ASvih3CqyFK1iEVQvXykdErDOXhgpr1lOpTul688huS4LELhbbe-dIhXdzuSfaPjZeCoJ3uhSm4pTatpa5-8AAYqDQAxGeXLQ?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" height=\"80\" width=\"247\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tourism Dirham to be paid directly to hotel (AED 15-25 per day per room)</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT DUBAI, PICK UP TRANSFER, DHOW CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Dubai- The city of Gold!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Dubai, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check In and some time to rest.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 7PM, proceed for Dhow Cruise to experience something that is inexplicable and beyond your imagination with our 2-hour classy cruise. The Venetian styled canal will leave you and your loved ones impressed. This traditional dhow will offer you the best views of modern Dubai from the most unexpected angles. Witness the glorious architecture of Dubai that the world acknowledges while you feast on the international cuisines. An elegant and sophisticated setting will elevate your cruising experience and leave you with lovely memories to cherish for a lifetime. Entertainment will be arranged onboard, and you will be cruising while enjoying the savory dishes and drink. The stunning view, sumptuous meals and the live entertainment will give you a dazzling experience.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc_no34px7zXh897HU7b2PAUIrCI8EsHgqGibKwZL6GcI44akGm0uFG4ccboY3fBQ-tswkf6hywgOXAEXhLUHAS0UNQjDwXf3nH12KrGNrEYt-wOp0BbOtijymoNG9nIZey0wcJXoTlejG0rCqddOw?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" height=\"369.26884172155115\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: DUBAI CITY TOUR, DUBAI MALL, BURJ KHALIFA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a city tour of Dubai.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our 4-hour Dubai city tour would take you to the most prominent places in Dubai. You also get to see two different sides of Dubai, the historical one and the modern one. Beginning with the Dubai Museum, located in the Al Fahidi Fort (built in the 18th century), you get to see Dubai before it discovered oil and became the power city it is today. This is followed by a drive along the Dubai Creek, which is a historical area and still holds remnants of the past. You get to enjoy Arabic architecture with a visit to Jumeirah Mosque, which is the only mosque in Dubai open to non-Muslims. So, make the most of it. While the historical part of the city is quite interesting, your Dubai city tour would not be complete if you do not see its modern side.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The tour takes you Hotel Burj Al Arab (which is designed in the shape of a sail), the Palm Islands (largest artificial island in the world), Hotel Atlantis the Palm (the crowning glory of palm Jumeirah), Jumeirah Beach and Burj Khalifa (the tallest building in the world). The tour also includes a drive along the Shiekh Zayed Road so that you can take a look at the skyscrapers and magnificent buildings on both sides of the road.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 4PM proceed to enjoy the Dubai Mall.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After this, make your way to the 124th floor of Dubai\'s Burj Khalifa, the tallest of all the buildings in the world, standing tall and proud amongst the other skyscrapers of the city. One of the major landmarks of the city, the interiors of the Burj is as majestic as the steely exterior. During the tour, you are shown a multimedia presentation about the history of Dubai as well as the story of the construction of the building. Once you have gathered information about this tall structure, you are taken to the 124th floor observation deck on the fastest elevator. Here you get a chance to have a 360-degree panoramic view of the entire city of Dubai.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdgjT3K3ePZ5GUjsmuzqHg2CoCNG4MawmnZC6pPna_9C5oP8XnJ-2Ms73FXSaAJPY9u04cD6O12hJlrp_Bb-_1mipAlBigcTaTsfoPwQspbj3jbOudvtYBitibfzP0-d_oT-ru9jACjlNT0fGSgX6M?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"447.48654752279253\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later, at around 7PM, see the spectacular Fountain Show at the Lake beside Dubai Mall. This is an open to public show so just look for a comfortable spot at the edge of the lake and enjoy the mesmerizing musical extravaganza. After this you have time at leisure for dinner at Dubai Mall (at your own expense) and return to the hotel by 9PM.Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3:&nbsp; DUBAI FRAME l DESERT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, proceed to explore the Dubai frame: Standing tall at 150 m, Dubai Frame provides a bird’s eye view of the city\'s famous and spectacular skyline, you can experience the views of Old and New Dubai and see how the city has transformed to a one of a kind metropolitan.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe-bMaYVSHjiC6sp1-MyknZHKgYWcoYBchdo5uo600whHsZETvAm68QRyB59UxqIu53LFqe2CMvDNYHqFLINjdlHns6J3LlYmeljyucrM4h-B2XpQR-DQO0rgrr0-qyv3-lQba-UMrHrLV76No_oCk?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, track, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"418.9651560645206\" width=\"669.0000000000001\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 2PM, proceed to enjoy Dubai Desert Safari. Our desert safari trip includes spending a few hours’ time in a Bedouin style tent, right in the middle of the desert. The tour begins with our vehicle picking you up from your hotel and driving you down to the outskirts of the desert. Once you arrive at the desert campsite, you can enjoy riding a camel, smoking a flavoured shisha, drinking the traditional Arabic coffee, enjoying the captivating belly dance and Tanura dance. Do not miss the chance to take some breath-taking pictures of the desert in your camera, especially during sunset. The colours of the setting sun on the sands would leave you mesmerized. Apart from this, you can try out the traditional costumes, get a henna tattoo and enjoy a delicious buffet dinner. After the dinner, you would be dropped back to your place of stay. Overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc-R9gOXL1fzgektkE8wzpMUu1a13UldHEluSwR7QkmZg5wIXQfhbGuL7Ds5bB7kEHg8M2baeWetTim_42NlOo4TBq06XX33yPA88w7i7gqDTqaT9-0kakI5rvKRksYcpNtUn5F89gtvu-Krm-Sxkw?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" alt=\"A picture containing dune\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"351.2316601863055\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: ABU DHABI CITY TOUR WITH GRAND MOSQUE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after an early breakfast, proceed for the full-day trip to Abu Dhabi. After a pickup from your</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">centrally located hotel in Dubai, we’ll head you for the Abu Dhabi city tour. Explore some of the capital city’s most</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">legendary sights on this comprehensive tour. Travel through the serene Saadiyat Island and enjoy a stopover at Date</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Market. This is followed by a drive along the picturesque Corniche area and then a photo op at Emirates Palace Hotel.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Next in the itinerary is a trip to the massive and all-white Sheik Zayed Mosque, also known as Grand Mosque. Immerse</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">in its tranquil ambiance, admire the breathtaking architectural style, and catch exquisite views of such prized exhibits as gold chandeliers meticulously studded with Austrian Swarovski crystals.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This full-day tour blending culture, modernity comes to an end with a convenient drop off to your location in Dubai. Overnight stay at Dubai Hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcEh_b-zq5jLQZIUiUMPHX-hcrgmjg-ralxSB5TwbEUlQ2Uj7e-IuUEB6M5tch8cYdrUEHI7UUYtAoTD09nW9wKLTnqRCY_iVpCJgnNpqPqvlYlIlty9IkP6N0KdBqLG7qs-74oJdEiP5louPSv-Xw?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" alt=\"A white building with towers\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with low confidence\" height=\"446.07880304293985\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MUSEUM OF FUTURE l GLOBAL VILLAGE &amp; MIRACLE GARDEN</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">, proceed to the latest additions to the iconic architectural structures in Dubai- The Museum of Future. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Museum of the Future is an exhibition space for innovative and futuristic ideologies, services, and products. Located in the Financial District of Dubai, UAE, the Museum of the Future has three main elements: green hill, building, and void.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfC7RoYCZ4oKxCagYBddIwbLCY5kuGlyN1EgV-lCMObm9JCBAselUA-N5SrGtzBpD3g1QUAEZ6d3Dq7tJN7NuwVpRODDRiYxeNOcdMVDyEXRIkcYBCWyf4qGSnhnyXM7zEnC5J3XqSrPWSW6R4uXw?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, grass, outdoor\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"446.63555157172436\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At around 2PM, we proceed for visit Miracle Garden, Travel to the botanical paradise of Dubai Miracle Garden, spanning 72000 square meters of stunningly laid out landscape. Opened in 2013 as an effort to create a lush oasis in the middle of the desert, this garden has since then become one of Dubai’s most visited attractions, drawing millions of visitors per year. As you enter the garden, stroll along the painstakingly manicured themed gardens as well as pathways, and admire its several unique structures and water features – all stupendously decked up with a vivid array of flowers and plants. Filled with over 100 million blooming flowers from 70 plus rare, exotic and indigenous floral species, the garden is also recognized by Guinness Book of World Records for its astonishing flower wall, which is the largest of its kind in the world.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc-auy03jb_OXoQu0sMFJq4UX8XKF1_dCrQaVRp0z7L4sxjTqIKW_h_VxTzqZ1ocfZbiuAlU59bs_hoqutm5oae83nxoWc-_bwUJ90lv0lcrS5_dnrwX8ZPJB6Yd-FU13a70XOfpTxh1GI1dNBz5PA?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" height=\"190\" width=\"338\"> <img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeMcsUjBayVcToM1iBYolLOQjWVuvXbUUO6MZeUh2lWZ0c81s5t2pDBY6Lt-7_fhO1NzSddDbNId8Wfm0CP2Z_S6wPb0k-rzvrGCHWKiCz492DgTEXlR0u6h2G0-WH6pZ4S8IW_skr8pm7LBYNlrEU?key=p1nq54gQRTky-dzEysFziw\" alt=\"Global Village Dubai Tickets Image\" height=\"193\" width=\"323\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Next up in today’s program is the amazing Global Village. It is known as the world\'s largest tourism, leisure and entertainment project located at Dubai land. We bring you the best of Global Village - region’s cultural, entertainment and tourism project with unlimited fun, excitement and adventure. From children rides, family rides to thrilling rides; Global Village is great on the entertainment quotient. Visited by over five million people every year, The Global Village brings together the best of cultural offerings through 32 giant stalls and pavilions representing more than 75 countries with different cultures. The food, the souvenirs, shopping, rides, and excitement all makes it a cosmopolitan and diverse experience for all our guests. Our exclusively designed Global Village tours ensure that our guests start having fun from the word go. Global Village was started as an initiative to highlight the cultural aspect of Dubai and the cosmopolitan blend that the city with over 85% of the expat population represents. Over the years, the Global Village has transformed into a much bigger, grander and colossal event that has its distinctive presence on a global scale. Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa is required for visiting Dubai. Documents needed for eVisa for Dubai</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital colour copy of your passport size photograph (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background. Avoid blurred and unclear photos.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PAN Card</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa on arrival is available for Indian nationals with valid US, UK or Schengen Visa.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy and selected fare rules.</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 7,000 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25% Cancellation charges if cancelled anytime after confirmation but at least 30 days before travel date</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">50% Cancellation charges if cancelled within 30 days but before 15 days of travel date&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Cancellation charges if cancelled on or within 15 days of travel date</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Advance</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 30 days from date of travel: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 15 days from date of travel: Balance 50% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nb