r&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 1: LAND PACKAGE COST(4 STAR): RS 2,70,000/- + 5% TCS</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOKYO: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mitsui Garden Hotel Ginza Gochome, Standard - 1 Double Bed or Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">KYOTO: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Miyako Hotel Kyoto Hachijo, South Wing Double or Similar</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 2: LAND PACKAGE COST(4 STAR &amp; 5 STAR): RS 3,05,000/- + 5% TCS</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOKYO: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Intercontinental Tokyo Bay, Classic Room King Bed or Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">KYOTO: </strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hilton Garden Inn Kyoto Shijo Karasuma, Superior Queen Room or Similar</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL &amp; MEAL PLAN</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per the selected option</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Short-term single entry</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> tourist Visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private vehicle&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Train Station Transfers using private vehicle&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Excursion on SIC Basis</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Tokyo Panoramic Tour</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Mt. Fuji &amp; Hakone Tour</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Shinkansen Bullet train ticket – Tokyo – Kyoto – Osaka (Ordinary class, Reserved Seat)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Kyoto City Tour</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 57,000/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXezR-zk7xNE45sxDl-Z7FJwo0NuUtyTv7UyKCC5zrOv0UU1aG5iUr7Ty5sHde-PFE1mbhyejcE5ZbsA47673BtBJT0L8M1W5cHdXjk8fxbZ4pRpcKyaOEFAVGaI4XE8OGsFjZqhLlrvSUyucpo6v7o?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" height=\"78\" width=\"267\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Local transfers from pick-up and drop-off points for SIC tours</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tips to drivers and Gratuities&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5% GST</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL IN TOKYO</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival in Tokyo International Airport. Proceed for immigration and collect your baggage. Then meet and greet in the Airport. Transfer to the hotel, check in and relax. Overnight stay in the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcSp3GAy_xMoZsl2O4K3-wZahITy1nBvrYRjZXwRAVL38b61hR-acJY8XoAC4Gk2lt3stfBbjP_AKu-JLSYWwAP42eylKgkoUXZnYAnOdQ3-Cqp_hx8qs5s_8P0qrvWYU-9hegO8USYCVT4mmiTlw?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" alt=\"Tokyo Skyline Pictures | Download Free Images on Unsplash\" height=\"414.3716850265198\" width=\"621.858164266688\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">TOKYO CITY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast at the hotel, proceed to the meeting point for the Tokyo city tour. The finest sightseeing destinations will make sure you get the very best of the city. Visit the following places:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Skyscrapers in Shinjuku (Drive-by), Meiji Shrine, Japan National Stadium (Drive-by), Imperial Palace Plaza, Senso-ji Temple &amp; Nakamise Shopping Street, Kabukiza - Ginza (Drive-by), Rainbow Bridge, Odaiba &amp; Toyosu Market (Drive-by), Hamarikyu Gardens, Tokyo Tower - Main Deck - 150m, Tour ends at the meeting point. Head back to the hotel on your own.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfdCznxuz5hIIUptXHL_cWgtDlpxVbW92TwqCUMHwDYQ3spakKLYKtuTF1cL6PrzzI-OZFVQqhp3ST9c_EmdBzkauYFqoODW6kqrDX94TWT_up2Cp4MNOPU2Dip7nVygrJBoeadAScoViMYByDEjDM?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" height=\"329\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: MOUNT FUJI TOUR&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meet at the meeting point on your own and board the bus. Then proceed for the Mount Fuji Tour. Trek over the mountains of Hakone and cruise through the cool water of Lake Ashi. Enjoy the breathtaking view of Mt. Fuji on the 50 minute Mt. Komagatake Ropeway journey and take in the wonder of Japan\'s famous mountain at an elevation of 2,300 meters on Mt. Fuji\'s 5th Station. This full day tour grants travelers the chance to witness the elegance of Japan\'s natural beauty.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfsH_10GiZTVmvcPZbLPt7D20_xAO6AVQItOKBk6Yw6y3IQuCjLFYCA0FtBELCkiUPeHa_A0OBMa-voUDjhemHoxgGXmgtkr6bWNrFrFlYmhnaL_d8ZgcOlKoMsJuPPuxMdSvc9X6XtR-Qlt85xFYc?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" height=\"332.04868595815094\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">TOKYO-KYOTO&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, check out from your hotel and head to the Tokyo Station on your own. Take the Shinkansen bullet train to Kyoto Station. Head to Kyoto Hotel and rest of the day at leisure. In the evening visit Kiyomizu-dera on your own.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdZc6aMPzOankUmTv8i3igaIk5GYs-seqvEdyEj07nfx7V_IKBeS6UNqbwYgDZPL0CFXGprN8PzQd6KvLO7L87lodm79UfsJZRWWFxBqLbUe-m2NU3IRY69eRQyVJE-Ej5dJGLnb_Gcho7ER5zupBc?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" height=\"424.05607546969605\" width=\"622\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: KYOTO PANORAMIC DAY TOUR&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, proceed to the meeting point for a Kyoto Sagano Bamboo Grove &amp; Arashiyama Walking Tour. The tour starts Nijo Castle Historical Treasure: Walk into the only palace in the world cultural heritage, admire the exquisite architecture and ingenious gardens in the castle, and experience the unique corridor floor of Ninomaru Palace that makes a sound like a yellow oriole when people walk~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">🌟 Take in the beautiful scenery of Arashiyama: Stroll through Arashiyama and enjoy the picturesque natural scenery. The quiet waterfront and the quiet bamboo forest are intertwined, allowing you to indulge in the embrace of nature~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">🏯 Pray at Nonomiya Shrine: Visit Nonomiya Shrine, a holy place for praying for beautiful love, health and happiness, feel the solemnity and mystery of Japanese shrines, make a wish, and look forward to sweet love and a happy life~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">🌉 Time-lapse photography at Togetsukyo Bridge: Stand on the Togetsukyo Bridge, enjoy the beautiful scenery of Arashiyama changing with the seasons, and feel the unique atmosphere of old Japan~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">🎋 Stroll along the bamboo forest trail: Walk through the bamboo forest trail, listen to the rustling of bamboo leaves, feel the freshness and tranquility, as if stepping into another world~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">👘 Kimono Forest Experience: Step into the Kimono Forest, admire hundreds of columns covered with exquisite kimonos, and experience the unique charm of Japanese traditional culture~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">🏛️ Golden Pavilion Temple: Visit the world cultural heritage Golden Pavilion Temple, whose two-story exterior walls are covered with pure gold foil, shining brightly, and the unique architectural style is breathtaking~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">⛩️ Fushimi Inari Taisha Pray: Go to Fushimi Inari Taisha, a holy place for praying for wealth and career success, and pray for you and your family to have a smooth career and start a good luck journey~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">🏮 Thousand Torii Exploration: Stroll through the endless red Thousand Torii Corridor, feel the mysterious and solemn atmosphere, and check in at Kyoto\'s must-visit places~</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Come and join our Kyoto Panorama Day Tour, one journey, multiple experiences, let you fully appreciate the charm and style of Japan\'s ancient capital.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Head back to the Hotel on your own. Overnight Stay in Kyoto.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeVWpRMUfyTqtSknDdgI2h3yL5rtNu1S70t9ySepA-q-K04T8YFJFbmvr-2v6SFKs9kM9-d_aXYjmjAixcUEGoUvXDVf3n8d1kgk05GQm4CcEWcH8_8B_KtXbG0RyeS9zpkh-xvjyM3odD57AEZpw?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" height=\"349\" width=\"622\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DAY AT LEISURE</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, the day is at leisure.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning breakfast time at leisure until checkout,. After checkout proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ A valid Passport (with more than two blank pages). Please submit your old passports also, if any.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ Photocopy of the Bio Data Page of the Current Passport (First and Last Page)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ A completely filled and signed Visa Application Form.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ One photograph taken within the last 6 months. (The photograph should be passport size with</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">white background and printed on good quality paper)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ Covering letter (if any special explanation is needed)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ Document to show the flight/cruise schedule to/from Japan</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ Itinerary in Japan (including hotel information, contact information while in Japan)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ Latest Income Tax Return (if not available, bank statement of last 6 months)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ If the applicant is Student / Dependent</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">a. Consent from the parents / spouse</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">b. Latest Income Tax Return of parents / spouse (if not available, bank statement of last 6</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">months)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">◼ Proof of Relationship, in case the applicant is accompanied by any dependent (i.e. Passport copy,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Marriage Certificate, Birth Certificate)</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">➢ The above is a guide to the documents you should provide with your visa application. Japan Embassy</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">may request you for an interview / additional documentation depending on your personal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">circumstances.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">➢ Documents submitted will not be returned (except for the passport).</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable, 3.5% for American Express)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner, contact us to know more.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfZXHFvYkd9IlpA5vQ0Shw-0TGzUgk1aLyr_LcXI7S0mTWJzRpaMG7mCeaVRcae9p31pTUCcWn9Q5JTRUIaVZjSCScaRqc-rUsRxpd844NE3Mh8vK_CDTFhkHkKurZbBRYWnylZFhOpEb2_z4GZ9cs?key=RwVY_enSocRpPMAPM4G-ow\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"92\" width=\"89\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 21 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. All prices are quoted in INR based on current ROE. In case of a major change in ROE the rates may be revised.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2. The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. We reserve the right to use alternative accommodation, sightseeing tours and transfer of equal or higher standard.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. We are not responsible for any missed breakfast due to flight/tour timings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. No refunds either in part or full will be made for any unused services in the above package like ground transportation, meals, accommodation, sightseeing tours.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. We are not responsible for any excess baggage charges on tour.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. We reserve the right to change any information, route or attractions before or after your booking due to events beyond our control like bad weather, any natural calamity, any accident, and or any logistic issues.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Vouchers will be released 48 hours after we receive the full payments / 07 days prior to the departure.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10. Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible