 transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Phuket as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Start Date: 24th Oct 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">End Date: 29th Oct 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 5N6D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults 1 Child (7yrs)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1 Room</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 1: 4 STAR LAND PACKAGE COST (FOR ALL TRAVELLERS): RS 1,56,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DESTINATION</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">KRABI</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">PHUKET</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL NAME</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Amari Phuket</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ROOM CATEGORY</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Superior Garden View Room</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Superior Balcony King with Partial Ocean View</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MEAL PLAN</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast Included</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 2: 5 STAR LAND PACKAGE COST (FOR ALL TRAVELLERS): RS 1,68,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DESTINATION</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">KRABI</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">PHUKET</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL NAME</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Amari Vogue Krabi</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Grand Mercure Phuket Patong</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ROOM CATEGORY</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Deluxe King Room</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Superior 1 King bed</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MEAL PLAN</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast Included</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per the selected option</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">AIRPORT TRANSFERS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Phuket Airport - Krabi Hotel Arrival Transfers using private AC vehicle&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Krabi Hotel - Phuket Hotel Transfers using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Phuket Hotel – Phuket Airport Departure Transfers using private AC vehicle&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rainforest Discovery with Lunch with NPF with Private transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Phuket City Tour with Private transfers (Entrance tickets not included)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Phi Phi Island Tour with speedboat with lunch with National Park Fees&nbsp; with Private transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dolphin Show- Deluxe Ticket with Private transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Carnival Magic with Standard Seat with Private transfers</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> (airfare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 32,600/- per person, however applicable fare will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfAdeeSMdY7HT8d26CrkGCqOPx-njiNjHcffudz1PDJdiI3RfEX-3OH5cbZyQ7a48CNSQa1uoXLWGFvpXcHuCy7SMSfpu6-UQPI_EFPBgKzGTSS8ulRjim670vV5u1h909VnsFupaUg_EWkwFGQqQ?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" height=\"74\" width=\"240\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tips to drivers and Gratuities&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL TRANSFER TO KRABI l DAY AT LEISURE</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sawadee Ka!</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Phuket, proceed to the VOA counter for Visa and immigration processing. Once you have completed the immigration, meet your driver at the arrival hall and transfer to the hotel. Check in and the rest of the day is at leisure to enjoy the resort and beach at your own pace.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfpYVjy_Ln3-WfYV_MtmSraO6nct2IdGzbfPZ9ehNgD4bIKH5_45a1DVchYCJuGqbRTfqAuye3VPTBq7KLov24vnt9lvCgyGFdzQ_XiZ_3ZrRA0kiR7WsO9SwhrBYbhdbX9gW5wreU0jicpifhtQQ?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" height=\"350.1604902246863\" width=\"622\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: RAINFOREST DISCOVERY TOUR WITH LUNCH</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast at the hotel, enjoy the jungle tour exploring two of the most famed attractions in Krabi – Emerald Pool &amp; Tiger Cave. This full day tour will take you to Krabi\'s signature attractions nestled deep in the jungle: Wat Tahm Suea (the Tiger Cave Temple) and Sra Morakot (the Emerald Pool). This exotic and yet relaxing adventure kicks off with a refreshing swim in the Emerald Pool, a freshwater pool inside the Khao Phra Bang Khram Nature Reserve. There, you will get to soak yourself in a 120-square-meter pond sporting a mysterious green hue thanks to the abundance of minerals from the surrounding limestone hills. Enjoy a menu set Lunch at the Restaurant You will then head off to the Tiger Cave Temple, aptly named for the rock formation nearby resembling a tiger\'s claw. The temple is a meditation centre and its tranquility is guarded by the spectacular Ao Luk Thanu mountain range. Return to hotel and time at leisure. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXei6028rqnjZIZ9zGemwtjIBtC3b3PlWtNkYECniviLYRnXmmSw4If7-ynuKI9E4LDatct60Fgiv4arVy4AP0993GHlC4YIB2Ai-kf_2G8atGK2RoqHSUvZqB06KXdIHpF04k3pezUe1ELS-BaXQg8?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" height=\"344.994212637801\" width=\"622\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: TRANSFER TO PHUKET | PHUKET CITY TOUR&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning breakfast checkout and transfer to Phuket Hotel at around 10 AM. Upon arrival at Phuket Hotel, lunch and Check in. Proceed to visit the many beautiful beaches and viewpoints- Karon Beach, Kata Beach, Karon View Point. You will also visit the Old Phuket Town, walk around Wat Chalong, largest Phuket temple and Big Buddha Statue. Later in the evening get a panoramic view of Phuket Promthep Cape Viewpoint. Drop back to the hotel and rest of the day is at leisure. Note: Entrance is not included for any place.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc3ZqtfOX-uootmtq8ebEo2xvcVabEuPFesUJh_YDzpbXYvKZ3kb3WnEMeQTiSOuK4uYLl504KxKXa2ecY1dPsyWhmlgfvLV1uVbjx89aP_1jOYJXJXU9N-MaLJO4Rr4yJBBajVPKdJp-XYAnRmnts?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, tower\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"162\" width=\"304\"> <img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfoZvnrpefWn_G-eBRScabp5bkd5qG7E1_L8m1KGu6-Y25zEdQMpFRDXIVAydABs_ybNNHj-B6c_QErhkLnTDzGRPa3I2QRvL2k_nbvld4FtS02LqxnrMibVv2SRwcGROu__QLpbuwWFcHxYZemEWA?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" alt=\"A picture containing water, outdoor, sky, ocean\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"162\" width=\"297\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: PHI PHI ISLAND, MAYA BAY &amp; KHAI ISLAND TOUR BY SPEEDBOAT</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast at the hotel, enjoy the day tour to the famous Maya Bay &amp; Phi Phi Islands. Hop aboard the speedboat and kick off your Phi Phi Islands expedition. Get to visit the uninhabited Khai Island and see its tropical schools of fish - you will get the chance to go snorkeling and swim in their crystal clear waters. Enjoy the amazing view of the famous Maya Bay from the boat, which is known for being the site where \"The Beach\", starring Leonardo DiCaprio, was filmed, and have enough time for relaxation. Indulge in a delectable lunch buffet with drinks at Phi Phi Don Island (Ton Sai Bay) to replenish your energy. Go sightseeing along Viking Cave and make a trip to the Monkey Beach to meet adorable monkeys wandering around. Return to the hotel and rest of the day is at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXenvmelqAti3FXJXLYtVhSFn6ly-qp6SufDldYMydvwB_LMHj_en5MmYY2EXpTVDl0q0JB15fK_wYYzTYgDsvdPGIybo29Tc21godZj_ylIzyGGUFX1lQaAYW0OPxN78e5CN2ZuGv5G80zIZWcF0LI?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" alt=\"Must-see in Thailand: Phi Phi Islands - Elite Havens MAGAZINE\" height=\"346.7186964431672\" width=\"617\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: DOLPHIN SHOW | CARNIVAL MAGIC</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time, proceed to Dolphin Bay. It is a unique place where you can see the amazing creatures up close. You may get acquainted with them. Dolphins are the faithful friends of man. An old legend says that the souls of dead sailors become dolphins and rising from the depths they bring us all their unspent love and devotion. Water on the planet is twice as much as on Earth. This is a mysterious and vulnerable huge underwater world. Approaching it in the Dolphinarium, we understand that the safety of the marine world depends on each human person. We just need to know more about sea inhabitants to understand our responsibility to them. Dolphins Bay is also providing a close dolphin encounter during the Royal Swim and Diving interactions.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXedR2gPByMEhBcXGothhAYQKDVNB_K8RuDIcK6Tp9WMyGrIwIU7ANq6d9pK4zJ6fBViHGPTkGFQfsKCKZhWVxuQfOvCbUG5C-l-VYVCepttV7-Bbj52PFxEJFv1eqCZ3JBXrM8sHNOjCn2MtKIlKmE?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" height=\"349.0009846813497\" width=\"622\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then in the evening proceed to Carnival Magic. It is the crowning jewel in nighttime entertainment on the resort island of Phuket, Thailand. Spanning over 40 acres and awash with dazzling colors and sparkling imagery, Carnival Magic comes to light as the very first Thai Carnival theme park, celebrating the vibrancy and rich cultural heritage found in the many traditional festivals, carnivals and market fairs that abound throughout the Kingdom. Inspired by exotic carnival celebrations from around the world, Carnival Magic presents a breathtaking evening of joyous celebration, regal pageantry and cultural fun unmatched by any other place on earth. Return to the hotel and rest of the day is at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeharA9AHLQMj2KP_Bwh33xwimo8hIcnbasXsFEMFY1_KmISonh4-Pr1uzYcQq0KsNpb7UTsxYvy7peXOpyVxu7uM_56uZ6dzx9J1fPVWZoewgdMam32kotp1jYJKtDeOHT3xA9nM9X7T0iasnvCQA?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" height=\"386.15348807684984\" width=\"622\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Early morning checkout and proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&