17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdzpzZJwCc1xpK7kb5OB7LlZk_aXvBkqXTXf6fTpXpBdVSisPZS3B0wKTRy-9HBtsHpRMsNJ4lICc78H5i1F7aahD3o8YF2jllaBoFl_7Q6tmKLXFBf3NhDrXw7Tdv9P6G5uLk_yMbN0qemsu9HXdM?key=x0AIUmF0vbkcI5QRTnAXFA\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"87\" width=\"92\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from the date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 21 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. All prices are quoted in INR based on current ROE. In case of a major change in ROE the rates may be revised.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2. The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. We reserve the right to use alternative accommodation, sightseeing tours and transfer of equal or higher standard.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. We are not responsible for any missed breakfast due to flight/tour timings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. No refunds either in part or full will be made for any unused services in the above&nbsp; package like ground transportation, meals, accommodation, sightseeing tours.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. We are not responsible for any excess baggage charges on tour.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. We reserve the right to change any information, route or attractions before or after your booking due to events beyond our control like bad weather, any natural calamity, any accident, and or any logistic issues.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Vouchers will be released 48 hours after we receive the full payments / 07 days prior to the departure.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10. Guest are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">11. In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-07-08 11:36:59','sent','<70b3eacf-2655-5ffe-9e8e-06d26ae14de7@funstay.in>','11584',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(73,NULL,'goldenprocessors560@gmail.com','12019 l 8N9D Dazzling Dubai l Pardeep Singh Saini l 7 Pax l 19-27 August 2025','<p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdygITboFquz91OtVQAGXPDsrGT83E1NUIXkB0KKx0Y2Fhy1Et7O7QqVSivhvQAK2iX-Z6P41tICT7HOfU7Kk_rQx7PIcWM85lFECbz7LV6iUZVBQCqxFlQJOTaa-3tsGrGa9an5Tw_sRLC_4p2aQ?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" height=\"208\" width=\"797\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Pardeep,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=