0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PER ADULT: INR 1,90,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CHILD COST: INR 85,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4N Atlantis The Royal- Seascape King Room</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4N Dukes The Palm- A Royal Hideaway Hotel- Deluxe Studio</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Transfers using private AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30-day single-entry tourist visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dhow Cruise Marina</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Dubai City Tour with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor (Non-Prime Time tickets)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai Frame</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Museum of Future</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Abu Dhabi City Tour with Ferrari World</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Atlantis Aquaventure Waterpark</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">View at the Palm</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTIONAL UPGRADES AND SUPPLEMENTS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upgrade Burj Khalifa 124th Floor Prime Time @ Rs 1,750/- per person</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tourism Dirham to be paid directly to hotel (AED 15-25 per day per room)</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5% GST&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveller and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT DUBAI | TRANSFER TO THE HOTEL | DHOW CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Dubai- The city of Gold!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Dubai, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check In and rest for sometime.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 7PM, proceed for Dhow Cruise to experience something that is inexplicable and beyond your imagination with our 2-hour classy cruise. The Venetian styled canal will leave you and your loved ones impressed. This traditional dhow will offer you the best views of modern Dubai from the most unexpected angles. Witness the glorious architecture of Dubai that the world acknowledges while you feast on the international cuisines. An elegant and sophisticated setting will elevate your cruising experience and leave you with lovely memories to cherish for a lifetime. Entertainment will be arranged onboard, and you will be cruising while enjoying the savory dishes and drink. The stunning view, sumptuous meals and the live entertainment will give you a dazzling experience.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXenoElVc3e230P60XEXbUkbMx3cA6DZahrZx1h_a1FzwW5TSeHTcSVUcFW4FJmBZmtPwzOYVEkQuRmXyP9-XqkvE_klys_B6E0AaA6PNOQmZMYOZYbijmCJIocaHkuDw-eT801JN3_o55gjb6X87g?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" height=\"331\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: DUBAI CITY TOUR | DUBAI MALL | BURJ KHALIFA TOUR | FOUNTAIN SHOW</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a city tour of Dubai.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our 4-hour Dubai city tour would take you to the most prominent places in Dubai. You also get to see two different sides of Dubai, the historical one and the modern one. Beginning with the Dubai Museum, located in the Al Fahidi Fort (built in the 18th century), you get to see Dubai before it discovered oil and became the power city it is today. This is followed by a drive along the Dubai Creek, which is a historical area and still holds remnants of the past. You get to enjoy Arabic architecture with a visit to Jumeirah Mosque, which is the only mosque in Dubai open to non-Muslims. So, make the most of it. While the historical part of the city is quite interesting, your Dubai city tour would not be complete if you do not see its modern side.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The tour takes you Hotel Burj Al Arab (which is designed in the shape of a sail), the Palm Islands (largest artificial island in the world), Hotel Atlantis the Palm (the crowning glory of palm Jumeirah), Jumeirah Beach and Burj Khalifa (the tallest building in the world). The tour also includes a drive along the Shiekh Zayed Road so that you can take a look at the skyscrapers and magnificent buildings on both sides of the road.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 4PM proceed to enjoy the Dubai Mall. Dubai Mall is the world’s largest destination for shopping, entertainment and leisure, located next to the world\'s tallest building, the Burj Khalifa. Featuring over 1,200 retail stores, two major department stores and hundreds of food and beverage outlets, Dubai Mall covers more than 1 million sqm – an area equivalent to 200 football pitches.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After this, make your way to the 124th floor of Dubai\'s Burj Khalifa, the tallest of all the buildings in the world, standing tall and proud amongst the other skyscrapers of the city. One of the major landmarks of the city, the interiors of the Burj is as majestic as the steely exterior. During the tour, you are shown a multimedia presentation about the history of Dubai as well as the story of the construction of the building. Once you have gathered information about this tall structure, you are taken to the 124th floor observation deck on the fastest elevator. Here you get a chance to have a 360-degree panoramic view of the entire city of Dubai.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdwWd_J2b0h3Uj1r0fLBYBsxvNg6i3BFVvAqaAOcw0HU6D7ea5UfqSdSYKxXCV-qHp2226fAru2FzRYOPVsCmn5RN-PbqmGAEl2UnoQM1UTTkx7K1gwJDZCU_SdQ09gW3h6KyShMG7t5HosrwufEw?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"401.4888725280762\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later, at around 7PM, see the spectacular Fountain Show at the Lake beside Dubai Mall. This is an open to public show so just look for a comfortable spot at the edge of the lake and enjoy the mesmerizing musical extravaganza. After this you have time at leisure for dinner at Dubai Mall (at your own expense) and return to the hotel by 9PM.Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: DUBAI DESERT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, time at leisure till lunch. Later at around 2PM, proceed to enjoy Dubai Desert Safari. Our desert safari trip includes spending a few hours’ time in a Bedouin style tent, right in the middle of the desert. The tour begins with our vehicle picking you up from your hotel and driving you down to the outskirts of the desert. Once you arrive at the desert campsite, you can enjoy riding a camel, smoking a flavoured shisha, drinking the traditional Arabic coffee, enjoying the captivating belly dance and Tanura dance. Do not miss the chance to take some breath-taking pictures of the desert in your camera, especially during sunset. The colours of the setting sun on the sands would leave you mesmerized. Apart from this, you can try out the traditional costumes, get a henna tattoo and enjoy a delicious buffet dinner. After the dinner, you would be dropped back to your place of stay. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfpY1GDX0qqJwnfaCmpQGqc8vQZPOuethvec6EmSL0wh0sC4RAuvS3IcU4jfrZUWeaFexEiJtgQw2xosSeYOgsF10jcoKOGoy8ZNaFUlAuFDrfXNnLFfVnV5IMqwqqAT--iuF9XpY54hH4GWc9CUA?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" alt=\"Morning Desert Safari Tours Dubai 2025 - Dubai Travel Tourism\" height=\"278.44443926649114\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: DUBAI FRAME | MUSEUM OF FUTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, proceed to explore the Dubai frame: Standing tall at 150 m, Dubai Frame provides a bird’s eye view of the city\'s famous and spectacular skyline, you can experience the views of Old and New Dubai and see how the city has transformed to a one of a kind metropolitan.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd8UQGgrVx8fud6sSddK4j3cnRAKhE6OywZ30vPx1IYGwqGIu5_SENDJ6uWTo_p3Zx-2HLfxt_a30Y72DPlrldB-Db0JqOGmMWYwZj1Z13bb3Xki6H1HtUJ16duFjHTPeqmgmDxmu0YL_gt2RS_-g4?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, track, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"377.0752230155544\" width=\"602.0000000000001\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then proceed to the latest additions to the iconic architectural structures in Dubai- The Museum of Future. The Museum of the Future is an exhibition space for innovative and futuristic ideologies, services, and products. Located in the Financial District of Dubai, UAE, the Museum of the Future has three main elements: green hill, building, and void.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfkCfR3OyHP5qhRLUNG5zpaGYJs9imwyiRcC-POKJxki_FwFYJYCA-qBBvzfhBC1_i8i327eeZW7WU6HmoSpBiCEGkNotDMJSgbMRrsaV8T0_k0u1tT5wMJjgNGaZrI5Gf1gYXR540a_yN4akshPZI?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, grass, outdoor\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"401.81742668151855\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: ABU DHABI CITY TOUR WITH FERRARI WORLD</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after an early breakfast, proceed for the full day trip to Abu Dhabi.After a pickup from your centrally located hotel in Dubai, we’ll head you for an Abu Dhabi city tour. On this comprehensive tour, explore some of the capital city’s most legendary sights. Travel through the serene Sadiyat Island and enjoy a stopover at Date Market. This is followed by a drive along the picturesque Corniche area and then a photo op at Emirates Palace Hotel. Next in the itinerary is a trip to the massive and all-white Sheik Zayed Mosque, also known as Grand Mosque. Immerse in its tranquil ambience, admire the breathtaking architectural style, and catch exquisite views of such prized exhibits as gold chandeliers meticulously studded with Austrian Swarovski crystals.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfF7jV9uf02W-PvhZdULueCNk2KSdGTJDXQX6z0TXPZByjMhfMIYE7mMCh1yOgQqJtHWx-Uivwf3dk5WPeLVtzyJwuvFRoK46VoqHPJ5NVLPxlw1lPQK3CGLZMs6QgzGEA_Lr1ernXYi_iH7I6dgck?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" alt=\"A white building with towers\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with low confidence\" height=\"400.5863651037216\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Continue your comb tour with a visit to Ferrari World Theme Park on Yas Island. This sprawling, one-of-its-kind Ferrari inspired theme park has something for every age and skill. Experience the world’s fastest rollercoaster with a ride in Formula Rossa, take a virtual tour of Ferrari Factory in Maranello, and delight your little ones with attractions like Bell ‘Italia and Junior GT, among many others. You can further choose to dine at one of the eateries (at your own expense) within the park.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe1IhBRWEuvi4nrhar7ulXQrFkwB01WiZ7L0M-H7RTDkyPoF_4cc-6HTkd5sj0gZcOu8PrZ3yvggwUO_Tv_AxiBLwjSMPCWRhFVNHGRa1eY7tUFBPXxqvWPdxPR9T90C48AEXANOZ6Vs4oeridHzis?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" height=\"301.3392949104309\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This full day tour blending culture, modernity, and heart racing thrill comes to end with a convenient drop off to your location in Dubai.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DAY AT LEISURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This day is at leisure, you can explore the streets and markets on your own pace.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: ATLANTIS AQUAVENTURE PARK</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast, proceed to the iconic Atlantis Aquaventure Water Park with over 105 record breaking slides,attractions and experiences including a private beach and surf up wave rider for a day full of fun.Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcEVMJXNaKJOO5iMSpVZzBcP-Kirdb0IxYlS7TgKwSQFA7_kklzgisrMHLKHY-XzR-ZsWlSPB8ZeA0o-Z5BmJcvtFklxr4Js6HN11gOibp0va9WaaM2TjejX28AAIae-LHQQkdkm-OnkmrloUV7Fw?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" height=\"338.0372377528572\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 8: VIEW AT THE PALM&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast proceed to The Palm Jumeirah which is one of the most iconic attractions of Dubai. Known to be the biggest man made island in the world, the Palm Jumeirah is shaped in the form of a palm tree. Each of the 16 fronds of the palm island is home to luxurious hotels, beautiful villas, high-end boutiques and malls, pristine beaches, etc. Moreover, there is the Hotel Atlantis the Palm, which is the crowning glory of the island. The View is the observation deck on the 52nd floor of the Palm Tower, next to Nakheel Mall. The entrance to the building is on the roof of the mall, from where you take the elevator to the observation deck that is 240 meters above the palm island. Before you take the 3 minutes journey up to the deck, you can visit the interactive museum and gallery that will tell you the story about the creation of the Palm Jumeirah. Once you reach the deck, you get to see a 360o view of the Palm Jumeirah, the Dubai skyline and the Arabian Gulf.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdcoCJ5WWEQsW-lRUMhbnrXxoGBXuzWYPzmhwW7Q5ApHARheDkuyAwJ0nrIiS_1PgfRphVzDnM21nW2wfMXzPKku4oK7WEkJ1OOp_4q7WzCYxuKdBRRatLPZJFkJvZwKN0W3WKA68JJ_mxnf2xElbw?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" height=\"272\" width=\"602\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 9: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, time at leisure till checkout. Then proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa is required for visiting Dubai. Documents needed for eVisa for Dubai</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital colour copy of your passport size photograph (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background. Avoid blurred and unclear photos.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PAN Card</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa on arrival is available for Indian nationals with valid US, UK or Schengen Visa.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy and selected fare rules.</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 7,500 per Adult, Rs 2500 per Child): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25% Cancellation charges if cancelled anytime after confirmation but at least 30 days before travel date</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">50% Cancellation charges if cancelled within 30 days but before 15 days of travel date&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Cancellation charges if cancelled on or within 15 days of travel date</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Advance</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 30 days from date of travel: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 15 days from date of travel: Balance 50% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable. 3.5% for AMEX and International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;, please check with us if interested&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdFUX2lObGzMk--7dx3ZrexSc2AeF8yCcPgLN_0-ZN5eQcEGIDXLGg6BOaPnuw-Ia-ZDjYVWNihfF7ksvdxihlmHtlmnjVMi_HFpCcXf0zOCIUabLHkE_U84Q7dMsI2XTuElXCMbTep98I_gmB4XfI?key=3LvivLONycTBeb7F1c5vcg\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"102\" width=\"104\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transpare