ation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-07-08 13:30:18','sent','<5ae9f735-deb4-d21a-2d8d-ad4a155614ba@funstay.in>','12019',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(74,NULL,'puspak.das@funstay.in','Re: TDMCAV2871 RE: 11591 | Ravi | Singapore | TDMC | Land Package only','Hi Team,\n\nPFA the updated flight ticket. Also, share the final itinerary.\n\nThank You!\n\n\nRegards,\n\nPuspak Das\n\nSenior Associate - Sales & Operations\n\nPh: 8296494654\n\nDISCLAIMER: This communication is confidential and may be legally privileged. If you are not the intended recipient; (i) please do not read or disclose to others, (ii) please notify the sender by reply mail, and (iii) please delete this communication from your system.\n\nFunstay Services Private Limited\n\n1192/1, 22nd Cross, 24th Main, HSR Layout Sector 2, Bengaluru - 560102\n\nPhone:   +918287039039, E-Mail: booking@funstay.in\n\nwww.funstay.in<http://www.funstay.in/>\n\n________________________________\nFrom: Funstay Operations <ops@funstay.in>\nSent: Tuesday, July 8, 2025 10:49 AM\nTo: Atul Verma (Mr) <ops7@travel-dmc.com>; Ruchi Sarangi <ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in>\nCc: ops1 tdmc <ops1@travel-dmc.com>; Sanoj Yadav (Mr) <ops4@travel-dmc.com>; Puspak Das <puspak.das@funstay.in>\nSubject: Re: TDMCAV2871 RE: 11591 | Ravi | Singapore | TDMC | Land Package only\n\nHi Team,\n\nPayment done. TT copy attached.\nPassword-37873941\n\nRegards,\nRuchi Sarangi\n\nOn Mon, 7 Jul 2025 at 18:07, Funstay Operations <ops@funstay.in<mailto:ops@funstay.in>> wrote:\nHi Team,\n\nPayment processed today, will share the TT copy tomorrow morning.\n\nThank you.\n\n\nRegards,\nRuchi Sarangi\n\nOn Fri, 20 Jun 2025 at 12:22, Atul Verma (Mr) <ops7@travel-dmc.com<mailto:ops7@travel-dmc.com>> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Team,\n\n\n\nGreetings from Travel DMC Group !!!!!!\n\n\n\nKindly Update us about the below q