tay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-07-14 11:10:43','sent','<759dce7b-134b-4f9e-f0d4-3ec79508c491@funstay.in>','12092',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(82,NULL,'yashh_shah18@yahoo.co.in','12085 l 6N7D Dazzling Dubai & Abu Dhabi l Nitesh Shah l 6 Pax l 9th to 15th Jan 2026','<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXet_kzSla0wYZIRVW_Glg-qtaZJFvkM0NJ4iJb-ycdSqFASC26J9Oxto9TuwSJiQiAfOnsvaxfZQMUodA-aTHCtPtYDF5RC2nTCvABaXStQavATV4U44FJk7xthocFCE1DOnp0ZTg8V66iuST0L7lo?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" height=\"208\" width=\"797\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Nitesh,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Dubai &amp; Abu Dhabi as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 9-01-2026</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 15-01-2026</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 6N7D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 4 Adults 2 Children (3yrs, 11yrs)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 2</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PER ADULT: INR 80,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CHILD COST (3YRS): INR 35,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CHILD COST (11YRS): INR 50,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4N Dubai: 3* Citymax Hotel Bur Dubai, Standard Double Room</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2N Abu Dhabi: 4* City Seasons Al Hamra-&nbsp; Premium King</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai to Abu Dhabi using private AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Transfers using private AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30-day single-entry tourist visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dhow Cruise Creek&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day City Tour with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor (Non-Prime Time tickets)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai Frame</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Desert Safari </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Museum of Future</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Global Village &amp; Miracle Garden</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Abu Dhabi City Tour</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">General Admission to any 2 Theme Parks from Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Warner Bros. World Yas Island, SeaWorld Yas Island - Using Shuttle Service&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTIONAL UPGRADES AND SUPPLEMENTS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upgrade Burj Khalifa 124th Floor Prime Time @ Rs 1,750/- per person</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 39,000/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeWwrPM5diXlmma1BXcszDV60qm6RIh9ppPWzcNQUsf4-bRMX3bQQLascgSWqnZ8m4ESURicBpyDsarCJ2tsa5xiP2uN6c4gZg2QsWK2VwdrTIRtmCwnOnlg5cyD0acOk8HwDuHjAVsjos7stT_COg?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" height=\"83\" width=\"259\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tourism Dirham to be paid directly to hotel (AED 15-25 per day per room)</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5% GST&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT DUBAI, PICK UP TRANSFER, DHOW CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Dubai- The city of Gold!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Dubai, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check In and some time to rest. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">(early check in not included)</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 7PM, proceed for Dhow Cruise to experience something that is inexplicable and beyond your imagination with our 2-hour classy cruise. The Venetian styled canal will leave you and your loved ones impressed. This traditional dhow will offer you the best views of modern Dubai from the most unexpected angles. Witness the glorious architecture of Dubai that the world acknowledges while you feast on the international cuisines. An elegant and sophisticated setting will elevate your cruising experience and leave you with lovely memories to cherish for a lifetime. Entertainment will be arranged onboard, and you will be cruising while enjoying the savory dishes and drink. The stunning view, sumptuous meals and the live entertainment will give you a dazzling experience.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf20ril7UI4rRTgKstykOZhNoWHt_PJIL_BQXoZXYZsQ4w9zEYe4ClOfgwXBvX4_gy6U4sV6VnrpwciO62jRTYPYubEGjq0ebeBsvXaIX1fsf3WCG3B2dsccXCygqykfWtT1X10blKZch-37MidF1U?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" height=\"369\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: DUBAI CITY TOUR, DUBAI MALL, BURJ KHALIFA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a city tour of Dubai.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our 4-hour Dubai city tour would take you to the most prominent places in Dubai. You also get to see two different sides of Dubai, the historical one and the modern one. Beginning with the Dubai Museum, located in the Al Fahidi Fort (built in the 18th century), you get to see Dubai before it discovered oil and became the power city it is today. This is followed by a drive along the Dubai Creek, which is a historical area and still holds remnants of the past. You get to enjoy Arabic architecture with a visit to Jumeirah Mosque, which is the only mosque in Dubai open to non-Muslims. So, make the most of it. While the historical part of the city is quite interesting, your Dubai city tour would not be complete if you do not see its modern side.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The tour takes you Hotel Burj Al Arab (which is designed in the shape of a sail), the Palm Islands (largest artificial island in the world), Hotel Atlantis the Palm (the crowning glory of palm Jumeirah), Jumeirah Beach and Burj Khalifa (the tallest building in the world). The tour also includes a drive along the Shiekh Zayed Road so that you can take a look at the skyscrapers and magnificent buildings on both sides of the road.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 4PM proceed to enjoy the Dubai Mall. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Dubai Mall is the world’s largest destination for shopping, entertainment and leisure, located next to the world\'s tallest building, the Burj Khalifa. Featuring over 1,200 retail stores, two major department stores and hundreds of food and beverage outlets, Dubai Mall covers more than 1 million sqm – an area equivalent to 200 football pitches.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdc0xPPw5NaxIerTtk5HNtxWb4ddvoUpWgz2tzQKlNmCXnRDDJfeqmX5K3s-MyGTOOIKy8pBX_65MO8LmjA81Op70vWf3LRSJaKc0vZvtrSrTDiEf69zYJVW8BxDpv-dLZFesz2im9QC1k40xRrB5U?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" height=\"447\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After this, make your way to the 124th floor of Dubai\'s Burj Khalifa, the tallest of all the buildings in the world, standing tall and proud amongst the other skyscrapers of the city. One of the major landmarks of the city, the interiors of the Burj is as majestic as the steely exterior. During the tour, you are shown a multimedia presentation about the history of Dubai as well as the story of the construction of the building. Once you have gathered information about this tall structure, you are taken to the 124th floor observation deck on the fastest elevator. Here you get a chance to have a 360-degree panoramic view of the entire city of Dubai.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcGV6Wchpmbwp4rVJivvlmR6MzN5SFhZKVvqOSZTYkLtJ_3J_3LOhefjBBd74bDNWfnDFgaqxkoCAZoWm5QRyM0EL-8m8DH-LZXw6VeNv5HUwYIJH8ZQ0463z4iWLHLGpii_X4OBZ8HnCRCtFMNgqU?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"447.19849195844864\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later, at around 7PM, see the spectacular Fountain Show at the Lake beside Dubai Mall. This is an open to public show so just look for a comfortable spot at the edge of the lake and enjoy the mesmerizing musical extravaganza. After this you have time at leisure for dinner at Dubai Mall (at your own expense) and return to the hotel by 9PM.Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: DUBAI FRAME l DUBAI DESERT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, proceed to explore the Dubai frame: Standing tall at 150 m, Dubai Frame provides a bird’s eye view of the city\'s famous and spectacular skyline, you can experience the views of Old and New Dubai and see how the city has transformed to a one of a kind metropolitan.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc4o9QBz9Ptvdf5PCyDalSgrJsNWyjmuxEmxuVYxGuJey9zDwje39PIT1EIkr7PwkCpqV6OfybRRIF0iwjb35e-T9t6-Z-Z9djnkkF3uIFLEak7K-OaG5olATBSxoowhqbar4fe0IiOPvmFFoumdZM?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, track, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"418.9651560645206\" width=\"669.0000000000001\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 2PM, proceed to enjoy Dubai Desert Safari. Our desert safari trip includes spending a few hours’ time in a Bedouin style tent, right in the middle of the desert. The tour begins with our vehicle picking you up from your hotel and driving you down to the outskirts of the desert. Once you arrive at the desert campsite, you can enjoy riding a camel, smoking a flavoured shisha, drinking the traditional Arabic coffee, enjoying the captivating belly dance and Tanura dance. Do not miss the chance to take some breath-taking pictures of the desert in your camera, especially during sunset. The colours of the setting sun on the sands would leave you mesmerized. Apart from this, you can try out the traditional costumes, get a henna tattoo and enjoy a delicious buffet dinner. After the dinner, you would be dropped back to your place of stay. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfbhf48w5ItWRMHvEh7wQlNczc1woM_GGiWC4U7eu7Yq9T4PpyHpnboT4Ud0koNah-IoovpMb8Qcj4XjZ9cFoyBseHyo6M57KLDSW3FKYqtULi2qdJxgSuhPoxVYpkUJ8FnjOXmLtXSKpAt7kvVpA?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"A picture containing dune\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"351.2316601863055\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: MUSEUM OF FUTURE l GLOBAL VILLAGE &amp; MIRACLE GARDEN</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">, proceed to the latest additions to the iconic architectural structures in Dubai- The Museum of Future. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Museum of the Future is an exhibition space for innovative and futuristic ideologies, services, and products. Located in the Financial District of Dubai, UAE, the Museum of the Future has three main elements: green hill, building, and void.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdpxxfdcTtKAgVc4O4Cno4fWKij_XYON6BrVkRMjiA7Ml8Ry2EFA_68gIIcONZ65iNWEcQgm4xchT42mjk67USHJKmwmGLgJMC63UYCTRKUX6ItBmviaFJhQDnkD5n949oR3hIwgUyMRDrw2nUswUI?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, grass, outdoor\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"446.6286491415148\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At around 2PM, we proceed for visit Miracle Garden, Travel to the botanical paradise of Dubai Miracle Garden, spanning 72000 square meters of stunningly laid out landscape. Opened in 2013 as an effort to create a lush oasis in the middle of the desert, this garden has since then become one of Dubai’s most visited attractions, drawing millions of visitors per year. As you enter the garden, stroll along the painstakingly manicured themed gardens as well as pathways, and admire its several unique structures and water features – all stupendously decked up with a vivid array of flowers and plants. Filled with over 100 million blooming flowers from 70 plus rare, exotic and indigenous floral species, the garden is also recognized by Guinness Book of World Records for its astonishing flower wall, which is the largest of its kind in the world.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXctEYUlwU2jQayLSuqdLbkB56tv9gbmljRe5vDrbENDBZD6NVt8fpY6Hftl6nmpgRt0nb8QMiC2laQYUb12ysfLb1qkEbYnLP78Ra5b8QnF5BYyhAjO3KrYks7x3_bspyYOrTKmjxRcP1fxwySp57U?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" height=\"190\" width=\"338\"> <img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdLkZRrinZ3OuMqJ5wWCeob28XhwayQ1vWMxJlbEcrQJ1iD3hm6rD_X_FEqXariiveH0vCodUb_oTN8RA7XbRUoaFI_n3kwehToTkL1IrPZrmYkL0xVrpXqPvAATplOz1YJ9VoO6jhn2cYDqBJ40A?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"Global Village Dubai Tickets Image\" height=\"193\" width=\"323\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Next up in today’s program is the amazing Global Village. It is known as the world\'s largest tourism, leisure and entertainment project located at Dubai land. We bring you the best of Global Village - region’s cultural, entertainment and tourism project with unlimited fun, excitement and adventure. From children rides, family rides to thrilling rides; Global Village is great on the entertainment quotient. Visited by over five million people every year, The Global Village brings together the best of cultural offerings through 32 giant stalls and pavilions representing more than 75 countries with different cultures. The food, the souvenirs, shopping, rides, and excitement all makes it a cosmopolitan and diverse experience for all our guests. Our exclusively designed Global Village tours ensure that our guests start having fun from the word go. Global Village was started as an initiative to highlight the cultural aspect of Dubai and the cosmopolitan blend that the city with over 85% of the expat population represents. Over the years, the Global Village has transformed into a much bigger, grander and colossal event that has its distinctive presence on a global scale. Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: TRANSFER TO ABU DHABI | ABU DHABI CITY TOUR&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after an early breakfast, checkout and proceed for the full day trip to Abu Dhabi. After a pickup from your centrally located hotel in Dubai, we’ll head you for an Abu Dhabi city tour. On this comprehensive tour, explore some of the capital city’s most legendary sights. Travel through the serene Sadiyat Island and enjoy a stopover at Date Market. This is followed by a drive along the picturesque Corniche area and then a photo op at Emirates Palace Hotel. Next in the itinerary is a trip to the massive and all-white Sheik Zayed Mosque, also known as Grand Mosque. Immerse in its tranquil ambience, admire the breathtaking architectural style, and catch exquisite views of such prized exhibits as gold chandeliers meticulously studded with Austrian Swarovski crystals.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfTUb2LFB6q5qwGgC2hzT2Zlekm_pHE4hF0dGWaO0kgEO2n34sIe9MZdD-5RXYM0NaX-Qy6AoYSbo35XiDNPI9KSBRdeR4UOt89feuUs4cxZIYL81hd7ylm5f1SrQbS1OgixuBPopLfFW0apPwwh_Y?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"A white building with towers\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with low confidence\" height=\"446.07880304293985\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This full day tour blending culture, modernity, and heart racing thrill comes to end with a convenient drop off to your location in Abu Dhabi. Check-in and rest of the day is at your leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">YAS ISLAND THEME PARK</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, proceed to the park using Shuttle Service (on your own) and spend the entire day.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">*Yas Island 4 Theme Parks:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Ferrari World Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Warner Bros. World Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Seaworld Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">YAS ISLAND THEME PARK | </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast checkout and keep your luggage at the lobby and proceed to the park using Shuttle Service (on your own). In the evening around 10:00PM proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">*Yas Island 4 Theme Parks:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Ferrari World Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Warner Bros. World™ Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Seaworld Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa is required for visiting Dubai. Documents needed for eVisa for Dubai</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital colour copy of your passport size photograph (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background. Avoid blurred and unclear photos.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PAN Card</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa on arrival is available for Indian nationals with valid US, UK or Schengen Visa.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy and selected fare rules.</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 7,500 per adult &amp; Rs 2,500 per child): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25% Cancellation charges if cancelled any time after confirmation but at least 30 days before travel date</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">50% Cancellation charges if cancelled within 30 days but before 15 days of travel date&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Cancellation charges if cancelled on or within 15 days of travel date</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Advance</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 30 days from date of travel: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 15 days from date of travel: Balance 50% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable. 3.5% for AMEX and International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;, please check with us if interested&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfr5Ar9MfSug1htcmSVEXvASznyM-oKV2jwaNpGm561wDSlSgoRWz0yOTnupUKsLfGORA1Q09kZ2vwYFrx6hXaAbCtK3WSpVhskPmI1nUOpo2NuAU5gTVA864q8fGRr9j48Hc7Q_HrSodYEpIOxsdI?key=SQD0M8mE6pdytvSFLzecoQ\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"93\" width=\"100\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Standard Check in time at the hotel is 3PM and checkout time is 12PM. Early check in &amp; Late Check Out is subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The itinerary is tentative, the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in Dubai, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with Dubai Govt guidelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-07-15 07:30:15','sent','<d08e2868-5dbd-1d4e-80a8-970bb8ff42c0@funstay.in>','12085',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(83,NULL,'puspak.das@funstay.in','xfbngd','<p>fnbdgfxns</p>',NULL,'2025-07-15 10:07:32','sent','<91557e13-74db-94cd-1d8a-98c6cf346fc9@funstay.in>','11777',1,'puspak.das@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(84,NULL,'sidz.143@gmail.com','12120 l 7N8D Blissful Bali l  Siddharth Das l 3 Pax l 16th to 23rd September 2025','<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcAKWAwFPKNx5q_Bce8XUiUcJayerNQdjONs-Mr9jDDKiuUhtqKzEVmxcdnlgLoZ0onY9rmLwfx5_gg7X8yLO5iQMtQI1HLYb17qf_5D9MZ7wEaAuuRU8Txd1ruAbuUNT7fzR_cdGW1IZV-3xa6mQ?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"174\" width=\"668\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dear Siddharth,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;you can also go through our reviews at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Bali as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check in Date: 16th Sept 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check out Date: 23rd Sept 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 7N8D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults 1 Child (3yrs)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3 STAR LAND PACKAGE COST:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL IN UBUD</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL IN KUTA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">COST PER PERSON (IN INR)</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4N Ubud Tropical Garden,&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Deluxe Room</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3N Adi Dharma Hotel Kuta,&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Deluxe Room</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">INR 1,48,000/- + 5%TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL: </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As mentioned above</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MEAL PLAN</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA: </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">e-Visa &amp; Tourism Levy</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOURS &amp; TRANSFERS: ( All transfers on Private basis)</strong></p><ul><li>Airport Arrival transfer</li><li>Inter hotel transfers</li><li>Departure Transfer between Kuta hotel to the airport</li><li>Kintamani&nbsp;tour&nbsp;with&nbsp;mount&nbsp;batur&nbsp;view&nbsp;point,&nbsp;tegalalang&nbsp;rice&nbsp;terraces,bali swing - Private</li><li>Tirta Gangga &amp; Besakih Great Temple - Private&nbsp;</li><li>Bali Safari &amp; Marine Park- Private&nbsp;</li><li>Kanto Lampo Waterfall - Private&nbsp;</li><li>Half Day Evening Sunset Tanah Lot Tour – Private</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Nusa Penida Tour&nbsp; (Kelingking Beach, Broken Beach, Angel Billabong) with lunch, 2 way ferry- Private</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Full Day tour of watersports (banana boat, jet ski, parasailing), and Uluwatu Temple with Kecak Dance</span>- Private</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </strong><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 40,000/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfiM0q_d42uoBN6pB63k8o9qRm9t9X_F2mazSSdAeShx0SE97mfBMGG6NgTlmi7LTjN7IAjJzgDD8ld4z5fXI4TIG0slnL4Vnj5ryVMKHAaYzyWfSX5pTedY-tWKACbwLYTYK5708ONiLZ7OjwLXU8?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"98\" width=\"290\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Entrance Tickets.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for a full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GST @ 5%</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, a TCS of 5% is to be collected for all foreign remittances for travel outside India. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to the traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR).</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT BALI |TRANSFER TO UBUD | EVENING AT LEISURE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Bali- the Island of Gods!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Bali, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel in Ubud. Check-In and some time to rest. The rest of the day is at leisure to explore the area on your own. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXekKn-MJaGUXuH8JRqA2l5ksc6Yv0WkZtahiMnD5M7xIA8JQ47jR3wNjAjrl7sLiiWSDEC0rA-4_MTy29xLOop_4c2qIOdrR5a7RC5TDYLjPIJuIEfxLExnAZ2Iu0Nj3QxQpyooZa4FkKtcYFigkEs?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" alt=\"Visit the Monkey Forest in Ubud - Hue Bali\" height=\"376.38723604461296\" width=\"669.6405992372976\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2 KINTAMANI&nbsp;TOUR&nbsp;WITH&nbsp;MOUNT&nbsp;BATUR&nbsp;VIEW&nbsp;POINT|&nbsp;TEGALALANG&nbsp;RICE&nbsp;TERRACES | BALI SWING | UBUD ART MARKET</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, time to proceed for the Kintamani Tour. Visit the Mount Batur View Point, Though an active volcano, the last Mount Batur eruption was recorded in 2000. The hike, though an easy climb, is advised to be done with a local guide.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tegalalang Rice Terraces, Tegalalang Rice Terrace is one of the famous tourist attractions in Bali situated in Tegalalang Village north of Ubud Bali featured by the amazing rice terrace set on the cliff. Tegalalang Village is located 600 m above sea levels covered by good temperature where most of the villagers are farmers.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overnight stay in the Hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeHrdJkOGFk6iafMlaY_V5gsox-xBEDVGT4GKEvwyEbddRNx3Oi3Fgf5vVBTTG7fXhVNSPzjDfR0zc8kZmNqQT29z2qfC8_K1g1-FRUDHbSv0jWlYF2YkHcjA5d35yAMfwmqP850wvxF6kTRxG2EIc?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"204\" width=\"319\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfkgUGiXFVd2Th4UCGf40iILgiNqRJ-J0oxOZidtxbD9nhfBuXkxBSHiQvk4AEkSNY6CxaG0gqWzXGvZXJDknFhRzfykWjuO4AyvOiFbzodDGHuDFASylh3Y6W-YX-GT9nxbgfjg61hwWK0bm2dR6k?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"205\" width=\"328\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: TIRTHA GANGA | BESAKIH&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast at your hotel, your day will begin with your journey to Tirta Gangga, one of Bali’s most beautiful and peaceful water palaces. Located in the village of Ababi, Tirta Gangga is known for its stunning water gardens, fountains, and statues. The complex is a picturesque maze of stone paths, koi ponds, and lush tropical gardens, creating a perfect place for a leisurely walk. You’ll have time to explore the royal bathing pools and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere of this tranquil setting, which was once the royal water palace of the Karangasem Kingdom.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeSeZDzq6JL3asuXUBdXoDHq7wirkuV7byltLKOYuqoQHSauc2DuyDcgULpthntLlY8KpBWr_yEb_a35wCi5QcFSUuSTRzizxwKAIpSevd5P90C4KhrNnyqiwG-TqNNvhEWogBCWi-2DOPTqzIL-w?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"285\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After lunch (on your own). Next, continue your exploration with a visit to Besakih Temple, Bali’s largest and holiest temple complex, often referred to as the \"Mother Temple\" of Bali. Situated on the majestic slopes of Mount Agung, Besakih Temple consists of over 80 individual temples and is the spiritual center of the island. As you walk through the complex, you’ll be surrounded by grand architecture, ancient statues, and sacred shrines, all offering insight into Balinese Hinduism. From the temple, you’ll also enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of the surrounding landscapes, including lush green valleys and distant mountains. It’s a perfect place to take in the natural beauty of Bali while reflecting on its spiritual heritage.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcjoKd54T4xMo5WYCfzmhndtxiKEnLuH80iu9zDAX0NN9QTtV5mJ65AvqIVMrbLsBWoIWN1XoX6tEHWxT2qfoMM4HY-QaV_fT4-SO77wVrNsowQowDuDkA4SFLtdlVukDlCo4ZQTV45RHzSo91QXQ?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"447.46043975582296\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: BALI SAFARI &amp; MARINE PARK</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, proceed for the Bali Safari Tour. Bali Safari Park, The African Safari Adventure in Bali. Home to over a thousand amazing animals and your finest destination for an adventurous, fun and educational experience more than just a safari. Our park represents more than 120 species, including rare &amp; endangered species like the Komodo Dragons, Orangutan, Bali Starling bird, and many more. After Bali Safari return to hotel, night at leisure.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeWfXmtrKrfnvDX3z_slD1EF1vUogObk4tbOGOvpQGtO1XHzP6GlutULHp6oQ3T8JoZd5T-tFsARrIfpEvO44FDfxxuOi4wFO0z4bEyRgSEBB7wKpd4qyEjaDRVPiFC6Yv27CMkKYfLq6-o4kQGzRQ?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"500.8571215621973\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: KANTO LAMPO WATERFALL | TANAH LOT SUNSET | INTER HOTEL TRANSFER&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast at your hotel before embarking on an exciting visit to Kanto Lampo Waterfall, a hidden gem nestled in the lush jungle of Bali. Known for its unique, tiered formation, this beautiful waterfall allows you to take a refreshing dip in its cool waters or simply enjoy the stunning natural surroundings. The waterfall is less crowded, offering a serene atmosphere to relax and connect with nature.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcLbLeuMc8iI0KS-bWpfnsuaQDfGHJ5rKjwHSLhALiMadJ3l1GljUt4QPI7SBdwvUZs0he3jgXTldd2-_qWdvTdqG8VGDBDT2K-YyfYp1Lo1auoiWOvtwEmxws5SDerA3DT01-AjBpzRY-4-UBstGM?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" height=\"446.9258186678548\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After spending some time at Kanto Lampo, it will be time to head towards Tanah Lot Temple, one of Bali\'s most important landmarks, famed for its unique offshore setting and sunset backdrops. An ancient Hindu shrine perched on top of an outcrop amidst constantly crashing waves.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then Begin your scenic transfer from the serene Ubud area to the lively, vibrant beaches of Kuta. The journey will take you through the lush landscapes of Bali, and upon arrival, you\'ll have time to explore Kuta\'s bustling streets, famous beaches, and exciting nightlife. The rest of the evening is yours to enjoy at leisure, whether you choose to relax on the beach, shop, or discover the many dining options available in Kuta. Overnight stay in the hotel.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfB-bN2oEoj-x_Ru6OmibcgohCjNfWUwyX5kMWXcko1_gnm9G0QDZU2vWSffN7KhoVpvWWlB_wQUOEUz0GohIefnqk33Omj6-rhEmpG5XfaWJSiI2vXA5LS-a3AbS4NqRD0ei0GzkVDsPYXuiZLIfg?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" alt=\"2023 Tanah Lot Temple and Uluwatu Temple Tour with Shopping\" height=\"446.2467761639744\" width=\"669.7836468668341\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: NUSA PENIDA DAY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, it’s a full day of beach hopping. It is an exotic and still virgin charming island nestled in the waters between Bali and Lombok has slowly but surely become a favorite with travelers for its beautiful beaches, rugged coastline and relaxed way of life. Overnight stay in a hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf6LkdgksoLA9rX6716kTQJV3RT5MhBwEj6aR7qbyiWfLIhW6EIcxF_JKRa4bDIZhU4XnJAoJ8SAliSLvsNwAfo_FTm8ZMdNCzSWmp0c2KmyzZ0mM5FgN861JNrtyzGwWxGG0sXHwiLjDgU1reugvM?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" alt=\"West Nusa Penida Full Day Tour - Inclusive Bali Tour\" height=\"281.6009409316581\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: FULL DAY TOUR OF WATER SPORTS ULUWATU TEMPLE WITH KECAK DANCE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, proceed to experience exciting Water Sports (banana boat, jet ski, parasailing), Nusa Dua Peninsula Island and Uluwatu Temple.Tanjung Benoa Water Sports offers a huge variety of watersports, from&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.tanjungbenoawatersports.com/activity/jet-ski/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">jet ski,</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.tanjungbenoawatersports.com/activity/parasailing/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">parasailing,&nbsp;</a><a href=\"http://www.tanjungbenoawatersports.com/activity/snorkeling/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">snorkeling</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, scuba diving,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.tanjungbenoawatersports.com/activity/sea-walker/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">seawalker</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, fly board and your choice of water based activities is limitless. Later around 3pm and&nbsp; visit the famous Uluwatu Temple, Uluwatu Temple (Pura Luhur Uluwatu) is one of six key temples believed to be Bali\'s spiritual pillars, is renowned for its magnificent location, perched on top of a steep cliff approximately 70 metres above sea level. Overnight stay at the hotel.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdC60DVcRLClhuZ7cJ_JvTJmmCA_M97k7MMW6iQpZX28inCNrzD0zLvGwz4qPfi9Na39uA4jKE-iOEsKbILIhVfZC7yJV-Afr28ZGTqUB-Fpmt8vzwnpjAur5YivKdsQhYDEZEipDZ3T1Ep9S69V7E?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" alt=\"Special Offer! Half-Day Tour: Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Fire Dance Show –  ENJOYKUTA.COM | Book Tours &amp; Things To Do in Bali\" height=\"371.930208390308\" width=\"669.7970584996145\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 8: DEPARTURE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceeds to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;A passport that is valid and still valid for at least 6 months</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A return flight ticket or a one-way ticket to continue the journey to another country</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;It is also suggested to carry 2 passport size photographs (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Flight:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% at the time of confirmation</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Land Package:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from the date of travel: 100% of package cost + Applicable TCS &amp; GST</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Payments can be made via an electronic transfer to the account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner Finzy,&nbsp;check your eligibility &amp; terms here:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://finzy.com/borrow?channel-partner-id=5c94cc885c0e50767c0f3dce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>EMI</strong></a></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeo5dMqgPrnMUwR62mBu0JfA4CFZQ11GfXce58yt9xIdM1Uu2wF93INlQe-AAHZBV67UD7fwnGIFNAdGhBL-4Kw8iA6yjj89yi-_ERkUBbFS4W1u0TyVyhtJjbOK25JBdL718U74ohNgmHIl3PvsYE?key=zK7jI-EMI-pryCUCfZC9uA\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"96\" width=\"100\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Flight:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy &amp; fare conditions</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Land Package:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If canceled on or before 31 days from the date of travel: 10% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If canceled on or before 27 days from the date of travel: 50% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If canceled on or within 21 days from the date of travel: 100% of package cost (non-refundable)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"backgro