','sent','<2af24fd1-ec93-d5b8-4add-10b3ac1de14c@funstay.in>','12120',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(85,NULL,'ankitmohantymails@gmail.com','12128 l 6N7D Marvellous Malaysia l Ankit Mohanty l 3 Pax l 20th to 26th December 2025','<p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfIIj1AkeLvc1koQWcMMC0Uewn2F1E034HmtSDNH4TNiNLSQdhdkIm7_GwGyEa5c-DissvZ-1930QcCT5mozjvlKB6DxsqsuqckusQZMqcSEL3ygdGr4SYd5lQJJrcm_1B46G204VLSsN0xhrnRAg?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"175\" width=\"673\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Ankit,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ location across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also amongst the fastest growing company in experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews&nbsp; at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Malaysia as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Start Date: 20th December 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">End Date: 26th December 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1 Room&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults 1 Child (5yrs)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST (FOR ALL TRAVELLERS): RS 1,40,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">IN GENTING HIGHLAND: RESORT WORLD GENTING 3* , FIRST WORLD HOTEL, TRIPLE ROOM WITH BREAKFAST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">IN KUALA LUMPUR: HOTEL MAYA KLCC 5*, HERITAGE ROOM WITH BREAKFAST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">IN LANGKAWI: BAYVIEW HOTEL LANGKAWI 4*, DELUXE ROOM WITH BREAKFAST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: As per option provided</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All Tours Transfers on Private basis&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sunset Cruise Experience in Langkawi on Shared basis</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Batu Caves &amp; Genting Highland</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Genting Highland Cable Car</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Petronas Twin Tower Ticket (Subject to availability)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Langkawi Underwater Zoo with transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Langkawi Grand Island Tour (entrance tickets not included)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Langkawi Cable Car &amp; Sky bridge (tickets included)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sunset Cruise Experience in Langkawi, Standard Sunset Dinner Cruise on shared basis</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 43,300/- per person, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXekNGcyLgbOVaDvLBG4X8GjM3_L3s9mvt49wFbN0Gryub7WBiaBDGkwo2CfZl-EK1QqCUw_77Ltn1z0lNZ4S8zBfvrOvyRHb91YwLtdIAQha5dB3oMdEs6o1UiqpgDFS1lOY_w5-3IFUsM6VMoAl0o?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"133\" width=\"288\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">WELCOME TO MALAYSIA!!</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Malaysia</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> is like two countries in one, cleaved in half by the South China Sea. While the peninsula flaunts bustling cities, colonial architecture, misty tea plantations and chill-out islands, Malaysian Borneo hosts wild jungles of orangutans, granite peaks and remote tribes, along with some pretty spectacular diving. Throughout these two regions is an impressive variety of microcosms ranging from the space-age high-rises of Kuala Lumpur to the traditional longhouse villages of Sarawak.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If there was one thing that unites all its pockets of ethnicities, religions and landscapes, it’s food. Between the Chinese-Malay ‘Nonya’ fare, Indian curries, Chinese buﬀets, Malay food stalls and Dayak specialties, with some impressive Western-style food thrown in for good measure, travellers will never go hungry here.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT MALAYSIA, PICK UP TRANSFER TO HOTEL IN GENTING HIGHLAND</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival in Kuala Lumpur, complete immigration and meet your driver at the arrival area. Transfer to hotel and check in. Today you will visit Genting Highlands and Chin Swee Caves Temple. Your English speaking driver will act as your guide throughout the tour, sharing the history of Malaysia while he/she navigates the road.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Your ride will continue on to Genting Skyway. Experience riding Southeast Asia\'s fastest and longest cable car, a great way to spook and amaze the kids. This ride allows you to stop at any station, including Chin Swee Station. Hop off and tour the iconic nine-storey Chin Swee Caves Temple for a chance to see the \'blessing lamps\'. Devotees believe that these lamps are blessed, especially when dedicated. After viewing the lamps, help the kids climb up the Sky Terrace for a great view of the 15-meter high Buddha statue.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeMTzosPfHPkP5m-WQSilrtA-aCEWP1FHCZobXyxqqbX_k2nfV6WCbOvjCLh8YwwH8O7sZnHkRmrzx_kJujKZVdkl9RH3705yHr5WehscKucGtPKJFo2UVY5k0PhGZBxJacJCW6cpOINGaYujYt1XE?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"266.76734733581543\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Extend the fun with a ride back to Genting Highlands, where all the entertainment is. Inside you\'ll find several theme parks and attractions, such as Ripley\'s Adventureland. Restaurants are readily available too, and the staff are incredibly patient with hungry kids. At the end of the tour drive back to your hotel in KL and rest of the day is free at leisure. Overnight stay in the hotel at Genting Highland.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2:&nbsp; DAY AT LEISURE AT GENTING HIGHLAND</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This day will be at leisure to explore the theme parks and attractions, casinos available at the Genting Highland. Enjoy the pleasant weather and overnight stay in the hotel at Genting Highland.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcuvwtaD4J6vsKUxJ7n2aI4ZpzrbdCbWctiyvfald8ibsARj-1ioyraKXFyTzjkpGRa0j7cm2oDSV4QlsSQc9WGU1rufPv46-kr8dIApkYF1A0B32U8LjtwcKNehSrgbh5NpL7MHhh80COBh2X2HQ?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"418.9388909351136\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: RETURN TO KUALA LUMPUR ENROUTE VISIT BATU CAVES | PETRONAS TWIN TOWER</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, checkout and proceed to Kuala Lumpur city. On your way to the city, your driver will first drop by Batu Caves. One of Malaysia\'s most visited attractions, Batu Caves is a limestone hill consisting of three major caves and various smaller ones. This 100-year-old cave network\'s limestone formations house Hindu shrines, making it an important religious landmark for Hindus. Other caves also house Hindu statues and paintings, like the Art Gallery Cave and Museum Cave.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcB7FawV-jfO9pO3pIPQm881wBoyvOaEhPrzlyXRL_vN1dXSawmjI42ngFtHK1BOgdYOjqWw3hnkqPMaJq2iFJrOJ1WoCumNnDyZTW6RUN_ra2tMaQr9EneNBGpohDrIoMWKXjg6Cw4cM8dAW0VZlM?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"413.7201255830448\" width=\"654\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then continue your journey to the city. Upon arrival check in and rest for a while.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the evening, proceed to visit the Petronas Twin Towers. No trip to KL would be complete without a visit to the world\'s tallest twin towers. The skyscrapers are utterly stunning, particularly when illuminated at night. The Twin Towers Visit Operations is open Tuesday through Sunday and tickets are released at 8:30 a.m. on a first-come, first-served basis. To avoid disappointment, you can purchase your ticket in advance via online ticketing or at the Ticketing Counter, Concourse Level.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcQ_n02IHwjMmyfqyznUM1bg8jRCfSTRMiH2sCyPNQppliE0xRocfp-xCds9B2n6VvtGRCYh6gmNJeJrohTkaYdChWHxFqgUJm3ur59VIzRZNJnGc4REODvP9JlhU7979FES6UZJGqvqsy_1a5n9A?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"446.8897830528697\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: TRANSFER TO LANGKAWI | LANGKAWI UNDERWATER WORLD </strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, proceed to the airport for your flight to Langkawi. Upon arrival at Langkawi, transfer to the hotel and check in. After some time at leisure, at around 3:00PM, proceed for Langkawi Under Water world. Spread across nearly six acres, Underwater World Langkawi is one of the island’s best-known attractions. There are more than 500 species of animals and sea creatures in more than 100 specially designed tanks being exhibited here.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdl28Tj4z7khTQEiYVNwconfvvgxbVluidhu4MbqmmgLkeHiJ5r7-rQq3PS37M5vFQ9jizoBkKwbAbGl0z72FXD-s_Ly4DV2OY_RcKNA4ztN4I78GD0hz_F6yZgL3VE7Unyum0Pxhf0tO2nlaPcYn0?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"383.83883206496415\" width=\"670\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After the underwater world tour rest of the evening at leisure. You may explore Pantai Cenang at your own pace. Pantai Cenang, the busiest beach town on Langkawi Island, where you can find a diverse mix of cafes &amp; restaurants, as well as souvenir shops, and duty-free outlets along its picturesque beach strip. Featuring white sands and clear waters, Pantai Cenang’s expansive beach is also great for sunbathing and exciting water sports such as jet skiing and parasailing. Pantai Cenang’s nightlife scene is the liveliest on Langkawi Island, with plenty of beachfront bars and lounges offering inexpensive alcohol and snacks, as well as live music &amp; cultural performances.Return to hotel and overnight stay at Langkawi Hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: GRAND ISLAND TOUR, LANGKAWI CABLE CAR &amp; SKY BRIDGE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, your driver will pick you up around 9AM for a full day tour of the island. The untouched island of Langkawi abounds in both scenic and cultural treasures. Our Langkawi Grand Tour takes you around the island and introduces you to its must-experiences including a cable car ride, while amply throwing light on the region’s fascinating history and mysterious folklore. Discover the intriguing secrets of the intricate Batik Art on your trip to Atma Alam Batik Art Village. Next, prepare yourself for a distinctive experience as you stop at the Tomb of Mahsuri whose name is largely attributed to the island’s newfound status as a flourishing tourist center. Listen to your guide for more captivating details of Mahsuri\'s Folklore involving a poignant tale of curse.&nbsp; Backed by a titillating legend of a mermaid, a visit to Black Sand Beach will further treat you to one of the island’s most picturesque beaches.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcGMDOZInmTOgraSef5g9xmVrV_ZRVKV8Z4h5XvmtRfLVarZSvBxM5duJJlHvSYJAUrvchDG9z2XkNdik-CffdjhJ6opSc0vrcpNMxMdKl32gWmuDVTc-D1iJc9DRxrOqkz-UYOls8DEP0k-fFw76Q?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" alt=\"Eagle Square - Visit Langkawi – The Sustainable Paradise Island\" height=\"314.020805738693\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Continue your sightseeing to Kuah Town which welcomes you with a colossal sculpture of a brown eagle ready to take a flight. Pose for some great pictures in front of this monument that is famed as the Eagle Square and then engage in duty-free shopping, besides exploring its many mindblowing attractions. Following the lunch break, we’ll take you to the awe-inspiring Crocodile Farm. You’ll come across several different species of crocodiles in this 20-hectare facility which is the largest-of-its-kind in Malaysia.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcuymPGwqIXH82XAnS53kfwG9LRv5SVyksgIKan7-QBmPe0yK23VpbDiUxazXe0HU4ynm2ZMq8obXs9vOunJgyjSY8RIKS3t997KrpxXH49-0FkWYtCoct5StePxSl7S115mP6JHCgkVMiBbScgNA?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" alt=\"Langkawi Cable Car and Sky Bridge, Malaysia, Langkawi - WorldWithaTwist.com\" height=\"267.4542412411905\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Explore the Oriental Village, and finally, make your way to Langkawi Cable Car where the most exciting part of your tour awaits. As your cable car ride takes you from the Base Station to the peak of Mount Cincang, this lets you soak up the island’s breathtaking natural scenery in all its majesty. At the end of the tour, return to the hotel and overnight stay at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdKj72p8B2QT7Jx5IWRjnEdnJPeL8oNKRzKPqAsj3FLonNKJwew1eiBvptRvp3AxT1VCppECSTTloRaLMWaZjreV3NJYYG9IpSPBA1ErvvowxlefedKCJyBiFXGIBURHIm83Oq5njaICX5ji-lgROQ?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" alt=\"Everything You Need to Know About Langkawi SkyCab | Panorama Langkawi\" height=\"294.2684530842455\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: SUNSET CRUISE EXPERIENCE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the afternoon after lunch, proceed for a sunset cruise experience. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">This cruise in Langkawi will have you intimately appreciate the wonderful sights of this place. Watch the majestic sunset. Enjoy on-board Karaoke. You will also get a chance for Kayaking and paddle board experience. Wrap up the experience as you dock back to the port.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfabIY8_X5vvu-rfuXqQ51OaiCrGY0XZ72ip4HD1jvBESjxpiEEpQL4cZiyHdRDnxK_7HjdlUqrchyGZWKRAe4nIyY3DRHQ7MKdOqzHk3bNaEM5B_X_LH6o8FiqZIodPnYrO7I_MJ-nGJjwlj8QItI?key=OkWDSabqDeeTSQDs-gIi_A\" height=\"503.00261766668376\" width=\"671\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, time at leisure until check out. Upon check out, transfer to the airport for your flight back home with sweet memories of your Malaysian vacation.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare: As per airline policy &amp; fare rules&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Land Package: If cancelled after confirmation but before 21 days from date of travel: 10% of the Land Package Cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 21 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: 