an style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 02- INR 2,52,000 + 5% GST + 5% TCS</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DESTINATION</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HONG KONG (3N)</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MACAU (2N)</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL NAME</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Park Hotel Hong Kong-Deluxe Family Room/ / Similar</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Holiday Inn Macau- Standard Room / Similar</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MEAL PLAN</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOMS &amp; MEAL PLAN</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per the selected option</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOURS &amp; TRANSFERS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Airport Transfers on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ferry-Hotel Transfers on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lantau Island Day Trip | Big Buddha, Dolphin Watching &amp; Cable Car– SIC</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Macau City Tour Hop on Hop off Bus</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Victoria Harbour Night Cruise Experience- Ticket Only</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Disneyland One Day Ticket with SIC Transfer</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE</em></strong><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">:</em></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Seat-in-Coach (SIC): Guests will share the vehicle with other tourists staying in different Hotels, so SIC Guests may have to wait for Vehicle up to 45 mins. SIC Transfers operates as per fix scheduled.&nbsp;</em></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PRIVATE(PVT): Guests do not have to share the vehicle with other tourists.</em></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">In both cases vehicle is not at disposal and only for transfers. Maximum Vehicle waiting time shall be 05 minutes for SIC and 10 minutes for Private</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(Rs 40500/- per person is the current airfare. At the time of booking fare difference will be applicable)</em></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcIWdyYZbnrwbmUUxzhUeTVLXs5adCSO7L9fiHbt9B0JsVLMSat7niMbKhV39CIrcNfWp33Upa01T1H4pHrXSoica4gAbPJemZtjkLLLzrAD8yv8SZ-e3dHIlre-8aQneB-9p1AHRWh9rcwB8mlOY8?key=8U3s-lsyArl589qEbC4Qkg\" height=\"82\" width=\"258\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any travel insurance (recommended but not mandatory)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5% GST</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT HONG KONG | PICK UP TRANSFER | VICTORIA HARBOUR NIGHT CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Hong Kong, you will be met and transferred to your hotel. Reach the hotel and check-in and rest for a while. Later head to the Harbour on your own and enjoy the beautiful tour.</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\"> </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">45-minute cruise on the Harbor One Yacht to enjoy the neon-lit night view of Hong Kon.The top floor has a wide 360-degree panoramic view with an unobstructed view of Victoria Harbor.Watch the world\'s largest light and music show, A Symphony of Lights</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfF4aAoBiUj1JLtz4fYey1PBieCX6A1ES9kaLfJr_y39AqJElS7dyqS2Fh-l7t7-WP2v0BSR5TtGq-KBmS7ZXDS-HtjzN1BywDm4wyeWJg46ekZ-Sd9vAz-HYw_QQzKumV8rW-YRhOlbPefs7MvkbM?key=8U3s-lsyArl589qEbC4Qkg\" height=\"394.60769585161154\" width=\"673\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: LANTAU ISLAND DAY TRIP | BIG BUDDHA l CABLE CAR l DOLPHIN WATCHING</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast, proceed</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> for the Lantau Island Day Tour.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Visit the Big Buddha to experience its majesty and sanctity, followed by traditional culture and cuisine at Ngong Ping Village. Look for Chinese White Dolphins in their natural habitat on a dolphin watching cruise. Explore Tai O Fishing Village with its rich culture and history of fishing villages. Later in the evening head back to the hotel and overnight stay in hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(50, 61, 88);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc0NF96BzO4Jlk-RDblHYVxijXyp2Voh6q5hGi4cowPZaxRt0kZCmflBqthLGI8mkgO8kMY_cWCNk5Od0ggNMMNCQ28VkU1D0qvliciuvSQ2-NLpgS0cyrYBrgsF9Nit7aNUmDfpP75sa4k3xLntFY?key=8U3s-lsyArl589qEbC4Qkg\" alt=\"A gondola with people on it\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"411.6015578897675\" width=\"666.0086341837905\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: DISNEYLAND DAY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning breakfast, proceed for the fun filled day to Disneyland, a wonderful kingdom loved by adults and children. Meet the popular Disney characters from your favorite Disney stories and movies from Pixar, Marvel, and Star Wars.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfX6EYkAvEJSPHfhtZxFZXBaExrfyU7iUXESQoMSRP9xU52sF6g7gjDeC8j3VB2p-gKso7Fcz1v8aBrqrQ_7Ysn1EJa9LE38q4yxNsg5mCwVtqC6eWzWtPzONNilzALifY3H8WuNdv4Ha-cxyfm4LY?key=8U3s-lsyArl589qEbC4Qkg\" alt=\"Hong Kong Disneyland® Resort in Lantau | Expedia.co.in\" height=\"387.40451084127307\" width=\"687.6326220122513\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hong Kong Disneyland has eight different theme lands, more than 100 amusement facilities, and entertainment experiences, and there are three Disney themed hotels with unique characteristics.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Evening head back to hotel and overnight stay in the hotel</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: TRANSFER TO MACCAO</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, take a rest for some time until check-out. Then get transferred to the ferry terminal for your ferry to Macao. Reaching there, get transferred to the hotel in Macao and rest of the day will be at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Explore the beautiful city on your own. Enjoy the local food and indulge in some shopping sprees. Overnight stay in the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeiQf9M5Q6PL5wZv4Hs4bHQ5dz07qYiMuR02sDoElxJgjYqamnMwevk8NB6WD5OFBcIVKwIC0tbWxT4AyO2kfRk6iokEsK7EBqNEYVIQ6Xt2glAQANNonHlz3cuwfSpB3IHW4BTewyDiKEh48kJVJA?key=8U3s-lsyArl589qEbC4Qkg\" alt=\"How Macau became the world\'s casino capital\" height=\"331\" width=\"672\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: MACCAO CITY TOUR- HOP ON HOP OFF</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, start with a half day city tour showcasing the history and culture of Macau. This tour will bring guests to various attractions that depict the city’s multiracial orientations. While our city-tour gives you an up-close view of attractions like</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> Ama Temple, Ruins of St Paul Church, Senado Square, Photo Stop at Macau Tower &amp; Kun Lam Statue. Drop back to the hotel and some time for lunch (at own cost) and rest.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXevvVub88Y511cYx1N20QWhWZDG2eRKaKeVaVPRKy-6ViPOAIbIR8eC8pDVFhsoKoiIQyTg5a08RlY0JtD70CAjmswra4H3EKq-Hz_2GOnRjnELhiKVuULSc48InvkYdAFbafu61UtkLocpc_waF2s?key=8U3s-lsyArl589qEbC4Qkg\" alt=\"7 Macau Tour Package Starts @ 𝐑𝐬.98498 𝘽𝙤𝙤𝙠 𝙉𝙤𝙬 !\" height=\"367.68579194673293\" width=\"670.615400060235\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceed to the ferry point in Macau for your ferry back to Hong Kong. After reaching Hong Kong proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. Net Banking: Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2. Credit Card (2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable, 3.5% for Amex &amp; International Cards)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. EMI Option available through our Finance Partner Sankash</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. UPI Payment Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 15 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2. We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. Standard Check in Time is 3PM and check out time is 12 PM. Early check in &amp; late check out would be subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. The itinerary is tentative; the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in trip, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with local Govt guidelines.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p>',NULL,'2025-07-18 08:47:19','sent','<a9cd4669-d438-b9d4-22d4-563dc0baa719@funstay.in>','12128',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(87,NULL,'shobith.nambiar@gmail.com','12149 l 6N7D Dubai & Abu Dhabi l Shobith Nambiar l 7 Pax l 24th to 30th Oct ','<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdLKpSLvMsuv0sTpW1TE6WsuOXYMK3o-FCDOa0jzdpMqBsGN0Roz7eLMoQLPA_3ER1CEk6HW1bin0yqMga-tluinc0Ba5fxNClp2w-WJw0KBu56Mfbxx8wdQTqYM4bTyKmHtGEud4BnjlRdFWhkCVs?key=oO7GkYQXzXoFt3kI2OuP3w\" height=\"208\" width=\"797\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\