d Sept 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 3N4D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 2 Adults&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 1</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 1: LAND PACKAGE COST: INR 62,000 + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4*- The Bali Dream Villa Seminyak, 1 x Villa, 2 Bedrooms, Private Pool with Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">OPTION 2: LAND PACKAGE COST: INR 50,000 + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3*- Adi Dharma Hotel Kuta, Superior Room with Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTEL: </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As mentioned above</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MEAL PLAN</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">EVISA- </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa &amp; Tourism Levy</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOURS &amp; TRANSFERS: ( All transfers on Private basis)</strong></p><ul><li>Airport transfers</li><li>Devdan Show- Category C Seats- Private</li><li>Nusa Penida Tour&nbsp; (Kelingking Beach,Paluang Cliff,Broken Beach, Angel Billabong ,Snorkelling at Crystal Bay) with lunch, 2 way ferry- Private</li><li>Garuda Wisnu Kencana and Uluwatu Temple with Kecak Dance- Private</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Entrance Tickets.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for a full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GST @ 5%</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, a TCS of 5% is to be collected for all foreign remittances for travel outside India. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to the traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This might change to 20% in July 2023</strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT BALI |TRANSFER TO KUTA | DEVDAN SHOW&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Bali- the Island of Gods!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Bali, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel in Kuta. Check-In and some time to rest.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then in the evening around 5:30PM start from the hotel for the Devdan Show. It is a captivating cultural performance held at the Bali Nusa Dua Theatre in Bali, Indonesia. This 60-minute spectacle offers a dynamic blend of traditional Indonesian dances, modern contemporary movements, acrobatics, and special effects, providing a vivid exploration of Indonesia\'s rich cultural diversity.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return back to the hotel and the rest of the day is at leisure to explore the area on your own. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc47BTZVn0VJX742T4sC2AoHya_RWzgzo5TjeX9kGd5BoGurVnGrCBzRDz5pbFtromtb6KByWANJqYwAK3d05Um7aNZfhxHyaqKs174iw8TFikGd7C8ZqoUQ5hBG8OZQRiE631lzmc9BA0iF5wWUbA?key=3mMNcAdGaCWfqhCVohiozQ\" height=\"251\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: NUSA PENIDA DAY TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After breakfast, it’s a full day of beach hopping. It is an exotic and still virgin charming island nestled in the waters between Bali and Lombok has slowly but surely become a favorite with travelers for its beautiful beaches, rugged coastline and relaxed way of life. Overnight stay in a hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdLeyAq9QvzNdla0jw-q2drz-jWNzxbWTDPi676BrrZjeRqg496yScgIDnx_Dz7idFejDfgJbP4oSvTC3aYjKbhWgcpcgj4HIxoE190lgfuFznh3OIA8Hjzpk-F9ZHVcOhkQ3S6dDVVuYGdPH0CheM?key=3mMNcAdGaCWfqhCVohiozQ\" height=\"173\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: GARUDA WISNU KENCANA CULTURAL PARK | ULUWATU TEMPLE WITH KECAK DANCE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After lunch, you proceed to GWK Park. It presents the limestone plateau with a beautiful serene park in southern Bali. The cultural park is dedicated to embrace and preserve the art, cultural and spiritual aspects of the Island of Bali. This 60-hectare park offers a place to watch art &amp; cultural performances, observe exhibitions, and experience conferences. The central icon is the incredible monument of Garuda Wisnu Kencana, one of the tallest and largest modern statues with over 120 meters in height and 64 meters in width. It is conceptualized by Nyoman Nuarta, Indonesia’s finest contemporary sculptor. The landmark depicts the Hindu God Vishnu riding aloft on his winged mount Garuda. Vishnu is considered a member of the holy trinity of Hinduism along with Shiva and Brahma. He is the most important God of Vaishnavism, the largest Hindu sect. Garuda is an eagle-like creature with human features in Hindu mythology&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc4TbMi6ZatJTYSebSHkJveKbFpK2-tzGetJry1uWVLPluqqwtI9t2qszsQKA1mH1GPOmEhdLYk2ZnijRrKwRjJy1OhYT5xFV3QBbKeMaAVoDLXt-_m3MCc0xd9H02C5DH-8T7e-yXVD51SwleohZM?key=3mMNcAdGaCWfqhCVohiozQ\" height=\"447.0057999926115\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then visit the famous Uluwatu Temple, Uluwatu Temple (Pura Luhur Uluwatu) is one of six key temples believed to be Bali\'s spiritual pillars, is renowned for its magnificent location, perched on top of a steep cliff approximately 70 metres above sea level. Overnight stay at the hotel.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdwVxVEUG5GgNMKjH6OZ09edU51h5oq-TKgIvJ1N_r6bC5QOoMzKGocZ4i4ObDsujkQ6xaQDa_EMJr-HUxXXFvnffZsUIL0ysByRY8ZWGPxUsIwH4aB9BNJVpWeZQok0xFsIeZgtkzn3wjAj-3f2qA?key=3mMNcAdGaCWfqhCVohiozQ\" alt=\"Special Offer! Half-Day Tour: Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Fire Dance Show –  ENJOYKUTA.COM | Book Tours &amp; Things To Do in Bali\" height=\"371.930208390308\" width=\"669.7970584996145\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: DEPARTURE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceeds to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;A passport that is valid and still valid for at least 6 months</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A return flight ticket or a one-way ticket to continue the journey to another country</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;It is also suggested to carry 2 passport size photographs (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Flight:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% at the time of confirmation</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Land Package:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 50% of the package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from the date of travel: 100% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"ba