IC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfgnXHScE_dhmFG5P-I9fJGWRWyaKqVL7PJDqsje2xN1OG18yIUAkQpB8w_v6VaIO1K-BlvTGDIW19lIGK7vWDxW1m2SRefcT2wUnPLYsCQOL7TqnXflj2gcuAjEqnJwvVC5wftf0HSlQp1Zjrp-DY?key=QXDfUwx6kv0eyfz4KkE67Q\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"76\" width=\"79\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">All prices are per couple in INR</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">We do not hold any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">No