55);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Dubai as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 30.09.2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 05.10.2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 4N5D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guest: 4 Adults 3 Children (4 yrs, 10yrs, 11yrs)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 2&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Meal Plan: Breakfast Included</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PER ADULT: INR 62,000 + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PER CHILD: INR 38,000 + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4*: 4N</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Grand Excelsior Hotel Deira, Junior Suite, Deluxe room or Twin Bed Room with Bathtub with Breakfast</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3*: 1N Uptown Apartments Abu Dhabi by Gewan&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Hotel Transfers in Abu Dhabi using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Transfers using private AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30-day single-entry tourist visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dhow Cruise Creek</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Dubai City Tour with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor (Non-Prime Time tickets)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Desert Safari with Dinner</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai Frame</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Museum of Future</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">One day 2 Theme Parks Pass from Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Warner Bros. World Yas Island, SeaWorld Yas Island- Using Free Shuttle</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tourism Dirham to be paid directly to hotel (AED 15-25 per day per room)</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT ABU DHABI, PICK UP TRANSFER TO DUBAI HOTEL, DHOW CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Dubai- The city of Gold!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Abu Dhabi, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel in Dubai. Check In and some time to rest.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 7PM, proceed for Dhow Cruise to experience something that is inexplicable and beyond your imagination with our 2-hour classy cruise. The Venetian styled canal will leave you and your loved ones impressed. This traditional dhow will offer you the best views of modern Dubai from the most unexpected angles. Witness the glorious architecture of Dubai that the world acknowledges while you feast on the international cuisines. An elegant and sophisticated setting will elevate your cruising experience and leave you with lovely memories to cherish for a lifetime. Entertainment will be arranged onboard, and you will be cruising while enjoying the savory dishes and drink. The stunning view, sumptuous meals and the live entertainment will give you a dazzling experience.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdVXF3FqKEJuIv6DYa8oBJC5nN9ZdqzNVDLiOXLY0w-DR6HZkOfFrAQRmImQXWBhpTnGkTzYYO_0GzE4ttp4JDpjvZkCp4LjaupsERadrOjuKzy7RYxwTw96F8TFjimB592Yt9Z2UKJMBw41nkqlJE?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" height=\"368.43695893363946\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: DUBAI CITY TOUR, DUBAI MALL, BURJ KHALIFA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a city tour of Dubai.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our 4-hour Dubai city tour would take you to the most prominent places in Dubai. You also get to see two different sides of Dubai, the historical one and the modern one. Beginning with the Dubai Museum, located in the Al Fahidi Fort (built in the 18th century), you get to see Dubai before it discovered oil and became the power city it is today. This is followed by a drive along the Dubai Creek, which is a historical area and still holds remnants of the past. You get to enjoy Arabic architecture with a visit to Jumeirah Mosque, which is the only mosque in Dubai open to non-Muslims. So, make the most of it. While the historical part of the city is quite interesting, your Dubai city tour would not be complete if you do not see its modern side.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The tour takes you Hotel Burj Al Arab (which is designed in the shape of a sail), the Palm Islands (largest artificial island in the world), Hotel Atlantis the Palm (the crowning glory of palm Jumeirah), Jumeirah Beach and Burj Khalifa (the tallest building in the world). The tour also includes a drive along the Shiekh Zayed Road so that you can take a look at the skyscrapers and magnificent buildings on both sides of the road.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 4PM proceed to enjoy the Dubai Mall.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After this, make your way to the 124th floor of Dubai\'s Burj Khalifa, the tallest of all the buildings in the world, standing tall and proud amongst the other skyscrapers of the city. One of the major landmarks of the city, the interiors of the Burj is as majestic as the steely exterior. During the tour, you are shown a multimedia presentation about the history of Dubai as well as the story of the construction of the building. Once you have gathered information about this tall structure, you are taken to the 124th floor observation deck on the fastest elevator. Here you get a chance to have a 360-degree panoramic view of the entire city of Dubai.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeckjs3xhbag7aB9dHEMOz5voxUqycfXTV45yYTnzyCyH4vOtffID98_NAe0cM3mIGQDzwAFoBt_Kt0B8PWk3V51OSWJtbr3eRsc5kKUO6gzQ5kkEdqQcxg-9ULNdsIz5lxOX2BNLEwWuMPOdH9D_E?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"447.4927857471456\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later, at around 7PM, see the spectacular Fountain Show at the Lake beside Dubai Mall. This is an open to public show so just look for a comfortable spot at the edge of the lake and enjoy the mesmerizing musical extravaganza. After this you have time at leisure for dinner at Dubai Mall (at your own expense) and return to the hotel by 9PM.Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3:&nbsp; DUBAI FRAME l DUBAI DESERT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, proceed to explore the Dubai frame: Standing tall at 150 m, Dubai Frame provides a bird’s eye view of the city\'s famous and spectacular skyline, you can experience the views of Old and New Dubai and see how the city has transformed to a one of a kind metropolitan.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfDY38wVcgzNjx1HBtS5btCbMJzfbma0CeCq6Iw5HMUvqBL0nOeFhtsV-XZoKXBB3iAVhcgPsRfZKY9sXuuDy2Z27QPBgyPnlUtQhJ8pwZdMHIrW7DU7SWrhPAw9hLJSIPsB6P3xgUSApYnQCurb_k?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, track, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"418.97247001728266\" width=\"669.0000000000001\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 2PM, proceed to enjoy Dubai Desert Safari. Our desert safari trip includes spending a few hours’ time in a Bedouin style tent, right in the middle of the desert. The tour begins with our vehicle picking you up from your hotel and driving you down to the outskirts of the desert. Once you arrive at the desert campsite, you can enjoy riding a camel, smoking a flavoured shisha, drinking the traditional Arabic coffee, enjoying the captivating belly dance and Tanura dance. Do not miss the chance to take some breath-taking pictures of the desert in your camera, especially during sunset. The colours of the setting sun on the sands would leave you mesmerized. Apart from this, you can try out the traditional costumes, get a henna tattoo and enjoy a delicious buffet dinner. After the dinner, you would be dropped back to your place of stay. Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf-_rZYhjDAdnD2Mu8BK4bxTAIT0O7M6qoijSNoXixtlJd9eICCYAd48rHRAHsGpysCQ04tEhGm454WePeFyub3MoUqfJ4Cn3nQ9ANNWTermsluluCXE8av2TCUnfPhptr2EWiLe-YLbV2KmLQL0kM?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" alt=\"A picture containing dune\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"351.2316601863055\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: MUSEUM OF FUTURE | DAY AT LEISURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">, proceed to the latest additions to the iconic architectural structures in Dubai- The Museum of Future. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Museum of the Future is an exhibition space for innovative and futuristic ideologies, services, and products. Located in the Financial District of Dubai, UAE, the Museum of the Future has three main elements: green hill, building, and void.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfBhuNSecEDDGuPSn0ULXVZV8qOtrPxN8iUotQZuX0-7VCs9igdaZLxwYtVLHfMuNeY-SNGVUEPxOjiPkVJz6bSSJw_foFAS1kakTI324MXKIN2uzjMkolSEHfrgnXKVz6rWjjGuAqhuTIIGObbJHE?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, grass, outdoor\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"446.63555157172436\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: YAS ISLAND 1 DAY 2 PASS |DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after an early breakfast, checkout and proceed to Yas Island, Abu Dhabi</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> and enjoy 2 out of 4 parks.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Then later around 11:30PM proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">THEME PARKS (CHOOSE ANY 2)</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. FERRARI WORLD</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The first Ferrari-branded theme park in the world, Ferrari World Abu Dhabi, celebrates the passionate spirit of the legendary racing marque. Its iconic structure houses numerous high-adrenaline rides featuring the world’s fastest rollercoaster, family-friendly attractions, state-of-the-art simulators, live shows, and an inspiring treasure of racing memorabilia. Attractions also include two stores and a selection of restaurants that celebrate authentic Italian culinary traditions, making it the place to live the true Ferrari story. Open 365 days a year, Ferrari World Abu Dhabi offers a unique experience for visitors of every age in a refreshing, indoor, climate-controlled environment. Ferrari World Abu Dhabi is a main feature of Yas Island, the top leisure and entertainment destination in the UAE.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcb0xwhk1KCNSUeFW3dmcvCemc5EOZOT9y9dt8ub0w52uEcUelU0qJTfIfY1lBl9Z0G24xxFXRNIjtmPjbiFhErL_8vOhV6M2PiWkJUibE2BIe62l7ZGppkzcRPuTzU_gcLfJQW9flQhXKke-orY1I?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" height=\"389.7364955639208\" width=\"705\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2. </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ABU DHABI SEA WORLD</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Explore the region\'s first Marine Life Theme Park and discover 8 immersive realms that take you on an incredible journey from the poles to the tropics. With over 100 animal experiences and presentations, including up-close animal encounters and expeditions, you’ll soon be able to learn about the incredible One Ocean that connects all of us. SeaWorld Yas Island, Abu Dhabi is home to over 35 interactive experiences and rides, live characters and performances, 17 dining options, 13 retail outlets, and roaming entertainment across all realms. Later overnight stay at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdKEFClWaVenKUuOAtoNNbgmb_gLrM_1vANOOS-DR8xpEbPlptP3W0NYl5cTQy1j2wqcjp9GDUTdlQn-d7Ql8goLewmODDW4-7rB69STkXDJBBbGSpYeoFEWjGXH6Zw8Bh6tcAXL4bKEq2sZSe1nA?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" height=\"291.93566951626576\" width=\"705\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. WARNER BROS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Warner Bros. Abu Dhabi, the world’s first-ever Warner Bros.-branded indoor theme park located on Yas Island. It is one of the largest indoor theme parks in the world and a major attraction for both tourists and residents. The park features a wide range of attractions and entertainment options based on popular Warner Bros. characters such as Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman, Looney Tunes, The Flintstones, and others.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It also offers a variety of thrilling rides, including roller coasters and dark rides like </span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Joker</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> and </span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Riddler Revolution</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, which are based on characters and storylines from DC Comics. Additionally, the park hosts stage shows and live performances inspired by various Warner Bros. properties.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf58ZqGd_kzPMLW3fFEoCxzatlVB0H8M71SH-ADbqAAg9CnH9et84t4sZAydtpTRznPV9EWYCLqA4qLNMcJiVvbaz5KpELWmvcUideyf3ol9VMPQJ1wTpOVjDcadk4toYLbgdptDol0Ss6DQPWur_k?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" height=\"300\" width=\"705\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. YAS WATER WORLD</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yas Waterworld Abu Dhabi is an Emirati-themed waterpark located on Yas Island in Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates, that is home to 45 rides, slides, and attractions, and various seasonal events and shows.&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfyPprysXcAxTxae3SuMCv0zPCIKVbihiH7v5wpHJpTO8UWZttSUcvuVnlTRQlM3XkpEwEkzJs2cfSjcRepvUBsb9BW60yMXei1q1PUb2b-nYJXd3GVkL-FcO8l3cttItuzeIgby_Rh42CGw_xqBA?key=St4U_tk27VRfggn1YYazhA\" height=\"396.99241278110816\" width=\"705\"></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A visa is required for visiting Dubai. Documents needed for eVisa for Dubai</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital colour copy of your passport size photograph (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background. Avoid blurred and unclear photos.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PAN Card</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa on arrival is available for Indian nationals with valid US, UK or Schengen Visa.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy and selected fare rules.</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 7,000 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25% Cancellation charges if cancelled anytime after confirmation but at least 30 days before travel date</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">50% Cancellation charges if cancelled within 30 days but before 15 days of travel date&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Cancellation charges if cancelled on or within 15 days of travel date</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Advance</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 30 days from date of travel: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 15 days from date of travel: Balance 50% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable. 3.5% for AMEX and International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17