ccommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-08-16 12:20:06','sent','<eaa2705d-826c-0aa2-9dd2-e6da7ff8fdfc@funstay.in>','12459',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(123,NULL,'priyanka.p@funstay.in','Re: 12411 | Arti Bendre | Kerala','Hi Team,\n\nWill get back to you soon if there are any updates.\n\nThanks & Regards\nPriyanka\n\nOn Mon, 18 Aug 2025 at 10:24, Funstay Operations <ops@funstay.in> wrote:\n\n> Hi Team,\n>\n>\n> Awaiting your response\n>\n> On Thu, 14 Aug 2025 at 11:47, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n> wrote:\n>\n>> Dear Team,Greetings from Funstay,\n>>\n>> Please provide a quote for 2N 3D stay in Misty Lake Resort- Munnar\n>>\n>> Travel Dates: October 20th 2025\n>> Departure Dates: October 22nd 2025\n>> No of people: 2 Adults & 2 Childrens (11 years & 11 years)\n>> Room type: Standard Room\n>> Meal Plan: Breakfast\n>>\n>> Thank you.\n>>\n>> Regards,\n>> Priyanka\n>>\n>',NULL,'2025-08-19 05:27:21','received','<CANxmMSMwNTOSN5reFRadF5+SU1fyftJN331GyOndqdMJwHHUBg@mail.gmail.com>','11519',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(124,NULL,'priyanka.p@funstay.in','Re: 12411 | Arti Bendre | Kerala','Dear Team,\n\nPlease provide a quote for 2N 3D stay in Misty Lake Resort- Munnar\n\nTravel Dates: October 20th 2025\nDeparture Dates: October 22nd 2025\nNo of people: 2 Adults & 2 Childrens (11 years & 11 years)\nRoom type: Standard Room\nMeal Plan: Breakfast\n\nThank you.\n\nRegards,\nPriyanka\n\nOn Tue, 19 Aug 2025 at 10:55, Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\nwrote:\n\n> Hi Team,\n>\n> Will get back to you soon if there a