or this is 2nd Sept, however its better to complete it 5 days\nbefore to avoid any last-minute surprises)\n\n \n\nBalance to be paid on or before: 11th Jan 2026 : USD 2530 +USD 99 + USD\n126.50 - USD 349 = USD 2406.50 ( actual INR value will be as per prevailing\nROE on the date of payment)\n\n \n\nAdditional Services not included in above Cosmos Package:\n\n1.	Arrival Transfer on 14th March (Estimate in attached additional info\ndocument)\n2.	Departure Transfer on 29th March (Estimate in attached additional\ninfo document)\n3.	Visa - Schengen & Morocco (Estimate in attached additional info\ndocument)\n4.	Insurance  (Estimate in attached additional info document)\n5.	International Flights (Suggestions in attached additional info\ndocument)\n6.	And add on package post 29th March ( 3N Barcelona Package attached)\n7.	Option Add on Tours during Cosmos Itinerary ( we can also give 3rd\nparty optional tours)\n\nFor eg, Flamenco Show in Seville, there are many theatres - top two being\nTablao Famenco (https://tablaoflamencolassetas.com/) & Teatro Flamenco\n(https://teatroflamencosevilla.com/en)\n\nTickets starts from Euro 22( just for the show)  with  ~Euro 60 for\nTapas+Wine Tasting+ Dessert add on. I would suggest to just see the show at\nTablao and later have tapas and drinks on own.\n\n8.	Any train/bus for travel after Cosmos Itinerary ( Estimate in 3N\nBarcelona Package document)\n\n \n\nTo proceed with confirmation, awe would need passports ( front & back) of\nall guests and PAN cards for guests under whose name TCS is to be filed.\n\n \n\nAwaiting your confirmation, please feel free to revert in case of any\nqueries.\n\n \n\nRegards,\n\nMahim Mehta\n\n+917259222570',NULL,'2025-08-19 11:47:58','received','<07f701dc10fe$f0498580$d0dc9080$@funstay.in>','11576',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(126,NULL,'prasanna@netpoleons.com','12542 l 5N6D Dubai & Abu Dhabi l Prasanna Gudi l 3 Pax l 10th to 15th Oct 2025','<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&n