oking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-08-26 07:45:36','sent','<7d03f086-65b9-c81b-3923-ad8dd401317d@funstay.in>','12533',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(129,NULL,'prernapgupta@gmail.com','12555 l 9N10 Malaysia + Singapore + Cruise l Prerna Gupta l 4 Pax l 10th to 19th Sept 2025','<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXchAIGjJxD0tJl2lhHW-T6u_BOwMMp6bX9TJ7I2n2EzFLz2-VwPDLFQ3QwlVNojzD21-VO1ZN4mCiW-5VVFE_wPgevi2Yj88Gl9v6gML4W-EkiYgGsK58PL-cPURLIIC5mJzxkJ3p4EZZ8_CHWnTnI?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" height=\"215\" width=\"793\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Dear Prerna,</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Greetings from Funstay.in and thank you for your interest in Funstay’s travel services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay Services Pvt Ltd is an experiential travel service provider based out of Bengaluru, India. It also owns &amp; operates Funstay.in, the online booking platform for experiential travel services tailored around unique and niche stays. With over 2000 properties across 100+ locations across India, Funstay is one of the pioneers in this segment and is also among the fastest-growing companies in the experiential travel segment in India.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To understand more about Funstay, visit&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.funstay.in/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(89, 143, 222);\">www.funstay.in</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;y</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">ou can also go through our reviews on&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/funstay.in/reviews/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Facebook</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Funstay+Services+Pvt+Ltd+-+Homestay+in+Coorg,+Ooty,+Ladakh,+Andaman+Tour+Packages/@12.9085926,77.649664,15z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x0:0xf78d7e9aae2673f5!8m2!3d12.9085922!4d77.6496725!9m1!1b1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Google</a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are pleased to share below offers for your planned holiday in Singapore as below,</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TRAVEL DETAILS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Arrival Date: 10th September 2025</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Departure Date: 19th September</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Nights: 9N10D</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Guests: 4 Adults&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No of Rooms: 2</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE COST (PER PERSON): INR 93,000/- + 5% TCS + 5% GST</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">INCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HOTELS, ROOM &amp; MEAL PLANS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In Kuala Lumpur: 2N Furama Bukit Bintang, Kuala Lumpur- Executive Room</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In Singapore: 4N V Hotel Lavender Singapore, Superior Room</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cruise: Genting Dream Cruise, Balcony Stateroom</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IN KUALA LUMPUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Airport Transfers&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">City Orientation Tour on Private Basis&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Batu Caves &amp; Genting Highland on Private Basis&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Malaysia to Singapore on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IN SINGAPORE</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Airport Transfers on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Oneway Cruise Terminal Transfers on Private Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Night Safari Transfers on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Gardens by the Bay on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">City Orientation Tour on Seat in Coach Basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Sentosa Transfers on Seat in Coach Basis&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return Universal Studios Transfers on Seat in Coach Basis&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Seat-in-Coach (SIC): Guests will share the vehicle with other tourists staying in different Hotels, so SIC Guests may have to wait for vehicles up to 45 mins. SIC Transfers operates as per fix scheduled.&nbsp;</em></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PRIVATE(PVT): Guests do not have to share the vehicle with other tourists.</em></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">In both cases the vehicle is not at disposal and only for transfers. Maximum Vehicle waiting time shall be 05 minutes for SIC and 10 minutes for Private</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Multiple Entry Tourist Visa</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Kuala Lumpur City Tour (Petronas Twin Tower entrance tickets are included)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Full Day Genting Highland and Batu Caves including 2- way cable car tickets</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Night Safari with Tram Ride</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Singapore City Tour on seat in coach basis</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Gardens By the Bay –&nbsp; Flower Dome + Monet Exhibition and Cloud Forest&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Universal Studios Singapore One Day Ticket with shared transfers</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Sentosa including 2-way Cable Car, Madam Tussaud’s 4 in 1, Wings of Time&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SIC to Private Upgrade @ Rs 2000/- per vehicle per way</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Gratuity Payable on board (Cruise)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any travel insurance (recommended but not mandatory)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">WELCOME TO MALAYSIA!!</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Malaysia</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> is like two countries in one, cleaved in half by the South China Sea. While peninsula flaunts bustling cities, colonial architecture, misty tea plantations and chill-out islands, Malaysian Borneo hosts wild jungles of orangutans, granite peaks and remote tribes, along with some pretty spectacular diving. Throughout these two regions is an impressive variety of microcosms ranging from the space-age high-rises of Kuala Lumpur to the traditional longhouse villages of Sarawak.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If there was one thing that unites all its pockets of ethnicities, religions and landscapes, it’s food. Between the Chinese-Malay ‘Nonya’ fare, Indian curries, Chinese buﬀets, Malay food stalls and Dayak specialties, with some impressive Western-style food thrown in for good measure, travellers will never go hungry here.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT MALAYSIA, PICK UP TRANSFER, HALF DAY CITY TOUR&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival in Kuala Lumpur, complete immigration and meet your driver at the arrival area. Transfer to hotel and check in. Some time at leisure for rest.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later around 3:30 PM, proceed for the KL City tour covering all famous tourist attractions of Kuala Lumpur. Explore the history and top landmarks of one of the world\'s most modern cities — Kuala Lumpur. Learn the story behind some of the city\'s most iconic sights as you tour the busy streets and discover quiet charming corners. Take pictures of some of the tallest skyscrapers — Petronas Twin Towers. Admire the unique architecture of the King\'s Palace (Istana Negara), the National Mosque (Masjid Negara) and visit the National Monument and Sultan Abdul Ahmad Building. Watch how local handcrafted souvenirs are made and take a few back home for friends and family. Return to the hotel around 9 PM and rest of the day at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeqLZVhNlgoJ845a6Ljmz4tcLN_oubvqjI--lTAy_cQSnSQA-5WXq18EIetq2t9ucsigPlbbXohXffGCrHNvz3baQm-vN8wf_ec0SN2oEIZjijZMZlJcJgJ7f0Yp5q9vtOFzYTa7WyNKgVhUQ-7hf4?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, city, sunset\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"325.09111404418945\" width=\"683\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: FULL DAY BATU CAVES &amp; GENTING HIGHLAND TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after breakfast your driver will pick you up at around 9AM. Today you will visit Genting Highlands, Batu Caves and Chin Swee Caves Temple. Your English speaking driver will act as your guide throughout the tour, sharing the history of Malaysia while he/she navigates the road. On your way to the highlands, your driver will first drop by Batu Caves. One of Malaysia\'s most visited attractions, Batu Caves is a limestone hill consisting of three major caves and various smaller ones. This 100-year-old cave network\'s limestone formations house Hindu shrines, making it an important religious landmark for Hindus. Other caves also house Hindu statues and paintings, like the Art Gallery Cave and Museum Cave.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXev-shxfSKfEXRRIz43EoRdN8iDStFj9GiByKPDYkja9XI5nN9dzxAiOG2ffFsbRmPfdckLx4sSwTEaNGLLbZMLBwNkEf9FLgI-CJt4L15SuyZ-JyjzkN27s7vNK7E-xuzRUHIUnl5TnI4jlXYK-g?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" height=\"414.20860183238983\" width=\"654\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your religious trip to Batu Caves, your ride will continue on to Genting Skyway. Experience riding Southeast Asia\'s fastest and longest cable car, a great way to spook and amaze the kids. This ride allows you to stop at any station, including Chin Swee Station. Hop off and tour the iconic nine-storey Chin Swee Caves Temple for a chance to see the \'blessing lamps\'. Devotees believe that these lamps are blessed, especially when dedicated. After viewing the lamps, help the kids climb up the Sky Terrace for a great view of the 15-meter high Buddha statue.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Extend the fun with a ride back to Genting Highlands, where all the entertainment is. Inside you\'ll find several theme parks and attractions, such as Ripley\'s Adventureland. Restaurants are readily available too, and the staff are incredibly patient with hungry kids. At the end of the tour drive back to your hotel in KL and rest of the day is free at leisure. Overnight stay in the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: ARRIVAL AT SINGAPORE, TRANSFER TO HOTEL, NIGHT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Singapore- The Lion City!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning checkout and transfer to the Bus Terminal. On your arrival at Singapore, meet and greet and get dropped to your hotel. Check-in (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">check -in time is 3PM, early check-in is subject to availability and at sole discretion of hotel</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">) and have lunch (at your own cost) and rest for a while.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening, proceed for a visit to Night Safari. Night Safari is a remarkable attraction to see a wide array of nocturnal animals in their natural setting. It shelters 2500 plus animals in its 35 hectares of land, which interestingly represent the habitats of our planet’s seven amazing geographical zones, encompassing Indo-Malayan area, Asian Riverine Forest, Nepalese River Valley, Indian Subcontinent, Burmese Hillside, Himalayan Foothills, and Equatorial Africa. A visit to this night zoo also gives you the chance to watch Thumbuakar Performance and Creatures of the Night show. Drop back to the hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfKuqfgyZhS3hZIYjVh8s_ePqQMsWeqiJrJF3nq-9xw8x7kUNsqD-rLI6020hZ_UI2PIIE7l47oNn2nsLUUHYDS2SmVHyPuu8_uHkCo9aMNooBvgi5GxVP68HZCF2wZUlS01xoFvlLkMVGG2Lm7fyk?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"A picture containing grass, outdoor, tree, mammal\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"339.0645023494233\" width=\"707\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: SINGAPORE CITY TOUR, GARDENS BY THE BAY&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, start with a Half Day City tour showcasing the history and culture of Singapore. This tour will bring guests to various attractions that depict the city’s multiracial orientations. While our city-tour gives you an up-close view of attractions like Merlion Park, China Town as well as the Singapore Flyer </span><em style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(optional add on at additional cost, refer to optional supplement)</em><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">allows you to soak up the incomparable sights over the skyline of the city-state during your 30-minute flight aboard Asia’s biggest observation wheel. Drop back to hotel and some time for lunch (at own cost) and rest.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeuHAZjPFYRk_1NeomBU6DUtPSFu5aW2PljyIoOSUc139HcnWAvVXA7rjy0uv-a21w2bnUtvJWvClW5QB1nBGHUgXl92VC70Ir2s1zQzPR8oIDW6ez8xrQwKP1kQj7ambM9tjrBfXNADP1qGqSCPw?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" height=\"375.744262674143\" width=\"705\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 4PM, proceed to Gardens By the Bay, Singapore’s iconic botanical garden featuring the Flower Dome, Supergroove Tree, Garden Rhapsody (7:45 Show) and often regarded as the number one attraction of Singapore. Return to hotel and time at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfH29b-F9_VI3edK6RiWvHzS3nkBazMxv8CWGNlb4NVffmON6C0rLnmVR7S-LarobQXA0CExN8qBPjGOpdorKgG8z1i70MX-aq0S-cSIMfyYvaF9EUen2SeJCl09OOHHGHR2AF8ZewDFp4dI2fenwc?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" height=\"331.80714711407177\" width=\"715\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: UNIVERSAL STUDIOS SINGAPORE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After Breakfast, proceed for a day of fun and frolic at The Universal Studios Singapore – enjoy the many adventurous rides and attractions spread across 6 different themes.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Do not miss to try Transformers 3-D ride, thrilling roller coaster among other </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Adrenaline-pumping rides, interactive shows and a wide variety of exciting attractions based on the blockbuster movies and television series you know and love so well awaits you at the first and only Universal Studios theme park in Asia. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the evening around 7PM, return to hotel and overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfOQjuzRqqU8_Zu8HOFEoye3zmgMtva18foCo7a57yuXHNavcPfE1lUCi3PzyMrJkC_TnigVMnSNdHjHfX6mvJ_cBmLNEltglP3KsLOnkagM9bHcjFqQycBeUFQlu38OAY1DIgs1GhmBKRYjxyuag?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" height=\"330.2159957614066\" width=\"709\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: SENTOSA TOUR</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the afternoon at 2PM, proceed to experience the wonderful Sentosa Islands starting with a cable ride from Mount Faber Park to Sentosa and appreciate the marvellous beauty surrounding the region. Upon reaching Sentosa, explore the many fun filled attractions at Sentosa (check inclusions for attractions included in the package, any additional attraction tickets can be purchased on spot at additional charge) and spend some time at leisure at one of its beaches. Later in the evening drop back to the hotel and rest of the night at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdRoSrZSQcI8L_Qi1EdtH9vGQcXvXyYhT1_k9A1zBzwWpf7QZBCWyN75pijN4kvPoHiqBtM9cERjHbB2hXVbqPm-WSSAhcPoccvci_ZwilPaaKD3_1nqx_abQ5sQHnw4zchWLOx0hEdBlV3iyOGMys?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"A picture containing resort\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"235\" width=\"709\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 7: TRANSFER TO CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast,checkout and proceed to the pier for the cruise. The rest of the day is at leisure.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeUrY-cFTVOo_gJTaF321G7Hj-4Jjr5GWT3IS0hDTh0SJpjeWixsE25x4P2UKGN_U7Pl615uAyIh6UjrcwzewFWAYeH5S8V44aDalXGlV8fKYqLzIRI4SXX1PDAlUMS9HCpEn8qOBcUiwsFyeH7NrM?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"A cruise ship in the water\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with medium confidence\" height=\"255\" width=\"710\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 8: CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Spend the whole day as well as night on the cruise. Experience different activities on the cruise.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeUrY-cFTVOo_gJTaF321G7Hj-4Jjr5GWT3IS0hDTh0SJpjeWixsE25x4P2UKGN_U7Pl615uAyIh6UjrcwzewFWAYeH5S8V44aDalXGlV8fKYqLzIRI4SXX1PDAlUMS9HCpEn8qOBcUiwsFyeH7NrM?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"A cruise ship in the water\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with medium confidence\" height=\"255\" width=\"710\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 9: CRUISE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Spend the whole day as well as night on the cruise. Experience different activities on the cruise.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeUrY-cFTVOo_gJTaF321G7Hj-4Jjr5GWT3IS0hDTh0SJpjeWixsE25x4P2UKGN_U7Pl615uAyIh6UjrcwzewFWAYeH5S8V44aDalXGlV8fKYqLzIRI4SXX1PDAlUMS9HCpEn8qOBcUiwsFyeH7NrM?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"A cruise ship in the water\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with medium confidence\" height=\"255\" width=\"710\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 10: DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast time at leisure until checkout. After checkout proceed to airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA INFORMATION</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Indian nationals require a Visa for visiting Singapore. Documents needed for Visa processing are,</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Original Passport with validity for 6 months from the intended date of arrival in Singapore.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2 Recently clicked photographs with the specification 35x45mm, white background, 80% face coverage, matt finished. (Notes: - Kindly don’t wear a white colour shirt)</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa application form (14A) should be filled out thoroughly and signatures should be done with the same ink.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A Personal Covering letter (Intended/Confirmed Travel Date, Number of passengers travelling together along with the Applicant’s Name as per Passport &amp; Passport Number, Duration of Stay, Main Applicant’s Email Id and Contact Number, Details of last visits to Singapore – If Any).</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Original Ticket Itinerary</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Confirm hotel voucher.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If employed, proof such as Salary Slips for the last 3 months, Employee Identity Card.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If Self-employed, proof such as Covering letter on the Business Letter, Company Registration Copy, and Company ITR for last 2 years, Visiting Card (Name &amp; Contact number mentioned on it).</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Updated bank statement for last 3 months.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If the applicant is a minor traveling with the parents, the signature of both the parent is required on the application form. If the applicant is a minor traveling with a single parent, a NOC letter from another parent is required with the signature and the relationship proof attached.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p><ol><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">We process Visa applications 15 days before the travel date.</em><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;</span></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Original Passports, Photographs, Filled Up Form along with other required documents are to be handed over in person or via courier to our Visa Partners offices either in Bengaluru, Delhi, Mumbai, or Chennai depending on place of Passport issuance. Please note that we do not provide home pick up service.&nbsp;</em></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Typically, Visa processing takes 2-5 working days post submission of all documents. However, this is just an indicative timeline and actual time may vary.</em></li><li><em style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Granting of Visa is solely at the discretion of Singapore High Commission/Consulate and application of Visa doesn’t guarantee grant of Visa.</em></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 21 days from date of travel: Balance 75% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable, 3.5% for Amex &amp; International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;available through our Finance Partner Sankash</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdTbmStqCY2disfK5oTItSMpCVe3XRq5kogAQ3uMASDkxsCIqZyDGzIVeGOMisXNT9OtYXSrMDcrC9-iHBwrWeIVHbmyk-0sdDKTQG6NQDTGe7exbYdtm9YWB9zeBO-Tg4M0u8SlMHNTt3ZvCKetA?key=qHTwPmk3DV4F3OenIaXK1Q\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"87\" width=\"91\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 3,500 per person): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or before 30 days from date of travel: 10% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled within 30 days but before 21 days from date of travel: 50% of package cost&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If cancelled on or within 15 days from date of travel: Non-Refundable</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Standard Check in Time is 3PM and Check out time is 12 PM. Early check in &amp; late check out would be subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The itinerary is tentative, the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in trip, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with local Govt guidelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-08-26 10:06:57','sent','<758fba5f-a770-5318-226f-4690dfd252b4@funstay.in>','12555',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in