King Room with Bathtub with Breakfast</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IN ABU DHABI (4 STAR): </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">City Seasons Al Hamra, Junior Suite with Breakfast</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TRANSFERS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airport Transfers using private AC vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tours &amp; Transfers using Sharing AC vehicle for the itinerary (not at disposal)</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VISA</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30-day single-entry tourist visa&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ATTRACTIONS &amp; TOURS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dhow Cruise Creek</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai Mall with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor (Non-Prime Time tickets)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Half Day Dubai City Tour&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dubai Frame</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Desert Safari with Dinner</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Full Day Abu Dhabi Tour with Grand Mosque</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">General Admission to any 2 Theme Parks from Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld Yas Island, Warner Bros. World Yas</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Island, SeaWorld Yas Island- using free shuttle service</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">EXCLUSIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Airfare </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(fare at the time of preparation of this quote is Rs 23,000 per adult, however it will be booked on actual prevailing fare at the time of confirmation)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXftW_ZGmx5saWpgVrCwP2MgqO79EPMIA6RUmXs6EGsdlGQLCLdVlnD2bj_U_pAThrSV1jNH6F147YdLO9fWgGgos-mkQXJeQA-ftT2vX8Z9ZIDA-WimdaXQGXKzV4B-UeU0SK_hhsEdkDWsg1fvaFc?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" height=\"157\" width=\"215\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdik4usOsTurutKpS3IkHNc1xhXgh88NzKztwFBTvlgFf_SaeHjBpk6ALjbR6qHXrOWF9LtRhBjlO2Ubh31qzHkJdnkOigrAFitDNQGb4H-treN8NOFVCLFXz3upyA5S89vpjew7SqZ8mtyUtjWJHA?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" height=\"159\" width=\"216\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tourism Dirham to be paid directly to hotel (AED 15-25 per day per room)</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, beverages, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any parking &amp; toll charges for full day private vehicle at disposal</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any meals &amp; beverages unless and otherwise specifically mentioned</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional sightseeing charges or extra usage of vehicle</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any additional charges arising due to natural calamities, political disturbances, etc</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anything else not specifically mentioned in the inclusions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mandatory TCS at 5% of Package Cost (as per RBI wef 1st&nbsp;Oct 2020, for all foreign remittances for travel outside India, a TCS of 5% is to be collected. A TCS Certificate against the same will be issued to traveler and the same can be claimed while filing ITR)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TOUR ITINERARY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 1: ARRIVAL AT DUBAI, PICK UP TRANSFER, DHOW CRUISE&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Dubai- The city of Gold!</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upon arrival at Dubai, meet and greet at the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check In and some time to rest.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 7PM, proceed for Dhow Cruise to experience something that is inexplicable and beyond your imagination with our 2-hour classy cruise. The Venetian styled canal will leave you and your loved ones impressed. This traditional dhow will offer you the best views of modern Dubai from the most unexpected angles. Witness the glorious architecture of Dubai that the world acknowledges while you feast on the international cuisines. An elegant and sophisticated setting will elevate your cruising experience and leave you with lovely memories to cherish for a lifetime. Entertainment will be arranged onboard, and you will be cruising while enjoying the savory dishes and drink. The stunning view, sumptuous meals and the live entertainment will give you a dazzling experience.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Return to hotel and overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe9E2UOxPyn3PyBd9IGfv7XKrPyDajrNo7bcx6AoaAyVbjfqqUYh06o3a3zqOPsq2Y9d6ef6N1bRbgpJkOqo7bysStaw6C2IYzKfIF1YjgZPsgqwGRQvKkW2tJr-dPibULrVFeN7EMrKKG-DjYBLA?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" height=\"368.94412802361245\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 2: DUBAI CITY TOUR | DUBAI MALL &amp; BURJ KHALIFA</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the morning after breakfast, proceed for a city tour of Dubai.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our 4-hour Dubai city tour would take you to the most prominent places in Dubai. You also get to see two different sides of Dubai, the historical one and the modern one. Beginning with the Dubai Museum, located in the Al Fahidi Fort (built in the 18th century), you get to see Dubai before it discovered oil and became the power city it is today. This is followed by a drive along the Dubai Creek, which is a historical area and still holds remnants of the past. You get to enjoy Arabic architecture with a visit to Jumeirah Mosque, which is the only mosque in Dubai open to non-Muslims. So, make the most of it. While the historical part of the city is quite interesting, your Dubai city tour would not be complete if you do not see its modern side.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later in the evening around 4PM, proceed to Dubai Mall, spend some time there.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After this, make your way to the 124th floor of Dubai\'s Burj Khalifa, the tallest of all the buildings in the world, standing tall and proud amongst the other skyscrapers of the city. One of the major landmarks of the city, the interiors of the Burj is as majestic as the steely exterior. During the tour, you are shown a multimedia presentation about the history of Dubai as well as the story of the construction of the building. Once you have gathered information about this tall structure, you are taken to the 124th floor observation deck on the fastest elevator. Here you get a chance to have a 360-degree panoramic view of the entire city of Dubai.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXea-l2z0i2OWj-F6WpRTZZtYI-yLj6ZOzl8qxZIdUJl7uuVzfH_mITQZa-3ffDFyt6EAW2FiQ3HBaCOBfslJp4xgcB9YivsU-uC8MCn-_l68JdkcoJykl1fIoK0lyd5jaRyJAfdU5Hf8IuuT73SCtk?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, building, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"447.48654752279253\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later, at around 7PM, see the spectacular Fountain Show at the Lake beside Dubai Mall. This is an open to public show so just look for a comfortable spot at the edge of the lake and enjoy the mesmerizing musical extravaganza. After this you have time at leisure for dinner at Dubai Mall (at your own expense) and return to the hotel by 9PM.Overnight at the hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 3: DUBAI FRAME | DESERT SAFARI</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> proceed to explore the Dubai frame: Standing tall at 150 m, Dubai Frame provides a bird’s eye view of the city\'s famous and spectacular skyline, you can experience the views of Old and New Dubai and see how the city has transformed to a one of a kind metropolitan.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfx84dyqwixpavjppB5CPPOQ0lg_KGs_h2mx2Orc2sfzCgjr8BB9Q5y4n_Oczx0XS_jvOvz2sS2gtPeLQ9qMR7WGvT3xPHLM6kTtrrV_rQAcwVZZKeBB_kgciDqdLR0csgdprypfAvSzhzQU9yQkFk?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" alt=\"A picture containing sky, outdoor, track, city\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"418.9651560645206\" width=\"669.0000000000001\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Later at around 2PM, proceed to enjoy Dubai Desert Safari. Our desert safari trip includes spending a few hours’ time in a Bedouin style tent, right in the middle of the desert. The tour begins with our vehicle picking you up from your hotel and driving you down to the outskirts of the desert. Once you arrive at the desert campsite, you can enjoy riding a camel, smoking a flavoured shisha, drinking the traditional Arabic coffee, enjoying the captivating belly dance and Tanura dance. Do not miss the chance to take some breath-taking pictures of the desert in your camera, especially during sunset. The colours of the setting sun on the sands would leave you mesmerized. Apart from this, you can try out the traditional costumes, get a henna tattoo and enjoy a delicious buffet dinner. After the dinner, you would be dropped back to your place of stay. Overnight at hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd11GnIjc4-2bnCc6SrdJkiYdY2dOHcP8znaMNgOZmJAPqxWDylXMxwutfhUGfgETQXJk6KCWkGkwJYae1aKm8cy88u4lBibk0WTt6EMtbxHCKE5mGz7rtOieRsXn72hmT4x-LuxoRLXXj1LLh8haU?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" alt=\"A picture containing dune\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"351.2316601863055\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 4: TRANSFER TO ABU DHABI, ABU DHABI CITY TOUR WITH GRAND MOSQUE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Today after an early breakfast, checkout and proceed for the full-day trip to Abu Dhabi. After a pickup from your</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">centrally located hotel in Dubai, we’ll head you for the Abu Dhabi city tour. Explore some of the capital city’s most</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">legendary sights on this comprehensive tour. Travel through the serene Saadiyat Island and enjoy a stopover at Date</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Market. This is followed by a drive along the picturesque Corniche area and then a photo op at Emirates Palace Hotel.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Next in the itinerary is a trip to the massive and all-white Sheik Zayed Mosque, also known as Grand Mosque. Immerse</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">in its tranquil ambiance, admire the breathtaking architectural style, and catch exquisite views of such prized exhibits as gold chandeliers meticulously studded with Austrian Swarovski crystals.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This full-day tour blending culture, modernity, and heart racing thrill comes to an end with a convenient drop off to your location in Abu Dhabi. Overnight stay at Abu Dhabi Hotel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfjv0VHxMj8DnxrY_S8nD1xZ2ol7i6AYYzEie1Fj-CJ9v2W8rYA2kLFVyJ2UNQoDYKkFmZX-3vJ3ywtLvVMgTJ9W2IaG72wEO46uk2y423ofGtqxJP3KKs4HSqCs5dsAkHYXHSJiP2Kji-FGkg0u5A?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" alt=\"A white building with towers\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated with low confidence\" height=\"446.07880304293985\" width=\"669\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 5: 2 DAYS ANY 2 PARK ACCESS&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After your breakfast, proceed to the park using Shuttle Service (on your own) and spend the entire day.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DAY 6: 2 DAYS ANY 2 PARK ACCESS | DEPARTURE</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After morning Breakfast checkout and keep your luggage at the lobby and proceed to the park using Shuttle Service (on your own). In the evening around 6:00PM proceed to the airport for your flight back home with happy memories.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">VISA &amp; MANDATORY DOCUMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A Visa is required for visiting Dubai. Documents needed for eVisa for Dubai</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">A passport valid for at least 6 months beyond the period of intended stay, containing at least 2 blank pages.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Digital colour copy of your passport size photograph (43mm x 55mm) taken against a white background. Avoid blurred and unclear photos.</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PAN Card</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Visa on arrival is available for Indian nationals with valid US, UK or Schengen Visa.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">CANCELLATION POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per airline policy and selected fare rules.</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visa Charges (Rs 7,000 per Adult, 1500 per child): Non-refundable&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25% Cancellation charges if cancelled anytime after confirmation but at least 30 days before travel date</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">50% Cancellation charges if cancelled within 30 days but before 15 days of travel date&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Cancellation charges if cancelled on or within 15 days of travel date</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT POLICY</strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FLIGHT (IF APPLICABLE):</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100% Advance</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">LAND PACKAGE:</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At the time of confirmation: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 30 days from date of travel: 25% of package cost</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">On or before 15 days from date of travel: Balance 50% of package cost + Applicable TCS&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net Banking:</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Payments can be made via electronic transfer to account,</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Name: Funstay Services Pvt Ltd</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Account Number: 141705001550</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Bank Name: ICICI Bank</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; IFSC Code: ICIC0001417</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Branch: Marathahalli, Bengaluru&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Credit Card&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">(2.5 % additional gateway charges applicable. 3.5% for AMEX and International Cards)</span></p><p>3.&nbsp;<strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">EMI Option</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;, please check with us if interested&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">UPI Payment&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">Scan QR Code below and pay using any UPI App&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd_9g4k4LIQcn3jq_XSwiCUvKJ_fBRNjly0shHX7gvl988u8swew7Fyey5EhceRD56a2KUZu-2VAZsxydNMzi-JKHFubhlvH5saXPsPE3KAB47WBoEbgJkDMIvwtTJiC1yIsNmbz1s1zAnEX37yk_I?key=zGcCicUSCXRBSt2rnFBSlg\" alt=\"Qr code\r\n\r\nDescription automatically generated\" height=\"83\" width=\"85\"></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The shared quote is valid for next 48 Hrs.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">We are not holding any rooms and final availability will be as prevailing at the time of confirmation.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Standard Check in time at the hotel is 3PM and checkout time is 12PM. Early check in &amp; Late Check Out is subject to availability and at the sole discretion of the hotel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The itinerary is tentative, the days and timings may be changed depending upon availability.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">If any Vehicle is required apart from the mentioned itinerary, then extra charge will be applicable as per actual on the spot. Dinner or Shopping trips will be charged extra.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In an unfortunate scenario of a guest turning COVID positive during the stay in Dubai, expenses related to quarantine and medical treatment, if any, will have to be borne by the guest. Funstay will not be responsible for facilitating the same and guests need to follow the advice in accordance with Dubai Govt guidelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Funstay is not responsible for any flight cancellation, rescheduling, delays etc.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Guests are required to check all details (Names, Dates, Resort &amp; Package Details) upon receipt of confirmed booking voucher and immediately highlight any errors in the same. While Funstay will try to accommodate any correction requests until the latest possible on best effort basis, we cannot guarantee the changes if the same is not brought to notice at the time of receipt of such vouchers.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In case of cancellation due to Govt restrictions, rescheduling or refund will be processed as per resort/airline policy, service charges applicable.</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Sweta Nanda</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Lead- Sales &amp; Operations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ph: +918296645830</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-08-28 08:25:53','sent','<67c5d5d9-b2a7-4032-f4b1-3ebe4edafb3f@funstay.in>','12561',1,'sweta.nanda@funstay.in','[\"booking@funstay.in\"]','[]'),(131,NULL,'priyanka.p@funstay.in','Re: Next Steps: Funstay & Mondee Collaboration','Hi Team\n\nThank you for the kind note. To move things forward, could you please share\nthe package details with us so we can review them and proceed with listing\non our portal? We’re excited to explore a closer collaboration and build\nsomething impactful together.\n\nLooking forward to your response and continuing the conversation.\n\nThanks & Regards\nPriyanka\n\n\n\n\n\nOn Tue, 19 Aug 2025 at 17:52, <mahim.mehta@funstay.in> wrote:\n\n> Looping\n>\n> @ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in <ruchi.sarangi@funstay.in>\n>\n> @Priyanka Ponnamma AP <priyanka.p@funstay.in>\n>\n> @marketing@funstay.in <marketing@funstay.in>\n>\n>\n>\n> *From:* Shadaab Qureshi <squreshi@mondee.com>\n> *Sent:* 19 August 2025 17:17\n> *To:* mahim.mehta@funstay.in\n> *Cc:* Michelle Iyer <michelle.iyer@mondee.com>; Nikhil Raghavan <\n> nikhil@mondee.com>; Neerzari Marthak <nmarthak@mondee.com>\n> *Subject:* Next Steps: Funstay & Mondee Collaboration\n>\n>\n>\n> Hi Mahim,\n>\n> It was a real pleasure connecting with you. We truly enjoyed walking you\n> through Mondee and the Aarna app, and discussing how Funstay and Mondee can\n> come together. We see a lot of synergy in what you’re building and are\n> excited about the potential of creating something impactful together.\n>\n> Here are the immediate next steps:\n> 1. If you could please review the draft contract (attached) and let us\n> know your feedback.\n> 2. Align on the commercials that work best for both sides.\n> 3. Share some content and products with us, we’d love to put them live on\n> the app and test how Funstay’s offerings can come to life for users.\n>\n> Here are the Aarna app links for easy reference:\n> 📱 iOS – Download here <https://apps.apple.com/in/app/aarna/id6744247518>\n>\n> 🤖 Android – Download here\n> <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.aarnaprod.android&pcampaignid=web_share>\n>\n> As part of Mondee, Inc., a global leader in travel technology, we bring:\n>\n>    - 50M daily searches across platforms\n>    - 125M annual transactions totaling $2.5B in gross sales\n>    - A vast distribution network of leisure travel advisors, gig workers,\n>    airlines, hotels, corporates, and more\n>    - Global presence across India, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Greece, and\n>    Thailand\n>\n>\n> Aarna, Mondee’s B2C brand, caters to:\n>\n>    - Travelers seeking personalized, all-in-one packages for new\n>    destinations\n>    - Locals exploring enriching experiences, from short getaways to\n>    weekend adventures\n>\n>\n> Why *Funstay *& *Aarna *are a Perfect Fit:\n>\n>    - Increased Visibility: Showcase Funstay’s curated travel packages and\n>    deals to a global audience actively searching for unique and affordable\n>    getaways.\n>    - Seamless Integration: Present your offerings with detailed\n>    descriptions, visuals, and pricing for real-time discovery and instant\n>    booking.\n>    - Boosted Bookings: Our AI-powered recommendations and creator\n>    ecosystem connect your packages with the right audience at the right time.\n>\n>\n> We can’t wait to see Funstay’s offerings come alive on Aarna and to start\n> shaping a meaningful partnership. Looking forward to your feedback and\n> moving ahead together.\n>\n>\n>\n> --\n>\n> Best Regards,\n>\n> *Shadaab Qureshi*\n>\n> Manager - Marketing\n>\n>\n>\n> Follow us:\n>\n> <https://bit.ly/44nQJGB> <https://bit.ly/3XyotPw> <https://bit.ly/4424N93>\n> <https://bit.ly/44FV9Jh> <https://bit.ly/3PFFDc5>\n>',NULL,'2025-08-28 09:12:56','received','<CANxmMSOOP8ERZ6_8o2tthxsmNbjrtVJ1pQbXLjwVVwroQ7ZdbQ@mail.gmail.com>','11519',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(132,NULL,'priyanka.p@funstay.in','Re: Next Steps: Funstay & Mondee Collaboration','Hi Team,\n\nPlease di